<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Dadatikaa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Dadatikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Dadatikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dad.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Dadatikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Dadatiki maxaafi, dada duuchchixxe dadenshaxee, manjiinxe sannexxe dagaxxeenna cubbotikinna abariink galdumi safeeqicixeenna Magen manjiinxe sannenni welti afeexxe afenshaxee haaso'aan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dadatik maxaaf lame umo umo kaddeexxe kuta'ni dhaabeema dande'a. 1. Hafuura adhdha 1-11 qico'n dada duuchchiixxe dadenshaaxxeenna majixxe sannexxe siretixxe jirtexxee haaso'aan; Addaamixxinna Heewanixxi, Qayeelixxinna Abeelixxi, Nohixxinna balleesammake wodi'ixxi, iittanni Baabiloonike qeerraake kinjiinke minixxi jirte afendaak tenne kuta giddon. 2. Hafuura adhdha 12-50 qico'n; tinni kuta Isira'eelike siretike annuwwixxe jirte haasottaan. Konneer giddii'n edisaak amana ifixxeninna Magenokee afe'eemaxxe ajajenshanni ege'nemeemake Abirhaamiten; ookkoneechchi uduma isike beltixxi Yisaaqixxi, isike beltika belto Ya'iqobixxinnaa Ya'iqobixxe tommenna lame oosexxi jirte itti aandaan. Tinni tommenna lame Ya'iqoobixxi oose tommenna lame Isira'eelike gosati minixxe booson. Tennee tommenna lame Isira'eelixxe oosenaa'n giddii'ninni Yooseefixxa yaane, iittanni Ya'iqoobixxa yaanennaa wele gatteexxa ifixxa oose, insa'neeke mini haduwwinni welti hitta Gibtse'a iyyedagatixxa yaane hudhudhdhi assaan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kunni maxaafi ba'la qicinni gargar hedheeke ardiixxe jirtexxee haaso'eexxe kaddoolenna hara duudhe haaso'aachchi Mageni hujeemmaxxe hujexxeeten. Mageni dada duuchcha dadeexxe jirtexxee haaso'a safeexxi Magen arda ifikee heda uursabaaxxa leellishaaxxa addachchiisa barrisati muuxaan. Konnee Dadatike maxaafi giddo siretenaa'ni muuxamiin qico'n borreessendeexxe yaanek umo kade'eek, dedha hujaakeera'n murteetanna mura woxxisaak, arda ifika akeekaakinna gargaaraak, iittanni insa'nexxe jirtexxa ma'a duuchcha toggi assaak umo ifikenni Magenoken. Kunni olmik Dadatik maxaafi borreesseemeechchi ardiinxa amana itti borreesateenna tenniinni amana hedhoxxe kadde hexxaashsha assateteen.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Dada duuchcha Mageni hitta dadee qico 1:1—2:25</para>
  <para style="io1">Cubbotixxaa abariinxa safensha 3:1-24</para>
  <para style="io1">Addaaminaa'n Nohi qico'n 4:1—5:32</para>
  <para style="io1">Nohiinnaa Balleessamaka wode'e 6:1—10:32</para>
  <para style="io1">Baabiloonika kinjiinka Qeera Mine 11:1-9</para>
  <para style="io1">Seeminaa'n Abirihaam qico'n hexxeexxa horte 11:10-32</para>
  <para style="io1">Annuwwa: Abirihaamii'i, Yisaaqiinnaa Ya'iqoobii'i 12:1—35:29</para>
  <para style="io1">Eesawuxxa Horte 36:1-43</para>
  <para style="io1">Yooseefiinnaa Dayyuwwa isika 37:1—45:28</para>
  <para style="io1">J. Isira'eelika arda Gbitsike boga'n 46:1—50:26</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Dada Duuchchika Ke'ito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Edise Mageni iimuwwatannaa butta dade. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Buttatinna bifa affeemmabaaxxennaa duwwixxemman. Dukkanatinna lumoxxa abbaayya duuchcha buqqeemman, Mageniink Hafuuri wode'eke'n iima shalalisaamman.<verse eid="GEN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Magenikinna «Ifa kaduun» hiyye, ifikinna ife.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:6">2 Qor. 4:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Mageni ifa eloke kadeexxa uude; ifakanna dukkanatenaa'n gargar hiisse, <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Mageni ifa barrate, dukkanatanna hashshate hiyye summa fulche, bogikinna hashshe soodeen taakkaxxe barra kadde.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Mageni «Wode'e wode'ekenaa'n gargaritti hiissito'a dhisendeexxi iima wode'uwwiinxe oddo'n hexxuun» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Tennexxee Mageni dhisendeexxa iima giisseexxi ise iimi darrennaa ise butta hedheeka wode'e gargaritti foye. Hiyyemmashshanni kadde. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Mageni dhisendeexxa iima «Iima» hiyye summa fulche. Bogikinna hashshe soodeen langaxxe barra kadde.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:5">2 Phex. 3:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Mageni, «Iimat butti'a hedheek wodu'uwwi mitte booncho'n bukki hiyyowwaal, bago boginna leellowwaal» hiyye. Tinninna hiyyemmashshanni kadde. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Mageni bago boga «Buttina» hiyye summa fulche; mitteba bukki hiyyemmaka wode'e «Abbaayya» hiyye; Magenikinna tinninna eloxxe kaddeexxa uude. <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Mageni, «Buttini gargaritti hexxeexxe gosaxxa latto duuchcha: badda'uwwa, gumma gummisaaka hiddichchuwwannna giddo sanne affeexxa gumma ra'issaaka haqichchuwwa fulchowwaal» hiyye; tinninna hiyyemmashshanni kadde. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Buttinikinna gargaritti hexxeexxe gosaxxa badda'uwwa, midha, gumma gummissaaxxannaa sanne affeexxa gumma ra'issaaka haqichchuwwa fulche. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Tinninna eloxe kaddeexxa uude; bogikinna hashshe soodeen; sakkaxxe barra kadde.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Mageni «Barratannaa hashsha gargaritti hiissaashsha barra, woggatanna baro leellishaashsha gargari hedheeki ifuwwi dhisendeexxe iima'ni hedhowwaal; baruwwa, haarso, bononnaa wogguwwa gargar hiissaake beesisa kaduun. <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />Kunni ifuwwi buttatee ifaashsha dhisendeexxe iima'n hedhuun» hiyye; tinninna hiyyeeshshanni kadde. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Konne qicinni Mageni lame lumolla ifa dade, shiixxok hashsha ifo'a, lumok ifi barra ifo'a iittanni urjuwwatanna dade. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Kunni ifuwwi butti'a ifaashsha dhisendeexxe iima'ni ugge. <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />Tennee asseechchi kunni ifuwwi hashsha barra ifo'aannaa ifa dukkanatenaa'n gargaritti hiisso'aten. Magenikinna tinni eloxxe kaddeexxa uude. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Bogikinna hashshe soodeen; sholgaxxe barra kadde.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Mageni «Hedho affeexxi gargaritti hexxeexxi daduwwa wode'eke'ni wo'mitowwaali; ci'atinna buttati iima dhisende hexxeexxe iima'ni phirrisowwaali» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Konne qicinni Mageni lumolla wodi'i giddika biniinchanna wele gargaritti hexxeexxe gosachcho hedho afe le'maachcho duuchcha wodi'i giddo dade, iittanni gargar hexxeexxe gosaxxa ci'a dade. Magenikinnaa tinni eloxxe kaddeexxa uude. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Magenikinnaa tenne daduwwa, «Horre; bira sa'we; sanne ha'nooxxi abbaayyatika wode'e wo'mitowwaal, ci'atinna buttate'n bira saxxowwaal» hiyye eebbise. <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Bogikinna hashshe soodeen; ondixxe barra kadde.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Magen «Butta gargaritti hexxeexxe gosaxxa hedho afeechcho duuchcha: horuwwa, biniincha, shiixxaramma lekka godobik me'aachchuwwa fulchitowaal» hiyye; tinninna hiyyeeshshanni kadde. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Konne qicinn Mageni gargar hexxeexxe gosaka horuwwa, gargar hexxeexxe gosaka biniincha, iittanni garga hexxeexxe gosaka godobik me'aachchuwwa dade. Magenikinna tinni eloxxe kaddeexxa uude.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Mageni «Manjo bifa no'oxxe'ninna fakkeenna no'oke'n dando, isinna abbaayya giddixxa qulxu'muwwa iima phirrisaaxxa ci'a, horekannaa biniinchaa, godobik me'aachchuwwannaa butta duuchcha'n moyowaal» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:7">1 Qor. 11:7</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Konne qicinni Mageni manjo bifa ifixxe'ni dade; Mageniinxe bifa'ni isoo dade; manjo labbakennaa meyyake asse dade.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mat. 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:6">Mar. 10:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Magenikinna insa'nee «Horre; butta duuchcha wo'me; ise'nna mowwe; abbaayya giddixxa qulxu'muwwa, iima phirrissaaxxa ci'annaa buttate'ni lubbo afe le'maachcho duuchcha mowwe» hiyye eebbise.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:1-2">Dada. 5:1-2</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Magenikinna manjo «Itate ha'no'aa kado'a butta duuchcha'ni hexxeexxa midha, hiddichchuwwa, giddo sanne affeexxa gumma ra'issaaka haqichchuwwi duuchchi itate kado'a ha'no'aa uwwenne. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Iittanni buttatike hore biniinchi duuchchi'a, iima phirrissaaxxe ci'a duuchchi, godobik me'aachchuwwi duuchchi, lubbo afeechchi duuchchi ito'a haanjaka hiddichcho duuchcha uwweennen.» Tinninna hiyyemmashanni kadde. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Magenikinna dadeechcho duuchcha uude; duuchchiingechchi yo'oshsha elaamman. Bogikinna hashshe soodeeni; jiyaxxe barra kadde.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Iimuwwatinnaa butta iittanni iimate'ninnaa buttate'ni hedheechchi duuchchi konne qicinni dademe muuxeme.<verse eid="GEN 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Magenikinna hujaammaxxa huje bire; torbaxxe barra'ninna hafuura adhdhe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:4">Ibr. 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10">10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Mageni dadaammaxxa dada duuchcha dade bire; torbaxxa barra hafuura adhdhemmaxxee ise eebbiseexxi wele barruwwanaa'n gargar hexxeexxe barra asse foye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Fula. 20:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Addaaminnaa Heewanii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni iimuwwatanna butta dadee qici konneechchinni butti'a hexxeeshshaten; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni iimuwwatannaa butta dadee wodda, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni buttate'n xeena gansiisa gophemmaxxeennaa buttina hujaaki manji hedha gophemmaxxee buttate'ni mitti quuxxiseechchi hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Kaddo malee wodi'i buttin giddii'ni fula'n boga duuchcha shansha'nemman.<verse eid="GEN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni buttina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Buttina: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrititoke laagadinni «Buttina» na «Manjo» hitaaxi hiyyuwa haaso'ake'n weli fakkaattaan</char></note> buttii'in aadhe manjoke asse giisseexxi sano isixxen hedho uwwaaka hafuuranna uffu hiyye. Manjikinna hedho affeexxe dada kade.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:45">1 Qor. 15:45</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni borote'n Edeen hiyyemaake booncho'ni eloxxa hiddichchuwwiinxa bakka qophpheesseexxi dademmaka manjo okko ugge. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni illetixxe uushsho'a gammachiissaaxxannaa itatee'e eldaaxxa haqqe buttatenaa'n lachchisse; Iittanni eloke hiddichchuwwiinke boonchinxe oddo'n hedho uwwaak haqichchinna elo yo'oxxa ege'na uwwaak haqichchi hedhemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:7">Wal. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:2">22:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14">14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Edeeninaa'ni fule hiddichchuwwiinke boonchi giddi'a yaa'a'ni hiddichchuwwa shanshaammaki galaan Edeeninaa'n fuleechchi uduma qoodeme shoole galaana kadaamman. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Taakkake galaanik summi Feshoonitemman; isinna Hawula hiyyemaake worqe afendaake boga duuchcha'ni yaa'amman. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Ookkone bogixxi worqe ca'ittetemman; iittann yo'oshshaa fishshitaaxxi shittonna fiixxeexxi kino okkone boga'n afendaan. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Langake galaani summi Giyoonitemman; isinna Tophphiinke boga duuchcha'ni yaa'aamman. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Sakkake galaanika summa Xegiroos hiyyemaan; isinna arishsho fuldaa darre'ni hedheeke Asoorike bogibaa yaa'aamman. Sholgake galaanika summanna Efiraaxis hiyyemaan.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni manjo Edeenike eloke hiddichchiinke booncho'ni ugge; tennee asseechchi manji ookkonee eloke hiddichuwwiinka booncho hujo'aannaa heqqo'aaten. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni manjo hiyye ajajee qici «Eloke hiddichchuwwiinke boonchixxe haqqe duuchchanaa'ni eetetteke haqichchixxa gumma ittatton. <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />Yaane kinni elo yo'oxxa ege'na uwwaake haqichchixxa gumma ittattoxxa barra rertattaxxee isee ittoxxe» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Lebeexxi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni «Manji qofi hedha eloxxeba'a; tennexxee weli aagaaka, gargaarsanjo isi'a dando» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Duuchchi Woddi Gootti Mageni ci'a, biniincha duuchcha buttina aadhe giisseexxi mitte mittenge Addaami maa hiyyee summa fulchaaxxa uudo'a konneera Addamiba'a iyyedage. Addaminna hedho afeechchi duuchchi'a fulchemmak summi ookkonende kade. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Tennexxee Addaami<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookaan </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Manjo</char></note> horekee, ci'ateennaa, biniinchii duuchchi'a summa fulche.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:20">Kaddo maleee Addaami'a weli aagaki gargaarsanji afemebaan. <verse eid="GEN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Tenneexxee Duuchchi Woddike Gootti Mageni Addaami diiphe cokokki hiyyaashsha asse; Addaaminna diiphenaa Mageni isike cinaachchanaa'ni mitte micco aadheexxi ookkone duwwi booncho'ni maala wonshe. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Widdik Gootti Magen Addaamike cinaachchanaa'ni aadhemmaka micco meyyaxxe asse giisse; iseenna Addaamiba'a iyyedage.<verse eid="GEN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Addaaminaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">«Kunni micci anke micconaa'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 2:23">maalikinna anke maalinaa'n afemeeken;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 2:23">ise labbakenaa'n afendemaxxee'e meyyaxxe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Manji </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hitaaxxa tika afe'eeki Ibritotik hiyyichchi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Meyyaxxe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hitaaxxa tika afe'eeke Ibritotike laaganni labbakenna meyyaxe hiyyaak hiyyichchinni weli fakkaataan</char></note> hiyyenduun.»<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Tennexxee Labbak annakannaa ama ifixxa waalaan; are ifixxeninnaa weli mitteke kandaan; lamiingi mitte maala kandaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:5">Mat. 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:7-8">Mar. 10:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:16">1 Qor. 6:16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:31">Efe. 5:31</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Addaaminnaa are ifixxi laamiing duwwi he'nemman; kaddo malee shooka'emmabaan.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Manjiinxa Ajajema Gopha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni dadeeke biniinchuwwi duuchchinaa'ni bofi yo'oshsha xaqartichchakemmani isinna manjichcho, «Dhugaandinni Mageni, ‹hiddichchuwiinxe bakkaxxe haqqe duuchchanaa'n ittinabaashsha› hoyyee?» Hiyye ise qore.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:9">Wal. 12:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:2">20:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Manjichchotinna bofake'n hitee qici, «Hiddichchuwwiinxe bakka'n hexxeexxe haqqenaa'n gumma ita dandeennanon. <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />Yaane kinni Mageni ‹Hiddichchuwwiinxe bakkaxxe oddo'n hedheeke haqichchinaa'n gumma ittinoqqe; anga ha'nooxxen midde isoo tuqqinoqqe'e; tennee assitinoole rertinaan hiyye no'o xonxommachchise'en› » hite.<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Bofi manjichchotanna, «Rertinabaan» <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />«Mageni iitta hiyyeechchi konne haqichchinaa'n ittinaaxxa yanna ille ha'noo baqqi hitaaxxannaa elo yo'oxxa ege'nati isoo fakkatinaaxxa ege'nemmaxxeeten» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Manjichchotinna konne haqichchixxi gumma itatee eloxxe, illetixxe uushsho'aanna gammachchissaxxenna beekkuma alfatee halchisa'neexxe kaddeexxa uuddeexxi gummatenaa'n aaxxe itte; aro'o ifikeenna uute'naa'a isinna ite. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma lamiingixxi ille baqqi hite; duwwi he'neexxanna egenne; tennexxee Balasetike haqichchika shafa summe buqe'ne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Belese </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tophiyiinke mitte mitte boncho'n egenedeemashshanni Ode'e fakataake, shifi isikinna ute afebaake, gumma isixxinna xe'mtaake haqichchon.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Ookkoneechchi uduma bogi siphphi siphphi hiyyee wodda Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni hiddichchuwwiinxe bakka'ni mammarema'naa Addaaminna are isixxi Heewaan isika hafuura lanqeexxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Mageni edii'n haqqetixxe oddo'n sho'omme. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni Addaami ye'eexxi, «Haba hexxette?» Hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Addaaminna, «Hiddichchuwwiinxe bakka giddo hafuura atika laqennen, duwwitti hedhennaxxeenna sodaate sho'omeenne» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Magenikinna, «Duwwi hexxettexxa ayyete ate'ni kule? Isinaa'n ittoxxe hiyye atee ajajennake haqichchinaa'n ittette?» Hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Addaaminna, «Tinni aninni welti hexxo'a uutettexxi manjjichcho, ise ookkone haqichchinxe gummanaa'n uutee'naa itennen» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Magen manjichchotanna, «Mayee tenne assitette?» Hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Isenna «Bofake anee'e dedhisee'naa itennen» hite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:3">2 Qor. 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:14">1 Xim. 2:14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageninna bofa hiyyee qici: «Tennee assitettaxxee hore biniinchuwwi duuchchanaa'n ati calli badinendeetteke kadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:14">«Godobikinna me'ittato;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:14">baro atike duuchcha'ninna buttina ittatto.<verse eid="GEN 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Atixxenna manjichchotixxe oddo'n, atixxennaa isexxe sannexxe oddo'n naaphumma uggannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:15">isinna umo atika cancaqqaani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:15">atinna tinxa isika idditatton.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:17">Wal. 12:17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Manjichchotanna hiyyee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:16">«Siila'wittato wodda abara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:16">ciniinfattato woddanna wixxirri ate'n bira sa'issannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:16">Tinni duuchcha kadda'naa'n aro'o atika yortatto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:16">isinna atike galchallo kadaan» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Isinna Addaamii'i hiyyee qici, «Atixxe arexxa laqqettexxi ‹Isonaa'n ittoxxe'e› hiyyennexxi atee ajajennake haqichchinaa'n itteettaxxee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:17">«Atixxe buutonaa'ni kexxeexxa buttin badinemeeke kaddowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:17">hexxetteke baro duuchcha'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:17">elootte daffite ita isenaa'n alfitatto.<verse eid="GEN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Buttini qu'muudotannaa utetixxa haqqe fulchuun;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:18">atinna buttini fulcheechcho ittatton.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:8">Ibr. 6:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Dadendetteke buttina'n higgato qico'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">daffa atikinni ittatton;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:19">Buttinake kaddettaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">buttinange'n higgatton.»<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Addaminna are ifixxi hedho afeeke manji duuchchi'a amate kaddemmaxxee ifixxe areka summa Heewani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Heewan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heewan hiyyanna Hedho hiyya Ibritotike laagadinni weli fakkaataani</char></note> hiyye fulche. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni gogiinxa seemma giisse Addaami'ninna Heewani'ni oddeesse.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Ookkonechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni, «Addaamii elo yo'oxxa ege'neeke kadati no'onaa'n mitteke kade'een; ta'a yoona isi anga qeersee hedhotike haqichchonaa'ni adhdhe itati duuchchi woddi'a hedha isi'a hasissabaan» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:14">Wal. 22:14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Tennexxee isi dademeemmaka buttina hucco'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni Addamii'i Edeenike hiddichchuwwiinke boonchonaa'ni fulche. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Mageni Addaamii'i ookko'ni fulcheechchi uduma hedhotike haqichchibaa ayyinna marabaashsha heqqatee Kirubeelinna duuchchii darre'ni wirri wirri hiyya'n giiratishsha bubaaka wolaanttichcho Edeeni hiddichchuwiinxe bakkanaa'n borroti darre'ni ugge.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Qayeeniinnaa Abeelii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Addaami are ifixxe Heewaninni welti diiphe'naa isenna sila'witeexxi Qayeenii'i<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Qayeeni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyaki summi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Iyyedaga </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookaan </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Alfate </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hitaaxxa tika afeeke Ibritotike laagadinni welti weli fakkataake ye'injo afe'een</char></note> ilde: Isenna, «Duuchchi Woddike Goottike gargaarsinni labbaka belto alfenne» hite. <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Langaba isika dayyo Abeeli'i ilde. Abeelinna gedhebo allalaake kade; Qayeeni kinni wiisalloke kade. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Heddo barra uduma Qayeeni wiiseexxe midhanaa'n Magenokee uwwa iyyedage. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Abeelinna mitte edise ilemeeka gedhebiinka beltanjo gedhebi giddii'n aadhe duuleexxi ha'yokannaa elo eloka maala Magenoke uwwa iyyedage; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Abeeli'ninnaa Abeeli iyyedageexxe uwwa'n gammade. <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />Qayeeni'ninna Qayeeni shiqisheeke tolcha'ni kinni gammadebaan; tennexxee Qayeeni lumoshsha aare alba guduunfe. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Qayeenii'i «Aaret alba atika guduunfiteettechchi maye'aate? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Eloxxa assiteettechcho kaddeele albi atik silaanni ifammabaa? Eloxxa assa gophphottole kinni cubbo atixxe hula'ni hexxe gaaddaan; isixxi halcha ate'n mooto'aten; yaane kinni ati isee injifat» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Ookkoneechchinni uduma Qayeeni dayyo ifika Abeeli'i, «Ke'i badda'a giddi'a me'ino» hiyye. Lamiing me'ine ookko gennee wodda Qayeeni dayyo ifike Abeeli'ni ke'e shiye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat. 23:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:51">Luq. 11:51</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:12">1 Yoh. 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 4:10">4:10</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:24">Ibr. 12:24</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Qayeeni'i, «Dayyi atiki Abeeli haba hedhe?» Hiyye qore. Qayeeninna «Hedheeba afeebe'nonni; ani anke dayyike heqqanjota?» Hiyyeexxi hiisse.<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Qayeeni'i, «Maa assitette? Laqi; atike dayyixxi munde buttii'ni anibaa raarete'n hexxeen. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Yoona atike dayyixxa munde atixxe anganaa'n adhdhatee ofo'o haanni hiyyeeke buttina'n ati badinedeetteken. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Buttina hujjottolenna mitte gummichcho ati'a uwwabaani. Bogii'ni boga fulda'ni buttate'n doonsakiyya hitattoke kaddatton» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Qayeeninna Mageno «Ane'n ibissettexxi mura ha'urteexxen. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Kunnise telcho ati ane'e konne boganaa'ni shorriteetten; yoona ati edii'ni sho'omannon; bogii'ni boga fula'ni doonsakiyya hiyya'ni hedhannokenna kadannon; aninni futtiyyeeke duuchchi anee shiyaan.» <verse eid="GEN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti kinni isoo hiyyee qici: «Ayyinna Qayenii'i shiyoole torbaane anga caala halo fulatik xixichchi iso'n geyaan» hiyye. Tennexxee ayyinna isinni futti hiyyeeki duuchchi isoo shiyabaashsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Qaayeeni'n beesisa ugge. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Tennexxee Qayeeni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edii'ni bayyate me'eexxi Edeenii'ni boroti darre'n hedheke Noodi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Noodi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni Nood hiyya «doonssakiyya» hiyyaten. </char></note> hiyyeemmake boga'ni ofo'le.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Qayeeni are ifixxe'n welti diiphee'naa isenna siila'wite Heenooki ilde; Qayeeninna qachcha ijaareexxi summa beltiinke summinni «Heenoohi» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Heenooki Iraadi i'le; Iraadi Mehuyya'eeli i'le; Mehuyya'eelinna Maatusa'eeli i'le; Maatusa'eeli Lameehi i'le. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lameehinna lame melaalle aadhe; Taakkaxxik summi Aada; Langaxxik Tsiilatemman. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Aadannaa Yabaali'i ilde; isinna dunkaani giddo gala'ni ifike horinni godaana'n me'aammake manni'a hundaayyetike annamman. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Isike dayyik summinna Yubaalitemman; isinna suusu'le ufuufammakennaa kiraara ganammake manni'a hundaayyetike annamman. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Tsiilanna Tubalqayi hiyyemeeka belto ilde; isinna sageettotannaa siblo tuma'n gargar gargar hedheeka miya giissa'emmakemman. Tubalqayixxi dayyonna Na'iimatemman.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Laamehinna lamiinxa ifixxa are Aadannaa Seelaa hiyyee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">«Aadannaa Tsiila ha'noo hiyyannexxa laqqe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">Tee Laahemixxe lamixxe are caqasse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Mitti manji anee madeessammale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">mitti qee'lichchi anee gane miidhammale</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">isoo shiyennen.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Qayeeli shiyeeke torbaanele xixichcho adhdhoole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:24">Laameh shiyeki kinni torbaane tamme torbaanele xixichcho adhdhaan.» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:22">Mat. 18:22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Addaami higgeen are ifixxen welti diiphee'naa siila'wite labbaka belto ilde; «Isenna Qayeeni shiyemmake Abeelixxe bakka'ni Mageni labbaka belto ani'a uwween» hita'ni summa isika «Seet»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Seet: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni Seet hiyya «Uwween» hiyyaten </char></note> hite fulchite. <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Seetinna labbaka belto i'le; summa isikanna «Heenoosi» hiyye fulche; eettene yanna'n manni Duuchchi Woddike Goottika summa ye'a safe.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Addaaminaa'n Nohi qico'n Hexxeexxa Horte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:1-4">1 Odo. 1:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Addaamixxe horettek daali konnechchi butti'a hedheeshshaten. Mageni manjo dadee wodda fakke ifixxe'ni dade.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27-28">Dada. 1:27-28</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Labbakennaa meyyaxxe asse dade. Dademmee woddanna insa'ne «manjo» hiyye summa fulche.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mat. 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:6">Mar. 10:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Addaaminna ileemeexxe 130 wogga'n isoo fakkaataaka labba belto i'le; summa isikanna «Seeti» hiyye fulche. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Addaami Seeti i'leechchi uduma 800 wogga tureexxi wele labbaxxannaa meyyaxxa oose i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Addaami 930 wogga ture reye.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Seeti ilemeexxe 105 wogga'n Heenoosi i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Seeti Heenoosi i'lee uduma 807 wogga tureexxi wele labbaxxannaa meyyaxxa oose i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Seetinna ilemeexxe 912 wogga'n reye.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Heenoosi ilemeexxe 90 wogga'n Qayinaani i'lee. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Heenoosi Qayinaani i'le uduma 815 wogga tureexxi wele labbaxxannaa meyyaxxa oose i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Heenoosinna ilemeexxe 905 wogga reye.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Qayinaani ilemeexxe 70 wogga'n Melali'eelin i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Qayinaani Melali'eelin i'lee uduma 840 wogga tureexxi wele labbaxxannaa meyyaxxa oose i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Qayinaani ilemeexxe 910 wogga'n reye.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Melali'eelin ilemeexxe 65 wogga'ni Yaareedii'i i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Melali'eelin Yaareedii i'lee uduma 830 wogga tureexxi wele labbaxxannaa Meyyaxxa oose i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Melali'eelin ilemeexxe 895 wogga'n reye.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Yaareedi ilemeexxe 162 wogga'ni Heenok i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Yaareedi Heenooki i'lee uduma 800 wogga tureexxi wele labbaxxannaa meyyaxxa oose i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Yaareedinna ilemeexxe 962 wogga'n reye.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Heenooki ilemeexxe 65 wogga'ni Maatusaala i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Heenooki Maatusaala ileechchi uduma Mageniinka ora hordofa'ni 300 wogga gale; wele labbaxxannaa meyyaxxa oose i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Heenooki ileme tureexxi wogga duuchcha 365 woggan. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Heenookinna Mageniinka ora hordofeen, ookkoneechchi uduma Mageni isoo adhdhemmaxxee afemebaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:5">Ibr. 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:14">Yih. 14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Maatusaala ilemeexxe 187 wogga'ni Laameehi i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Maatusaala Laameehi i'leechchi uduma 782 wogga tureexxi wele labbaxxannaa meyyaxxa oose i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Maatusaala ilemeexxe 969 wogga'n reye.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Laameehi ilemeexxe 182 wogga'ni labba i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Laameehinna «Kunni belti tenne Mageni badeexxe butta'n no'oxxe hunnatixxe hujenaa'ninnaa elonaa'n no'oo foorfachchiisaani» hiyya'ni isika summa «Nohi»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nohi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni Nohi hiyya «Foorfachiisaani» hiyyaten </char></note> hiyye fulche. <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Laameehi Nohi i'lee uduma 595 wogga tureexxi wele labbaxxannaa meyyaxxa oose i'le. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Laameehi ilemeexxe 777 wogga'n reye.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Nohi ilemeexxe 500 wogga uduma sase labbaxxa oose Seemii, Kaamiinnaa, Yaafeetii i'le.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Balleessaaka Wode'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Manji tenne butta'n hora'n dagee wodda dubartetinna ilende.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:6">Iyo. 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:1">2:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />Eettene yanna'n Mageniinxi oose<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mageniinxi labbaxxi oose </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mitte mitte tikuwwa erganna Mageniinxishsha hexxeexe iimixxe dada hitee tikke'een.</char></note> manjiinxe oosexxi dubarte danchate kaddeexxa uuddeexxi ifi ifi'a eetemmaxxa fi'lite aaxxe. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Ookkonechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, «Manji reyaachcho kadeemmaxxee Hafuuri ank manji giddo duuchchi woddi'a hedhabaan; isik barinna 120 wogga kadaan» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Mageniinxi oose manjiinxe ooseka dubarte aaxxee oose i'litee woddanna kaddo'o ookkonechchi uduma «Nefileemi» hiyyemaak manni buttate'n hedhemman. Insa'nenna edike baro'ni jannummati ege'neme'e gurra fuleeke mannamman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:33">Lak. 13:33</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti manjiinxi balleessa buttate'ni hitta bira saxxeexxannaa isixxe qalbeki hedumi duuchchi wodda fuggoke kadeexxa uude.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:37">Mat. 24:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26">Luq. 17:26</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:20">1 Phex. 3:20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Tennexxee Mageni manjo buttate'n dadeexxee yaade, qalbetinna hansha hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti, «Insa'nee dadiyyo anxe'n yaadennexxee, dadenneka manjo, hore biniincha, godobik me'itaaxxa daduwwa, ci'a buttatenaa'n balleessannon» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Yaane kinni Nohi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo elle alfe.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Nohixxi jirte konnechchi butti'a hexxeexxen. Nohi baro isike'n hedhemmake manna duuchchinaa'ni qullichchake, fuggoxxa hujaammabaakenna Mageniinka ora hordofaammake manjomman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:5">2 Phex. 2:5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Nohinna sase labbaaxxa oose Seemii, Kaamiinna Yaafeetii i'le. <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Ookkone baro'ni butta Mageni edo fuggoxxe hujenni battootte, xaqarotinna ise'n wo'miteemman. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Mageni butta fuggoxxenni hitta battootteexxa afe; kunse manji duuchchi fuggoke ora'ni me'a'nemman.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Tennexxee Mageni Nohii hiyyee qici: «Buttate'n manjiinxi xaqaro wo'mitemmaxxee manjo duuchcha balleessonnaa mudhdheenne; kunse ani manjokanna buttatanna balleessannon. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Tennexxee ati kinni goofer hiyyemaake haqichchinni markaba ifi'a ijaadhdhi; heddo kuta afaashshanna assite giiissite'e giddi gadhii'n dhaphphi assaachcho itti issi. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Isoonna ijaartatto qici: qeerrinne 300 ciqile, godobi 50 ciqile ejjuma 30 ciqile kadduun. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Markabakeenna heellichcho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Heellichcho </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heellichcho hiyya maskoote hiyyateeten. </char></note> giissi, heellichchotinna gimo welti afendammaba gence assitebexxongi mitte ciqile qico haanni assitettexxi waali; konnee markaba sase weli hana ijaaremeeke minishsha ijaarte gamakenaa'ninna hula fulchi. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Aninna iimati butti'a lubbo afeechcho duuchcha buttatenaa'n balleessonnaa buttate'ni balleessaaka wode'e iyyedagannoni; buttate'n lubbo afeechcho duuchchinna ba'aan. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Ani kinni ati'a kako aagaannon; atinna are atixxi, oose atixxinna oose atixxixxi aruwwa markabi giddi'a e'yitinaan. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Atinni welti lubbo gattaashsha hedho affeexxi dada duuchchanaa'ni lame lame mitte meyyaxxanaa mitte labbaka aaxxa'ni markabi giddi'a e'yishi. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Lubbo gattaashsha gosa gosaxxe ci'anaa'ni, gosa gosake biniinchanaa'n, gosa gosake buttate'ni godobik me'aachchuwwi duuchchanaa'ni lame lame kada'ni atibaa dagaan. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Ati ifi'aanna konne lubbo afeechchi duuchchi'a itatee kadaachcho duuchcha aaxxa'ni markabi giddo tuuli.» <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Nohinna duuchchiinxa Mageni isoo ajajemmashshanni asse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:7">Ibr. 11:7</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Nohi'i hiyyee qici, «Konne baro'ni hedheeke manni duuchchinaa'n qullichchake kadde'naa afennexxee ati manjo atika duuchcha adhdhite Lumoxxe Hobolo giddi'a e'yi. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Batto'ebaake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Batto'ebaake: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Batto'ebaake hitaaxxi hiyya adhdhendeek indaakenna Magenokee'e tolchakee shiqaake horenna biniinchi'aten</char></note> horenna biniinchuwwa duuchchanaa'ni labbakenaa'ni torbaane meyyakenaa'ni torbaane, <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Batto'eeke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bato'eeke hiyyendeexxi hiyya adhdhendeeke indabaakenna Magenoke tolchakee shiqabaake hori'aanna biniinchi'aaten</char></note> hore biniinchi duuchchinaa'ni kinni labbakenaa'ni lame meyyakenaa'ni lame e'yaashsha assi; tennee assitaatteelchi gosa gosanaa'n horikinna biniichii iittanni ci'atinnaa hedhoti gattaashshannaa buttate'n sanne saxxaashshaten. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Torbaane barraa uduma shoole tomme barranna shoole tomme hashsha xeena buttate'n gansiisannon; dadeennexxa lubbo affeexxa dada duuchchanna buttatenaa'n birannon.» <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Nohinna duuchchiinxa Duuchchi Woddik Gootti isoo ajajeexxa duuchcha asse.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Balleessatiki wodi'i buttate'n dagee wodda Nohi 600 woggake manjomman. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Nohinna are isixxi, oose isixxinna oose isixxixxi aruwwa balleessatike wode'enaa'ni ganto'a eettene Lumoxxe Hobolo giddi'a e'yine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:38-39">Mat. 24:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:27">Luq. 17:27</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Batto'ebaakennaa batto'eeke gosa gosake horenaa'ninna biniinchuwwinaa'ni, iittanni ci'atenaa'ninnaa buttate'ni godobiki me'aachchixxe dada duuchchinaa'n, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />mitti labbakinnaa mitte meyyaxxa Mageni Nohi'i ajajemmashshanni Lomoxxe Hobolo giddi'a e'ye. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Torbaane barra uduma butta balleessaaki wodi'i dage.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Nohi ileme 600 woggannaa lame agenjonnaa tommennaa torbaane barra'n buttini hundixxi baari iimi'a dhoote; wodi'iinxi muummenna iimii'n butti'a banende.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:6">2 Phex. 3:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Xeenikinna shoole tomme barrannaa shoole tomme hashsha buttate'ni gane. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Eettene barra'ni Nohinna isixxi are, oose isixxi Seemi, Kaami, Yaafeetinnaa insa'neexxi melaalle Lumoxxe Hobolo giddi'a e'yine. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Gosa gosashshanni biniinchakenaa'ni, gosa gosashshanni horekenaa'n, gosa gosashshanni godobik me'aachchuwwinaa'n, gosa gosashshanni ci'atenaa'ninnaa keela afeechchi duuchchi insa'nen welti e'ye. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Konne qicinni gosa gosashshanni lubbo afeechcho duuchchinaa'n mitti mitti labbakinnaa meyyak Nohinni welti Lumoxxe Hobolo giddi'a e'ye. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />Labbakinnaa meyyaki dada duuchchinaa'ni markabi giddi'a e'yeemma qici Mageni Nohii ajajemmashshaten; ookkoneechchi udumi'a Mageni Lumoxxe Hoboloxxa hula cufe.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Balleessatike wodi'i buttate'ni cita belo shoole tomme barra duuchcha gane; wodi'ikinna iimi'a bira sa'a'ni me'eexxe qixxe'n hobolotanna butti'n iimi'a shikki shikki asse. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Wodi'i buttate'ni lumooshsha wo'ma'ninna hunna lephpha'ni me'eexxe qixxe'n lumoxxi hobolonna wodi'i hana shelellisa'eman. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Wodi'ikinna buttate'ni lumooshsha wo'me; iimati butti'a hexxeexxa duuchiinxa lumolla koobuwwanna midde gattebaangi buqe. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Wodi'i koobuwwa buqeexxi iimi'a tommenna onde ciqile wo'me. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Buttate'n lubbo afeechchi duuchchi ci'a, hor, biniinchuwwi, buttate'n lubbo afe le'maachchi duuchchi manjikinna reye mude. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Buttate'n lubbo afeechchi woddi'i gadhi darre hedheechchi duuchchi reye. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Buttate'ni lubbo afeechcho duuchcha manji, hori, biniinchuwwi, ci'annaa godobiki me'aachchuwwi mude; ba'netenaa'ni gateek Nohinna Nohik mini haddonna isinni welti Lumoxxe Hobolo giddo e'yemmake lubbo afeechchuwwamman. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Wodi'i dhibbanna onde tomme barra qico'ni buttuatenaan xe'yeemmaba'a.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Mageni kinni Nohinna Lumoxxe Hobolo giddo isinni welti hedhemmaka biniinchuwwannaa hore duuchcha hede; buttate'ni diidallo diidaleessitaashsha asse; wodi'ikinna xe'ye. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Hundixxe baarixxi muummuwwannaa iimike wodiixxi huluwwa cufende; xenikinna gana uurrise. <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />Wodi'ikinna buttatenaa'ni barra barra'nini shiixxishe xe'ya'ni dage; dhibbanna onde tomme barra uduma xe'ye. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Torbake agenjixxe tommenna torbaxxe barra'ni Lumoxxi Hobolonna Araarati koobuwwa'ni hana dage kiphatte. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Wodi'ikinna tomme agenji qico'ni shiixxishe xe'ya'ni dagee'naa tommixxe agenjixxe taakkaxxe barra'ni koobuwwatixxi xungo leellite.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Nohi shoole tomme barra uduma giissemmaxxe Lumoxxe Hobolotixxa masikoote hula bane. <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />Qoodhandekanna gadhi'a wocci assee; Qoodhandikinna wodi'i buttatenaa'ni bagaa qico'ni eelqe kayya phirrasa'emman. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Nohi wodi'i buttatenaa'ni xe'yeexxa uudatee guugenjotanna gadhi'a wocci asse. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Yaane kinni wodi'i butta duuchcha buqeeshshanni hedhemmaxxee guugenjo Nohi hedhemmaxxe Lumoxxe Hoboloba'a ille iima higge dagge; tennexxee Nohinna anga ifixxa gadhi'a fulche ise'e Lumoxxe Hobolo giddi'a aadhe. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Torbaane barra tureechchi uduma Nohi guugenjo higgeenna gadhi'a wocci asse. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Isenna eettene galgala ejeersiinka shafa ga'mexxe Nohiba illee iima higge; konne qicinni Nohi wodi'i buttatenaa'ni xe'yeexxa ege'ne. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Torbaane barranna tureechchi uduma Nohi guugenjo higgeenna gadhi'a wocci asse; eettene yanna kinni guugenjo isiba'a ille iima higgebaangi gatte.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Nohi ilemeexxe 601 wogga'n takkaxxe woggake taakkaxxe barra'n wodi'i bage. Ookkenechchinn uduma Nohinna Lumoxxe Hoboloka buyyisanjo Lumoxxe Hobolonaa'n hoyyeexxi wodi'i buttatenaa'n bageexxa afe. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Langake agenjixxe lame tommena torbaxxe barra'n wodi'i buttatenaa'n xo'o hiyye bage.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Magen Nohi'i hiyyee qici: <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />«Ati are atixxa, oose atixxannaa oose atixxixxa aruwwa aaxxe markabi giddii'ni fulle. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Atinni welti Lumoxxe Hobolo giddo hedheechcho lubbo afeechcho duuchcha ci'a, hore, biniinchcha, godobiki me'aachchuwwi duuchchi buttate'ni hore bira sa'aa hoboloti giddii'n aaxxe fulchi» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Tennexxee Nohi are ifixxa oose ifixxannaa oose ifixxixxa aruwwa aadhe hobolo giddii'n fule. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Hor duuchchi, biniinchuwwi duuchchi, ci'a, godobik me'aachchuwwi duuchchi gosa gosashshanni hoboloti giddii'ni fule.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Nohi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolchimalcho giisseexxi batto'ebaake horenaa'ni biniinchuwwanaa'ni, iittanni battoottebaaxxe ci'anaa'n mitte mitte aadheexxi okkone tolchimalcho'n ciinceesse. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna fishshaaka tolchiinka foole laqeexxi ifixxe qalbe giddo: «Manjiink yaadi oosummandenaa'ni fuggoxxe'ni me'eeke kaddoolenna midde isixxe balleessa'a hiyyennexxi ta'inni udumi'a butta badabo'non; ta'a assenneshsha hedho afeechcho duuchcha langaxxa birbo'no.<verse eid="GEN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />«Butta hexxee qico'n,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">Wiilsatixxinna bukki asseccatixxi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">Haarsikinna boni; qiidikinnaa eebbinji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 8:22">hashshatinnaa barra hara uurritabaan.»<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Mageni Nohi'a Kako Aage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Mageni Nohinna Nohixxa labbaxxa oose hiyye eebbise qici: «Ille, horre; buttatanna wo'me.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:28">Dada. 1:28</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Hori, biniinchi, ci'a, godobiki me'aachchuwwinna qulxu'muwwa dada duuchchi ha'noo sodaata'ninna bararaqqa'n hexxowwaal; kunni duuchchiingechchi anga ha'nooxxe'n uwwemedheen. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Buttini fulcheeka hiddichcho duuchchi itatee kado'a ha'no'a uwwenneshshanni lubbo afee le'maachcho duuchchinna itatee kadaashsha ha'no'a uwweennen.<verse eid="GEN 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />«Yaane kinni maala, lubbo sixxi yookaan munde giddo hexxeeka ittinoqe'e. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Manjo shiyeeka duuchcha okkone reyemmake manjixxe munde'a ani isoo qorannon; reyeeke manjixxe munde'a isoo shiyeek hore biniinchi yookaan manjo qorannon; manjiinxe munde'a manjo duuchcha qoranon.<verse eid="GEN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />«Mageni manjo fakke ifixxe'ni daxxemmaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:6">manjixxa munde dhangalanseek duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:6">Isixxi mundenna manjiinxe anga'n dhangalaattaan.<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />Ha'noona ille, horre, bira sa'we; horte ha'nooxxi butta duuchcha'n wo'mitowwaal.»<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Mageni Nohinna isinni welti hexxeexxa labbaxxa oose ifixxa <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />hiyyee qici, «Ani ha'no'aannaa ha'noo uduma daggaaxxe ha'nooxxe ila'a kako aagaanneni; <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />iittanni ha'nonni welti hexxemmaxxe lubbo affeexxe dada duuchchi'a: ci'atee, horeke biniinchuwwakeenna ha'nonni welti Lumoxxe Hobolo giddii'ni fuldeexxe, buttate'ni hexxeexxe lubbo affeexxe dada duuchchi'a kako aagaannen. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Ta'anni udmi'a lubbo affeexxe dada duuchcha balleessatike wodi'inni baxxabaaxxa; langaxxa butta balleesaaka wodi'i hedhabaaxxa ha'no'aa kako aagaannen.»<verse eid="GEN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Mageninna hiyyee qici, «Ani ha'no'aanna, ha'nonni welti hexxeexxe lubbo affeexxe dada duuchchi'a, aagenexxe tenne duuchchin woddixxe kako'a beesisake kado'a, <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />anka Dowwichcho duumanchake'n uggannoni; kunni dowwichchinna ani buttatee aagennexxe kako'a beesisake kadaan. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Duumanchi butta duuchcha buqaashshannaa dowwichchi okkone duumanchchi giddo leellaashsha assannoxxe yanna duuchcha'n, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />ha'no'aannaa lubbo affeexxe dada duuchchi'a aagennexxa kako kassi hiyyannon; lubbo affeexxa dada duuchchanna balleesso'a konnechchinni edi'a balleessaak wodi'i dagaba'a. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Dowwichchi duumanchike'ni leelle'naa uudanoxxa yanna duchcha'ni ani buttate'ni lubbo affeexxe dada duuchchi'a aagennexxa duuchchi woddixxa kako kassi hiyyannon.»<verse eid="GEN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Tennexxee Mageni Nohi'i, «Kunni dowwichchi ani lubbo affeexxe dada duuchchi'a aagennexxe kakoke beesisan» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nohiinna Nohixxa Labbaxa Oose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Lumoxxe Hobolo giddii'ni fuldemmaxxi Nohixxe labbaxxe oosek summi: Seemi, Kaaminnaa Yaafeetitemman; Kaaminna Kanaanike annan. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Tinni sasiinxi labbaxxi oose Nohixxe oose kaddaa wodda telcho buttate'n hedheeki manni duuchchi insa'neexxe horten.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Nohi buttina hucce galaammake manjo kademmaxxee woyinete hiddichcho kaalse. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Woyinetixxa booka ha'we machcho'eexxi ifike dunkaani giddo duwwitti diiphe. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Kanaanik anni Kaaminna anni ifik saalibelo hedhee'naa uude; gadhi'aa fuleexxi ifike lamiinge dayyuwa'n kule. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Seeminnaa Yaafeeti kinni ejja aa'ne dugummote'n uggudhineexxi ifike annika saalibelo gateeka biso uundabaashsha udumishsho me'ina'ni ifike annika saala bunqe.<verse eid="GEN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Nohi woyinetixxe bookaxxe machche balleefate ke'ee wodda shiixxok isik belti isoo maa asseexxa ege'neexxi,<verse eid="GEN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />Isoo hiyyee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">«Kanaani badinemeeke kadowwaali!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:25">Dayyuwwi ifikixxe garboolexxe jale kaduun.»<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Isinna higgenni hiyyee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:26">«Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Seemik Magen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:26">Saademowwaal!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaaninna Seemike garba kadowwaal!<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Mageni Yaafeetika boga ba'lisowwaali!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:27">Yaafeetixxi sanne Seemixxe sannenni welti galdowwaal!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:27">Kanaani Yaafeetike garba kadowwaal» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Nohi balleessatike wodi'i uduma 350 wogga gale. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Nohi ilemeexxe 950 wogga'n lummedhe.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Nohixxe Labbaxxe Oosexxa Horte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:5-23">1 Odo. 1:5-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Nohixxe oosexxi Seemixxi, Kaamixxinnaa Yaafeetixxi horte konneechchinni butti'a hexxeexxeni; Insa'nenna balleesaamma wodi'i uduma labbaxxa oose i'line.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaafeetixxa Horte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Yaafeetixxi labbaxxi oose: Goomeri, Magoog, Made, Yawaan, Tobeel, Mosahinna Teraasiten. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Goomerixxi labbaxxi oose: Ashikenaaz, Rifaatinnaa Tergaarmatemman. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Yaawanixxi labbaxxi oose: Elisha, Terseesi, Kitimi, Roodi'i<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heenok Maasoretek qarik borreessuwwi hundaayetixxe Saamarito, torbaane tomme beekolexxinna heenok Maasoreeteke memmekisanjuwwik olmik borreessuwwi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Dodaaniimi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hiyyaan.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Konneer duuchchinaa'n gargar gargar hexxeexxe gosak mini, ifi ifike laagadinni haaso'a'n ififike abbaayya qarqarike boguwwa'ninnaa oddooluwwa'n hedhaammak ardi dage.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaamixxa Horte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Kaamixxi labbaxxi oose: Kuushi, Mitsirayim,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Laako 13 lephphe Gibetse kulaan</char></note> Fuuxi, Kanaaniten. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Kuushixxi labbaxxi oose: Saaba, Hawula, Sabitaha, Ra'imanna Saabanna Dedaanitemman.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mitsirayimi telcho Gibtse hiyyemaake bogan. Raamaxxi labbaxxi oose Saabanna Didaanitemman. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kuushi Namiruud hiyyemaaka belto i'le; Namiruudinna buttate'n jannummat ege'nemeeke siretike worba manjo kade. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Isinna Magen edo worba adamallo kade; tennexxetemman «Mageni edo Namiruddishsha worba adamallo» hiyyenda'nemmak <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Siretike Naamirudixxi mootumma Sina'oori giddo hedheemaka sase qachchixxi galcha Baabiloonii'i, Erekiinna Akaadii'i mitteba abidaan. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Ookkoo'n Asoorike bogiba'a me'eexxi Nenewe, Rehobotinna Kaaleehi hiyyemaaka qachchuwwa ijaare. <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />Iittanni Nenewwexxennaa Kaaleehixxe oddo'ni Reseen hiyyemaaka lumoka qachcha ijaare. <verse eid="GEN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Mitsirayimixxi horte Luudike, Anamike, Lahibike, Naafihake, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />Fetiroosike, Kesiluhikennaa (Filisixeemike ardi'a annuwwa kadeemmake) Kaftoorike ardamman.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kenaaninna angafa ifika belo Sidoonikenna Heexitotike, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />Iyyaabusotike Amooritotike, Gergerisiitotike <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />Hiititichchi, Irreqato, Siinato, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />Arewaadito, Tsemartonna Hamatitoke annamman; udumi giddii'n gargar hexxeexxi Kenaanixxi gosuwwa booncho booncho'n facaate. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Kenaanike ardixxi gabala Giraari ga'mii'n Sidonii'n kexxe'e Gaaza marte geltaa qico'niten; ookko'n Soodoomi, Gomora, Adaamanna Sobo'i ga'mii'n kinni Laasha qico'n marte geltaan. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Kunni duuchchi Kaamixxe hortemman; insa'nenna ifike gosatike mininni ifi ifike boga'ni hedha'ni ifi ifinga laagada haaso'ammake ardamman.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Seemixxa Horte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Yaafeetik angafi dayyi Seeminna labbaxxa oose i'le; isinna Eboorixxe horte duuchchi'a hundaayyetike annamman.<verse eid="GEN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Seemixxi labbaxxi oose Elaami, Asoori, Arfaakiisid, Luudinna Aaraamitemman. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Aaraamixxi labbaxi oose Uusti, Huuli, Geterinna Mosohitemman. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Arfaakiisid Sala i'le; Saalaami Eboori i'le. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Eboori lame labbaxxa oose i'le; mitti belti ilemeeke baro'n ardi boga boga'ni qoqqodememmaxxee summa isika Faleeqi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Feleqi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Qoqqoodema </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyoten</char></note> hiyyeme: dayyi isikinna Yoqixxa hiyye summa fulche. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yoqixxaxxi oose Almodadi, Sheleefi Hadaremaweti, Yeraahi, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadorami, Uuzaali, Diqiila, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obaali, Abima'eeli, Saaba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofiiri, Hawiilaxxinna Yobaabiten; insa'ne duuchching Yoqixxaxxe labbaxxe oosemman.<verse eid="GEN 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Insa'ne he'nemmabi Meesha'n Sefaar qico'n hedheeke koobatike borotike boga'nitemman. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Kunni ardi duuchchi Seemixxe hortemman; insa'nenna ifike gosatike mininni ifi ifike boga'ni hedha'n ifi ifinga laagada haaso'amake ardaman.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Kunni Nohixxe labbaxxe ooseke gosa gosati minuwwixxe horteke arduwwan; balleessatike wodi'i uduma arduwwi buttate'n faca'eek insa'nenaa'niten.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Baabiloonika Qeerraaka Mine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Sirende'ni buttate'n hedhemmak manni duuchchi mitte laagadinni mitte haaso'a haaso'a'nemman. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Kunni manni borot ga'ma'ni godaane me'a'ni Sina'oor<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookaan </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Borotena'ni, borote'ni</char></note> abixxine me'ina'ni, Sina'oori'ni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baabiloni'i akeekkan</char></note> insa'nenna diida mitte'ni genneexxi ookko ofolle. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Mitte barra insa'nenna weli'aanni weli, «Amme buttina wodi'ik shanshine qabando; jabaato'aanna giirat gunbo» hine; insa'nenna hinemmashshanni kinjiinxa bakka qabademee buttinna isoo mitteba abidisateenna faara la'oonfante. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Ookkoneechchi udumi'a insa'nenna «Amme boga duuchcha'n xexxeerema waalle qachcha giissinennexxi ookkonenna qeeredhe iima geyaaka mine ijaarre gurra fullo» hine. <verse eid="GEN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti manni giissaammaxxa qachchiinxa bakkanna ookko ijaarrammaka mine uudo'a iimii'n dirre. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, «Kunnise insa'ne mitte ardinsha mitte laagada haaso'ati tenne huja sanfechchinni konnechchinn edi'a hunjo'a hendeexxa duuchcha huja insa'ne dhibbabaan. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Tennexxee amme dirrine mitti hiyyeexxi mitteke'n aaggabaashsha laagada insa'neeka gorsino.» <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'ne ookkoo'n butta duuchcha'n xeere; insa'nenna qachcha ookkone ijaara uurrinse. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna ookko butta duuchchaka laagada gorsemmaxxee ookkoneechchi uduma qachchik summi Baabiloon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baabilooni'i akeekan. </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Baabeli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyeeki hiyyichchi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Dommi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hitaaxxa tika afe'eeke Ibritotek hiyyichchinn welti afemaake ye'injo afe'een. </char></note> hiyyeme. Ookko'ni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'ne butta duuchcha'n xeere.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Seeminaa'ni Abrihaami Qico'ni Hexxeexa Horte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:24-27">1 Odo. 1:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Seemixxe horte konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxe; baallessatiki wodi'i sa'eexxe lame wogga uduma Seemi ilemeexxe 100 wogga'n Arfaakiisid hiyyemeeka belto i'le. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Seemi Arfaakiisid i'le uduma 500 wogga tureexxi wele labbaxxannaa meyyaxxa oose i'le.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Arfaakiisid ilemeexxe 35<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotixx tika 35 hita wodda Torbane Tomme beekolexxi tika 135 hittaan. Wogga'n Saalahi i'le. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Arfaakiisid Saalaahi i'le 403 wogga tureechchi uduma wele labbaxxannaa meyyaxxa oose i'le.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Saalaahi ilemeexxe 30<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotixxi tika 30 hita wodda Toraane Tomme beekolexxi tika 130 hittaan. Wogga'n Eebori i'le. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Saalaahi Eboori i'leechchi uduma 403 tureexxi wele labbaxxanna meyyaxxa oose i'le. <verse eid="GEN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Eboori ilemeexxe 34<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotixxi tika 34 hita wodda Torbane Tomme beekolexxi tika 134 hitaan. </char></note> wogga'n Faaleeqi i'le. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Eboorinnaa Faaleeqi'i i'leechchi uduma 430 wogga tureexxi wele labbaxxannaa meyyaxxa oose i'le. <verse eid="GEN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Faaleeqi ilemeexxe 30<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotixxe tika'n 30 hiyyendaa wodda Torbane tomme beekolexxe'n 130 hiyyende'een. </char></note> wogga'n Raagiwwu i'le. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Raagiwwu i'leechchi uduma Faaleeqi 209 wogga tureexxi wele labbaxxannaa meyyaxxa oose i'le.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Raagiwwu ilemeexxe 32<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotixxi tika 32 hitaa wodda Torbaane Tomme beekolexxi tika 132 hittaan. </char></note> wogga'n Seruginii'i i'le. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Raagiwwu Serugini i'leeechchi uduma 207 wogga tureexxi wele labbaxxannaa meyyaxxa oose i'le. <verse eid="GEN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Serugini ilemeexxe 30<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotixx tika 30 hitaa wodda Torbane Tomme beekolexxi tika 13o hitaan. Wogga'n Naakoor i'le. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Naakoori i'leechchi uduma Serugin 200 wogga tureexxi wele labbaxxannaa meyyaxxa oose i'le.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Naakoori ilemeexxe 29<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotixxi 24 hitaa wodda Torbaane Tomme beekolexxi tika 109 hitaan. </char></note> wogga'n Taara i'le. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Taaraa'a i'leechchi uduma Naakoori 119<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotixxi tika 119 hitaa wodda Torbaane Tomme beekolexxi tika 129 hitaan. </char></note> wogga tureexxi wele labbaxxanna meyyaxxa oose i'le. <verse eid="GEN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Taara ilemeexxe 70 wogga uduma Abiraamii'i, Naakooriinna, Haraani'i i'le. <verse eid="GEN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Taaraaxxi horte konneechchinni butti'a hexxeen. Taara Abiraamii'i, Naakooriinna Haraani'i i'le. Haraaninna Looxi'i i'le. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Harani anni ifik Taara hedhondinni hedhee'naa Keleditotike boga'n hedheeke Uuri hiyyemaake ilemeemmange qachchi giddo reye. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Abiraaminnaa Naakoori lamiingi aa'ne; Abiraamixxe arek summi Soora, Naakoorixxe are summinna Milkatemman; Milkaki gode dayyi Yosiikan hiyyemaa wodda insa'ne lamiing Haranixxe oosemman. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Soorayi ila affeemmabaaxxe manjomman.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Taaraa belto ifika Abiraami, ifike dayyika Haranika belto Looxiinna ifike beltixxa Abiraamixxa are Soora'a adhdheexxi Kenaani'a me'o'aa Kaladanitoke bogika Uuri hiyyemeeka qachchinaa'n welt fule; yaane kinni Kaaraan genneexxi okko ofolle. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Taara Kaaran giddo ilemeexxe 205 wogga'n lummedhe.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Abiraami Ye'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Abiraamii'i hiyyee qici, «Hexxetteka boga waalde, fira atikenaa'ninna, anna atikixxe baxxenaa'n gargar higge'e leellishannoke boga'n me'i.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:2-3">Erga. Huj. 7:2-3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:8">Ibr. 11:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />«Lumoke arda atee assannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:2">atee eebbisannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 12:2">Summa atikanna quba sa'issannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:2">eebbisema atixxi welekeenna geltaan.<verse eid="GEN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Ate eebbisaaka eebbissannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:3">atee badaakanna badannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 12:3">Atixxe daafenni buttate'n hedheek gosa gosak arduwwi duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:3">atixxe daafenni eebbisemaan» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:8">Gel. 3:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Tennexxe Duuchchi Woddik Gootti kulemmashshanni Abiraami fule; Looxinna isinni welt me'e; Abiraaminna Karaninaa'n fuleexxi me'aa wodda wogga isixxi torbaane tommenna ondetemman. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Abiraami are ifixxa Sooraanna, ifike dayyika belto Looxi adhdheexxi, Kaarani he'nemma wodda horanteechcho duuchchanna insa'ne'a ergatemaammaka manna duuchcha adhdhine me'ineexxi Kanaan e'yine. <verse eid="GEN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Abiraami Seekemi giddo Moorehixxe songo'ni hedheeke lumok haqichchi qico'ni mare geyaa qico'n ookkonee bogi giddo me'e. Ookkone wodda Kenaanik manni okkone bogi giddo hedhaamman. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Abiraami'n leelleexxi «Konne boga atixxe horte uwwannon» hiyye. Abiraaminna iso'n leellemmaka Mageno magenoonfatto'a eettene bakka'n tolchimalcho giisse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Erga. Huj. 7:5</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:16">Gel. 3:16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Ookkoo'n ke'eexxi Beeti'eelinii'n boroti darre'n hedheeke koobatike bogibaa me'e; Beetelik qachchi dhidhimake'n, Ayik qachchi kinni boroti darre'ni gatee'naa eettene oddo'ni dunkaane olte; Ookkonna tolchimalcho giisseexxi Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ye'edhe. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Ookkoo'n ke'eexxi Abiraami mittebaa'n mitteba'a godaana'ni «Negeebi'a»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:9: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Negeebi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni Negeebi hiyya Kanaan bog giddo bita'i darre'n afemaake gammojjichcha boga hiyyaten. </char></note> me'e.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abiraami Gibtseke Boga'n</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Eettene yanna'n Kanaani boga'n solo'i e'ye; solo'ikinna jabaata'ni me'eemmaxxee solo'iinxi yanna saxxaa qico'ni Abiraami ookko hedho'a adadde Gibtse me'e. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Gibtse genno'a he'nnee'na Abiraami are ifixxa Sooraa'a hiyyee qici, «Ati danchate kaddettaxxee ege'neenen, <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Gibtseki manni atee uudoole, ‹Tinni isixxe are› hiyyee ane shiye atee walaani. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Tennexxee anee eloxxe illen undaashshannaa shinnabaashsha ‹Ani isixxe dayyon› hiyyi» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:2">Dada. 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:7">26:7</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Abiraaminna Gibtse geyee wodda Gibtsek manni Abiraamixxa are hara danchate kaddeexxa afe. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Feri'oonk ja'laabuwwinna ise uundee wodda danchumma isexxa Feri'ooni'n saanda'n odeessine; iseenna isike mootomatike mine'n iyyemare. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Isexxee hiyyeexxi Faari'ooni Abiraami'a eloxxa asse, gedhebo, re'e, lalo, labbaxxa meyyaxxa harre, labbakannaa meyyaka erganjuwwannaa gaaluwwa ise'a uwwe.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Abiraamixxa are Sooraxxe hiyyeexxi Feri'ooninnaa isika mini hado hara elobaaxxe balanni gane. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Feri'ooni Abiraamii'i ye'iseexxi «Abboo ane'n maa tenne assitette? Isee are atixxe kaddeexxa ane'n kula gophpheettak? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Maayete ise anxe dayyonni hiteette? Ise adhdheennachchi anxe are assedhonnaatemman; ta'a are atixxi kunnise adhdhite me'i» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Feri'ooni Abiraamixxe ifike manna ajaajje; insa'nenna isoonna are isixxa afemmachchi duuchchinninni welt bogakenaa'n fulchine.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Abiraaminna Looxi Gargar Hinge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Abiraami are ifixxannaa afeechcho duuchcha adhdheexxi Gibtsee'ni Negeebi'a me'e, Looxxinna isinni welt hedhemman. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Abiraaminna hork birretinna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Birre: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Birre Abiraamike baro'n maallaqiinsha la'oonfantaamake sibiljon </char></note> worqeti hara dureessa manjomman.<verse eid="GEN 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Abiraami Negeebii'ni ke'eexxi mitte boonchii'n mittebaa mammarema'n edi wodda dunkaane olteexxe Beeti'eeli'a me'e; Beeti'eelixxenna Ayixxe oddo'ni hexxeexxe bakkaba geye; <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />Tinni bakkanna taakkaxxa tolchimalcho giisseemmaxxe bakkamman. Ookkonna Abiraami Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ye'edhe.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Abiraaminni welti me'a'nemmaki Looxi gedhebo, re'e lalokanna dunkaanuwwa afeemman. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Kaddo malee Abiraaminna Looxi welti he'na'nemma wodda anfeemmachchi hara birasa'eemmaxxee mitteba hedha dandenneba'a. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Tennenaa'n kexxeexxa Abiraamixxenna Looxixxe allalisanoxxe oddo'n loli ke'e; ookkone baro Kenaanitonna Feeriizito ookkone boga'n hexxa'nemman.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Abiraaminna Looxii hiyyee qici, «No'o mitte hado kandennaxxee atixxennaa anxe oddo'n yookaan no'oxxe allalisanoxxe oddo'ni loli hedha hasissaabaan. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Kunnise uuddaatteshshanni butta ba'laxxenni; gargar hingonole eloxxen; ati bita'i darre fi'litottole ani middi darre'n me'annon; ati middi darre fi'litottole ani bita'i darren me'annon» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Looxi elqe kayya uudee wodda Zo'aari qico'n hedheek Yordaanoosixxe Dhooqaki bogi Duuhchi Woddike Goottixxe hiddichchuwwiinxe bakkashsha yookaan Gibtseke bogishsha wodi'i callike kadeexxa afe. Looxi tennee hedeek Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Soodoomikanna Gomoraka qachchuwwa balleeseba edi darremman. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Tennexxee Looxi Yordaanoosika Dhooqatika boga duuchcha fi'leexxi borotiba'a me'e. Konne qicinni lamiingi manni gargar hinge. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abiraami Kenaanike boga'n ofo'le; Looxi kinni dhooqate'ni hedheeke qachchuwwixxe oddo'ni Soodoomike qachchi qarqara dunkaane olte. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Soodoomik manni kinni fuggaaleessakennaa Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo lumooshsha cubbo hujaammakemman. <verse eid="GEN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Looxi Abiraaminaa'n gargar higeechchinn uduma Mageni Abiraami'i «Hexxetebaa'n middi'aannaa bita'i'a borotibaannaa dhidhimiin darre'n hedheeka boga duuchcha dhaphphite uudi. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Konnee uuddaateka boga ati'aannaa atixxe horte'a duuchchi woddi'a uwwaaneken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Erga. Huj. 7:5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Horte atixxa buttatike maanchishsha bira sa'issannon; ayyinna buttatika maancha dande'e laakko'a dande'ammabaashshanni atixxi hortenna laakkossake dandessissabaaxxe kaddaan. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Yoona konne boga ati'aa uwwaannaxxee'e kexxettexxi konne bogi giddo duuchcha'n marem» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Tennexxee Abiraami dunkaane ifixxa golsheexxi Kebiroon hexxeexxe Maamirexxe songoxxe haqqe bira ofo'le, ookkonna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolchimalcho giisse.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Abiraami Looxxi Booji'otenaa'n Hiisse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Eettene yanna'n Sina'oorik<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">laakkossa 9 hexxeexxa Baabiloonii'i mitteba abideexxi Baabiloonite leellishshaan.</char></note> moyanji Amrafeeli, Elasaarik moyanji Ariyooki, Elaamiki moyanji Kalodogomirinnaa, Goyiki moyanji Tidi'aal, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />Soodoomika moyanjo Beera'i, Gomorika moyanjo Biirishaa'i, Adaamaka moyanjo Shini'aabi, Tseboyika moyanjo Seembeerinna Zo'aarite hiyyendaaxxe Beele'ixxe moottitteman. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Kunni ondiingi moyanjuwwi ififika loliinke manna abixxe welt guddiyyot edi wodda Sidiinixxe Dhooqa ta'axxe yanna'n Maxinetixe Abbaayya hiyyendaaxxe dhooqa'ni bukkiyye. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Kunni ondiingi moyanjuwwi tommenna lame wogga duuchcha Kolodogormeer hunda galleemman. Yaane kinni Tommenna sakkaxxe wogga'ni iso'n jalline.<verse eid="GEN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Tommenna sholgaxxe wogga'n Kolodogomeerinna isinni welt guddemmak moyanjuwwi ifi fike loliinke manni duuleexxi Raafayito Asitaaroti Qarnayiim giddo, Zuuzito Haami giddo, Eemito Seewi Qiriyaatayim giddo, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />Hooritotanna koobatika boga Seeyir giddo Elifaaraan hiyyendaaxxe qiila gammoojje qico'n shorrine injifante. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma insa'nenna Qaadesi'a illee iima hinge dange. Qaadesiki summi edi wodda Eyimishiphatemman. Insa'nenna Amaaleqitotika boga duuchchanna Hazoorin Taamar giddo hexxeexxa Amoorito lolle injifante.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sedoomik moyanji, Gomorak moyanji, Adaamaki moyanji, Seboyik moyanjinna, Zo'aar hiyyendeexxe Beela'ik moyanji, ifi ifika loliinka manna Sidimixxe dhooqa'n bukki assine lolle. <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />Kunni ondi moyanjuwwi Kolodogomeeri'i Elasarik moyanjo'n, Tidaali'i Go'imike moyanjo'n, Amirafeeli'i Sina'oorke moyanjo'ninna Ariyooki'i Ilasaarike moyanjo'n konne shoole moyanjuwwa'n duuleexxi lole. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Sidimixxe dhooqa'ni heddo faariinxi baluwwa wo'mitemmaxxee Sedoomikinna Gomorak moyanjuwi bagedokenaa'n baajaa wodda konne moyanjuwwinaa'n eettene baluwwa giddo ibe; gateekiir kinni koobuwatiba'a baaje. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Shoolinge moyanjuwwi Sedoomikenna Gomorake qachchi giddo itti futti hineexxa karranna ita duuchcha booji'e me'e. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Abiraamike dayyik belt Looxi Sedoomike qachchi giddo hedha'nemmaxxee isoonna afeechcho duuchchinni welt boojine me'ine.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Yaane kinni eettene booji'emebaak gateek mitti manjichchi dageexxi kaddeexxa yaane duuchcha Ibirichcho Abiraami'n kule; eettene yanna Abiraami Amoorichcho Maamirexxe songo'ni hexxemmnaxxe lumolla haqqe bira hedhaammani; Maamirenna lami isik dayyuww Eshikoolinna Awunna Abiraamike bagedii woddike jaajuwwamman. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Abiraami ifike dayyika belti Looxii boojimeexxa laqeechchi uduma baxxe isixxe'n ileme nophphe bagediinxa adhe barateeka 318 manna'n loliinka miya ka'lisheexxi ookkone shoole moyanjuwwika hasito Daani qico'ni hordofe mare. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Abiraaminna hashsha ifika loliinka manna qorbi qorbinni fulcheexxi hashsha naapha adhe injifate; Demasiqonaa'n middi darre'n hexxeexxe Hoba hiyyendaaxxe bakka qico'ninna hordofa'n shorre. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Abiraami naaphi booji'emmaxxa booji'o duuchchanna ifike dayyika belto Looxi'i isixxe karranninni hiissiise. Iittanni melaalletanna wele booji'ememmaka manna duuchcha wirri asse hiissise. <verse eid="GEN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Abiraami Kolodogomorinna isinni welti hedhemmake moyanjuwwa injifate ille iima hingee wodda Sedoomik moyanji «Moyanjiinxe Dhooqa» hiyyendeexxe Seewixxe dhooqa'n iso'o qophedho'a fule mare. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Lumoke Magenike qeesichcho kadeemmak Saaleemiki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iyyerusaalemi</char></note> moyanji Melketsedeqinna Abiraami'a waasakanna woyinetixxa booka aadhe dage.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18-20</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:1-10">Ibr. 7:1-10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />Isinna Abiraaminna hiyye eebbisee qic,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 14:19">«Iima butta dadeek Lumoki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 14:19">Magen Abiraami'i eebbiso'o.<verse eid="GEN 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Naapha atika sa'isse anga atixxe'n uwweek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 14:20">Lumok Mageni saademowwaali» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 14:20">Abiraaminna iyyedageexxe booji'o duuchchinaa'n tommekenaa'n mitte anga Melketsedeqi'a uwwe.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Sedoomik moyanjinna Abiraami'i «Booji'ot alfitettexxa karra duuchcha ifi'anni adhdhi; manjo anka calla ani'a uwwi» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Abiraaminna Sedoomike moyanjo'n hiyyee qic: «Iimatannaa butta dadeeki Lumok Mageni anga anxa ke'isse kakata'n <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />‹Abiraamii duroonsennek anten› hitabexxoshsha filiinxe shimala yookaan kophetika uusuranjo midde atichchinaa'n adhdhabonon. <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Tennexxee ani ifi'a mittelchonna adhdhabo'no; anki loliinki manni itteechchonna aninni welti hedhemmak Awunaan Eshikoolinnaa Maamire ifi ifika qoobbo adhdhinowwaal» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Mageni Abiraaminn Aageexxa Kako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddike Goottik hiyyichchi Abiraami'n waleellati dageexxi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 15:1">«Koo Abiraam mee sodaat!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 15:1">Ani atixxe wonten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 15:1">lumoki hiri atiki anenden» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Abiraaminna hiyyee qici: «Ee Lumoke Duuchchi Woddike Gootta maa ani'a uutaatte? Ani ila belo gateennaxxee anxa karra dhaalak Demasiqoke manjo Eli'eezerten» <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Abiraaminna, «Ati ane'e ila hoyyexxettaxxe karra anxa dhaalak anke minike eraganjon» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddike Goottik hiyyichchi iso'n dageexxi, «Kunni manjichchi atee dhaalabaan; yaane kinni gudeeda atikenaa'n fuleenge atee dhaalaan» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Abiraamii gadhi'a fulcheexxi «Iimi'a uudi» ookkoneechchi uduma «Dandeettottole urjuwwa laakko'i horte atixxinna iittanni bira saxxaan» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Abiraami Duuchchi Woddika Gootta amane; amana isixxinna qullummate'n laakko'ende.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Abiraami hiyyee qici, «Konnee boga dhaaldotta'a ati'a uwwonna'a Keledatotike boginaa'n Uurinaan atee fulchennek Duuchchi Woddik Gootti anten» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Yaane kinn Abiraaminna, «Lumooka Duuchchi Woddika Gootta kunni bogi anke kadaaxxa hitta ege'nanno?» Hiyye isoo qore.<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, «Sase woggaxxa raada, sase woggaxxa recconnaa, sase woggaka gedhechcho iittanni kinni faachchixxa amannaa guugenjo ani'a iyyedagi» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Abiraaminna konneechcho duuchcha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqishe, qixxe lame lameba hacaqqi asse fulcheechchi uduma hacaqqi assemeeka mitte mittinge lame dala'n, mitte mittinge kallachcha'n ugge; ci'a kinni lameba hacaqqi assebaangi iittanni waale. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Allaattuwwatinna konne lame lameba hacaqqi assememmaka maala itto'a daggaa wodda Abiraami shorre.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Arishsho e'ya shiqqammaxxa yanna Abiraami diiphe cokokk hiyyee wodda sodaachchissaaxxinna dimma dukana isoo buqqe. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Abiraamii «Atixxi horte annafee boga'n keessummate kaddaaxxa kokke ege'n; insa'neenna shoole dhibba wogga miiccamik garbumma galchinaan. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Yaane kinni insa'nee garbumma galchemake manna'n ani muranno; insa'nenna ookkoneechchi uduma lumoxxa karra adhdhine fullaan. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Yaane kinni ati wogga goddite edike atike annuwwiba'a nage'ik me'itatton; elo qicininna moogendatton. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Horte atixxi sholgaxxe ila'n konne boga'n higgaan; konne qiconna turtaachchi Amooritotixxe cubboxxi buuda ta'i qico wo'ma gophpheemmaxxeeten.»<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Arishsho e'yiteenaa bogi dukkanee wodda boosixxe giiraxxi wiliillenna buba'nee qaqqasunji leelleexxi lame lameba hacaqqi assememmake maalixxe oddonaa'n sa'e. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Eettene barra Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Abiraami'a hiyye kako aagee qici, «Gibtseke galaninaa'n Lumoke Efiraaxisike galaani qico'n hedheeka boga horte atixxee uwwannon. <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />Kunni insa'ne'a uwwanok bogi Qenaatotika, Qenizatitotika, Qaadimonitotika, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />Hiititotika boga, Feeriizitotika boga, Raafatitotika boga, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Amooritotika boga, Kenaanitotika, Gergerisiitotika bogannaa, Iyyaabusitotike bogan» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s1">Aggaariinnaa Isima'eelii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Abiraamixxi are Soora Abraami'a ildeemmabaan yaane kinni Soora ise'a ergatendaaxxa Aggaari hiyyendaaxxa Gibtsichcho affe'emman. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Soorannaa Abiraamii «Yoona Mageni ani'a ila hoyyedhe'en; akimagaada Mageni ise darree'n finna ani'a uwwaaxxe hexxeen, martettexxi anxe erganjon welt dhiiphi» hite. Abiraminna yaada isika adhdhe. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Abiraaminna Kenaanike boga'n tomme wogga tureechchi uduma are isixxi Soora ise'a ergatendammaxxa Gibtsichcho Aggaarii'i Abiraami'ni heerunsiisse. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Abiraaminna Aggaarinni welti diiphe; isinna siila'wite. Aggaari siila'wieexxa calla egendeexxinna ifixxa giitte Soora'a tuffatte.<verse eid="GEN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Sooranna Abiraami'a «Anke dhedhinaa'n keexxeexxe rakkataannexxe rakkoxxe yaane uuddaak ateten; hanqalfitotta'a erganjo anxa ati'a uwwene; ta'a kinni sila'witeexxa egendeexxinna ane tuffatte; ta'anna atenaa'ninna anenaa'n balleessanji ayyete kadeexa Mageni afo.»<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Abiraaminna Soora'a «Aggaarite kaddoole atixxe anga'n hexxeexxen eetettexxa assedhi» hiyye; ookkonechchi uduma Soora Aggaari'i geebbe; Aggaarinna ise edii'n fulde baxxe.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Aggaar gammoojje qiilli bogi giddo hexxeexxe muumme qarqara hexxee'naa Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:7: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganj: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tenne bakka'n Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik eranji hitaaxxi hiyya Mageni manji hubataashsha isinni leelleexxi haaso'aamaxxe ergana hiyyende'een</char></note> ise afe; tinni muummenna Suuri'a me'ammake ori qarqara hexxemmaxxen. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Iimik erganjinna Soora'a, «Sooraxxe erganjo, tee Aggaar habaa'n kaba daggette? Haba'a me'itaatte?» Hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Isenna «Ani giitte anxe Soora hundii'n baaje dageennen» hite hiissite haasotte.<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganjinna isee, «Atinxe giitteba illee iima higgettexxi ise'a hirem» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Iimik erganji lebeexxi, «Horte atixxa bira sa'issannon; bira sannetenaa'n kexxeexxa ayyinna isee laakko'a dande'abaan.»<verse eid="GEN 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganjinna leebeexxi ise hiyyee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:11">«Kunnise ati sii'lawitetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:11">labbaka beltonna ildatton;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:11">Mageni rakko atixxixxa uudemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:11">summa isika Isima'eeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:11: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Isima'eeli: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni Isima'eelite hiyya «Magen laqaan» hiyyaten. </char></note> hitatton.<verse eid="GEN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Isinna diidiinxe harreshsha kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">angatanna futti hiyyeeke manjo duuchcha'ninna ke'aan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:12">Isoo afeeki manni duuchchinna anga iso'ni ke'aan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">isinna ifike firi duuchchininna weli giba'ne hedhaan» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Aggaarinna «Ane afaaka Duuchchi Woddika Gootta affeene» hiyyati isee yaanisemmaka Mageno isoo Eliro'i hite yexxe; tikkatinna «Anee afaaka» hiyyoten. <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Tennenaa'n kexxeexxeniten eettene Qaadesixxe oddo'ninna Bareedixxe oddo'n hexxemmaxxe muummek summi, «Bi'eeri, Leehayi, Roori»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bi'eeri Leehayi Roori </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyya </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Anee Afaake Hedhotike Magenixxe Muumme </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyaten</char></note> hiyye ye'e: telchi qico'ni Qaadesixxennaa Baaredixxe oddo'ni afendaan.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Aggaarinna Abiraami'a labba belto ilde; Abiraaminna ilememmake belta summa Isima'eel hiyye fulche.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:22">Gel. 4:22</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Aggaari Isima'eeli Abiraami'a ilde wodda Abiraamixxi wogga saddeeta tommenna jaanemmani.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Jila Ofo'latixxa Kako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Mageni Abiraami 99 wogga geyee wodda iso'n leelleexxi isoo hiyyee qici, «Ani Elishaadayi duuchchinxa dande'annoke Magenoni; ani edo mammaremi ci'mema bellonna hedhe. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Ati'a aagennexxa kako jabeessanno; horte atixanna birasa'isannon.»<verse eid="GEN 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Abiraaminna albik buttinake'ni gonbiseme; Mageninna isoo hiyyee qici, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />«Kunnise ani ati'a aagaannexxi kako heddo gosa gosake anna kaddattoxxen. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Heddo gosa gosake anna atee assannaxxee telchinni elqi'a summa atik Abiraami<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Abirihaami: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotikenni Abrihaamite hiyya «Heddo ardike anna» hiyyaten</char></note> hiyyema gatteexxi Abirihaam kadaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:17">Rom. 4:17</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Horte atixxa hara bira sa'issannon; heddo gosa gosake arda atee assannon; boga galchaak moyanjuwwinna atenaa'n afemaan. <verse eid="GEN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />Ani ati'a, atibaa uduma atixxe horte'a ilatenaa'n ilati qici'a duuchchi wodddixxa kako aagannon; konnee qici atikennaa ati udumanna atixxe horteke Mageno kadannon. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Ta'a ati konnee keessummumma hexxetteka Kenaanika boga duuchcha ati'a, atiba udumanna atixxe horte'a duuchchi woddi'a qadaada kado'a uwwannon; insa'neke Magenonna kadannon.»<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Higgeenna Mageni Abirihaamii hiyyee qici: «Ati'a aagennexxa kako ati, atiba udumanna atixxi horte ilatenaa'n ilati qico'n heqqexxinaan. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Atinna atibaa uduma horte atixxi heqqexxinaaxxi kako: labbak duuchchi jila ofo'lowwaan. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Tennexxe labbak ha'nok manji duuchchi jila ofo'laan; tinni jila ofo'lanna ha'noxxenna anxe oddo'n hexxeexxe kakoke beesisa kadaan. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Daggaaxxe ila ila'n ha'nooxxi labbaxxa oose duuchcha ilendeexxe saddeettixxe barra'n jila ofo'ldowwaal; iitanni mine atiba ilemeekinnaa gadhii'n maallaqik hiremeek alagi duuchchinna jila ofo'lowwaal. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Atiba mine ileekenna kadi atike maallaqinni hireemmek duuchchi jila ofo'lowwaal; biso ha'nooke'n kaddaaxxi tinni anxi kako duuchchi woddixxe kako kaddaan. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Biso ifika jila ofo'lebaak labbak duuchchi kako anxa diigemmaxxee arda ifike giddii'n fugussemowwaal» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Mageni Abirihaamii hiyyee qici, «Edi'a Soora'a atixxe areka summa Soora hite yexxoxxe; telchinni uduma summi isek Saara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:15: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Saara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aramayikenni Saarayi hiyya Moyanjiinxe belto hiyyate kadda wodda </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Saara: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotikenni Saara hiyya Moyanjiinxe Belto hiyyaten. </char></note> kadaan. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Ani ise eebbisannoni; labba beltonna isenaa'n ati'a uwwannon; heddo gosa gosaxxe ama kaddaashsha ani ise eebbisannon; arduwwiink moyanjuwwinna isenaa'n afemaan» <verse eid="GEN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Abirihaaminna albik butta gonbiseme oso'lan godobi giddo, «Dhibba wogga manji dande'e finna i'laas? Saaranata sallane tomme wogga'n hitta finna ila dandeettata» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Tennexxee Abirihaam Mageno «Isima'eeli calla eebbise ani'a isoo lubboti uggiteettele» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna hiyyee qici: «Eloxxe, kadduun; yaane kinni are atinxe Saara labba belto ati'a ildaan; summa beltinkanna Yisaaqi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:19: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yisaaqi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni Yisaaqite hiyya «Oso'laan» hiyyaten. </char></note> hite fulchittaton. Aninna isi uduma duuchchi woddi'a isixxe horte'a kaddaaxxa kako isi'a aagannon; <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Isima'eeli'a kadhattettexxa kadha laqeennen; isonna eebbisannon; ile horaashsha assannon; laakkossa isikanna hara bira sa'issannon; tommenna lame hayyooleke anna kadaan; lumoke ardanna kadaan. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Yaane kinni anxa kako daggaaxxa wogga iitteexxa yanna Saara ati'a ildaake Yisaaqi'a aagannon» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Mageni Abirihaaminni welti haaso'aammaka haaso'a bireechchi udumi'a iimi'a meye.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Eettene barra'ninni Abirihaami Mageni isoo ajajemmashshanni belto ifika Isima'eeli, isiba mine ilememmakaranna gadhii'n maallaqik hiremmaka labballo duuchcha jila ofo'lishe. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Abirihaaminna jila ofo'lee wodda wogga isixxi sallane tommenna sallanetemman. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Belt isik Isima'eelinna jila ofee'leek tommanna sakkaxxe wogga'nitemman. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Abirihaaminna belti isik Isima'eel laamiingi eettene barra'ninni jila ofolle; <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />Abirihaamike mine'n hedheek labballi duuchchi isiba mine ileemeke kadi gadhii'n maallaqik hiremeek isinni welti jila ofo'le.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Sase Keesumma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Barra saafo'a Abirihaami Maamirexxe songoxxe haqqe bira hedheeke ifixxe dunkaaniinxe hula edo ofo'lee'naa Mageni iso'n leelle. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Tammi asse uudaa wodda sasi manni ookko uurre'naa afe; hirba okkone'n dunkaaniinxe hulanaa'n ke'eexxi insa'ne yaansiso'a rake ookkone insa'ne uurineba mare; albik butti'anna gonbisemeexxi anga iimi'a ke'isse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:2">Ibr. 13:2</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />Abirihaaminna hiyyee qici, «Anke gootta atenaa'n elle alfoonnole anee garbichcha atikenaa'n saxxe me'itoxxe. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Wode'e iyyedagee'na'a lekka anshexxine ookkone haqichchi hunda qiidiffatte. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Anee ha'nooke erganjiba daggineechchinni jabaattine ora me'itino'a ittinaachcho ha'no'a iyyedago; insa'nenna isoo, eloxxen hitetteshshanni assitaa» hine.<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Abirihaaminna Saara hexxeexxe dunkaane giddi'a rakkee mareexxi isee «Rakke anga giddo eebbite sase hubbuqitte qore shaqaxxa bulle qushshite kebbis» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Abirihaami hornba'a rake mareexxi hori giddii'n mitte munde afeeka kurkura jibichcha aadheexxi qixxeesso'a erganjo ifike'n uwwe; erganjikinna jibbichcha wiinamik duleexxi shiqishe. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Abirihaami keessummatee itichcha, mi'enna iittanni qixxeessemmake jibichchiinka maala shiqishe. Indaa wodda duuchcha Abirihaami insa'nee bira haqichchi hunda uurreemmaan.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Insa'nenna Abirihaamii, «Are atixxi Saara haba hexxe?» Hine qorre.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Isinna «Dunkaane giddo hexxeen» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Insa'ne giddii'n mitti Abirihaamii'i, «Ani dagaa sane iittee wodda telchishshanni atiba dagannon; are atixxi Saaranna labba belto ildaan» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Isi tenne haaso'aa wodda Saara isi udumi darre hexxemmaxxee dunkaaniinxe hula edo uurte laqqaamman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:9">Rom. 9:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Okkone wodda Abirihaaminna Saara lamiingi cimme lumooshsha wogga goddine'emman; Saaranna ildaaxxi yanna saxxe'emman. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Saaranna godobi giddo, «Ani cime bututeennechchinni, gootti ank Abirihaaminna cimeechchi haba hedhennexxe anke aro'inni dhiipho yorannota?» Hita'n osolde.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:6">1 Phex. 3:6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Mageninna Abirihaamii hiyyee qici: «Saara ‹Cimennechchi udumata ilanno?› Hita'n osoldeechchi mayeete? <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Isi Mageni dande'abaaxxi yaane hexxee? Dagaa sane iitteexxe yanna'n atiba'a illee iima hige daganon; Saaranna labbaka belto ildaan» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:37">Luq. 1:37</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Saaranna sodattemmaxee, «Aniqqa oso'lebo'no» hite waakkatte.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Isi kinni, «Waawwo'o osoldeetteqqa» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abirihaam Sooddoomike Qachchi'a Kadhatee qico</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Mannikinna me'aa ke'eexxi Sedoomike qachchibaa adadde uude; Abirihaaminna insa'ne geegesso'a welti me'e. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, «Ani assannoxxa yaane Abirihaaminaa'n sho'annota? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Abirihaami lumokennaa worba arda kadaan; butta duuchchik arduwwanna isi darree'n eebbisemaan. <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Qullittenna dhugaatixxa yaane assiyyot Duuchchi Woddike Goottika ora heqqexxo'a oose ifixxanna isiba'a uduma ifika mini hado ajajo'a isoo fileennen; tinninna isixxi oose tenne assitoole Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Abirihaami'a addachchiise haaso'emexa duuchcha muuxaminba'a iyyedago'aten» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Higgeenna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyyee qici: «Sedoomikanna Gomorake qachcha'n laqenda'neexxi raare hara bira saxxeen; hunja'neexxi cubbonna hara ha'urteexxen. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Insa'ne assineexxi yaane aniba gelteexxe raareshsha yaane kaddoole uudonna'a dirraannen; iittanna kada gophpholenna ege'nannon» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Ookkoneechchi uduma kunni lami manni Sedoomi'a ke'e me'e; Abirihaami kinni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo uurreshshanni hedhemman. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Abirihaaminna Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa shikki hiyyeexxi hiyyee qici: «Dhugaandinni qulliyye manna cubbaaleeyyet welti mittenba birtattota? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Qachchi konne giddo onde tomme qullichchi manni hedhoole okkone onde tomme qullichchi manni'a hitettexxi okkone qachchi'a gattowwaal hitaboxxoota? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Qullichcha manna cubbaalleeyyeti welti mittenba birtatton hiyye hedabo'no; tenne assitaboxxoxxa addataannen; tenne assitottole qullichchi manni cubballeeyyeti welt mitteba muddeeyyote'n; tinni hara kaddaxxebaan; ati butta duuchcha'n dhugaatixxa murte murtattoken» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna «Sedoomike qachchi giddo onde tomme qullichchi manji hedhoole insa'neexxe hiyyennexxi okkonee qachcha duuchchi'a gattowwaal hiyyannon» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Abirihaam higgeenna hiyyee qici: «Ani woyi fulabo'noke buttinanna bululoke kaddeenne hedhennexxi woldo hige atee gootta ankenni welt soda'abelo haaso'ennen. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Akimagaada qullichcha onde tomme ookkone giddii'n ondi xe'yoole, ookkone xe'yemmake ondi'a hite ookkone qachcha duuchcha balleessitatto?» Hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Isinna, «Shoole tommenna onde qulliyye manni qachchi giddo afemoole qachcha konnee balleessabo'non» hiyye hiisse.<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Abirihaami higgeenna, «Akimagaada shooli tommi qulliyye calli afendoolena?» Hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Isikinni «Ookkone shoole tommi'a hiyye qachcha konne balleessa waalannon» hiyye hiisse.<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Abirihaaminna «Anke Gootta ballo mufattoxxe'e higgeenna haaso'aannen; dedha kinni sasi tommi qullichchi manni calli afemoolena?» Hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Isikinni «Sase tomme afonnole balleessabo'non» hiyye hiisse.<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Abirihaaminna «Atee anke Goottinni haaso'eena'a yoona woldo soda'abelo haaso'eennen, akimagaada lami tommi calli afendoolena?» Hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Isinna «Lame tomme calla kadoolenna insa'ne'aanni hiyye qachcha konnee gattowwaal hiyyanno» hiyye hiisse. <verse eid="GEN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Abirihaaminna, «Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ballo mufattoxxen ta'a yoona mittele calla qoraanne; akimagaada tommi calli afemdoolena?» Hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Isinna «Okkone tommi'a hiyye qachcha konnee balleessa waalannon» hiyye hiisse. <verse eid="GEN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Abrihaaminni haaso'ammaka haaso'a bireechchi uduma me'e, Abirihaaminna mine isikibaa illee iima hige.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Sooddoomikennaa Gomorake Qachchuwwixxa Bakka Ba'ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Iitti lamiinxi erganna galgala bogi siphphi siphphi hiyyemma wodda Sedoomi gelte; Looxinna Sedoomike qachchixxe hula'n ofoleemman; Looxinna tenne ergana afeexxi qophedho'aa ke'e albik butta gonbiseme anga iimi'a ke'isse; <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />Isinna «Anxe goottole ballo ane garbichcha ha'nookebaa gorre; lekkatanna anshexxine soodo bariisa me'itinaan» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Insa'nenna «Waawwo'o no'o kaba ba'linnange'n gallannon» hine.<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Yaane kinni Looxi yo'oshsha insa'ne magannise insa'ne kadhatemmaxxee isinni mine isike'n e'yine; Ookkoneechchi uduma waasa ra'ise shiqishee'na inde. <verse eid="GEN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Keessumma diiphphebaang Sedoomike qachchik labbali dargaggeeyyenna geedhe duuchchinn darree'n dangeexxi mine bunqe. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Insa'nenna Looxi ye'neexxi; «Galgala tenne atiba mine e'yeek manni haba hedhe? Labbal melaallet welt diiphphammasha insa'nen welit diinphonaa insa'e no'o'a gadhi'a fulch» hine <verse eid="GEN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Looxinna insa'nenni haaso'o'aa gadhi'a fule; cufanaknna udumishsho cufeexxi <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />hiyyee qici, «Anke dayyuwwa maganneten tennee fuggoxxa yaane assitinoqqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 19:22-24">Hay. 19:22-24</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Kunnise ani lame duuddo dubarra afeenen; isoo ha'no'a gadhi'a fulchee'naa'a hassineexxa assedhdhe; yanne kinni insa'ne mine anke'n daggeexxe anxe keessumma kandeemmaxxe insa'ne'ni fuggoxxa mittetanna assitinoqqe'e.»<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Insa'nenna Looxii, «Ke'i kabaa'n! Kunni manji keessummummati bereqenni daggeexxi telcho no'o'n goottake kaddeexxi tenne asse hiyya'n no'o'n kulaa? Ati umo atinge heqqedhi! Gibbottole konne manna'n hendennexxe yaane irra elobaaxxe ate'ni geltaan» hine. Konne qicinni Looxii darbina'ni hula eenqinaaba genne. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Yaane kinni iitti lame keessumma anga qeerrisse Looxii'i ifiba'a mini'a e'yishsheexxi hula wirri assite cuffe. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma hula haba hexxeexxa affabaashsha gadho minixxe hula'n hedhemmaxxa dargaggeeyyenna geedheetixxa balleessine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:18">2 Moy. 6:18</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Kunni lamiing manni Looxii hiyyee qici, «Konne qachchi giddo atik manjo kadaak, atixxi oose labbaxxinnaa meyyaxxi, balluwwikinnaa weli atiki firi hedhee? Hedhoole rakke konne qachchi giddii'n fullaashsha assi. <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />Konne qachcha balleessina'ennen. Konne qachchike ardixxee Duuchchi Woddike Goottiba'a shiqqeexxi raare lumoxxe kaddemmaxxee isoo balleessinonna'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'oo erge'en.»<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Ookkoneechchi udumi Looxi dubarra ifika uwweemmake manniba mareexxi, «Duuchchi Woddike Gootti konne qachcha balleessaammaxxee rakkineexxi tenne bakkanaa'ni fulle» hiyya'n insa'ne'n kule; yaane kinni insa'nen Looxi roora'neechcho labbe.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Boro haachchabamma wodda itti lame Mageniinxe erganna Looxii'i, «Konne qachchinni mitteba baxxinabaashsha atixxa arennaa lamiinga atika dubarra adhdhite tenne bakkaa'n rakke fuli» hita'n muddansite. <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Yaane kinni Looxi hoodee wodda Mageni insa'ne'a mararemmaxxee itti erganna anga isixxa, isixxe arexxanna, isike lamiinge dubarrixxa anga abiddeexxi qachchi giddii'n nage'ik fulchite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:7">2 Phex. 2:7</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Insa'ne fulchiteechchi uduma erganna giddii'n mitte insa'nee, «Hedho ha'noxxa gattilsatee rakkine baajje; udumi'a uuddinoqqee; tenne dhooqa giddo habanna uurrtinoqqe'e; rertinabaashsha eettene koobabaa baajje» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Looxinna insa'ne «Anke goottuwwa maganneten ookko'a me'inannoshsha assitinoqqe. <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Ani atik erganji woldo ati edo elle alfe'ennen; atinna hedho anxa gatisatee lumo qico ani'a marateten; ani kinni eettene koobuwwaba'a dande'e baaje fulagophannaxxee daggaaxxi ba'ne ane balleessitaaxxe hexxen. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Kunnise ookko baaje fulatee shiqa hedheek shiixxok qachchi hedheen; isibaa baajo; uuddaatteshshanni isi shiixxoken; ookko'a baajennele lubbo gatannon.»<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Erganjikinna iso'n hiyyee qici, «Ishshi kadduun; hitettexxa adhdheennen; ookkone hitaatteka qachchanna ballessabonon. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Ati ookko geltattoxxee mittelchonna assa dande'a gophannaxxee rakkettexxi okko'a baaji.» Tennexxee, okkone qachchik summi Zo'aar.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zo'aar hiyya Ibritotike laagadinni «Shiixxoxxe» hiyyaten. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Looxinna Zo'aar geye wodda arishsho reefi fuldeemman. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Sedoomikennaa Gomorake qachcha'n giiratinna ha'yaaka kinjo ifibaa'n (Duuchchi Woddik Goottibaan) iimii'n butti'a gansiise. <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />Konne qicinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti okkone qachchuwwa, dhooquwwa duuchchanna okkone qachchuwwa'n hedhemmaka manna duuchcha ookkone boga'n lateechchi mittichchinna gatebaangi gube balleesse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat. 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:23-24">11:23-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Luq. 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:29">17:29</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:6">2 Phex. 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:7">Yih. 7</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Looxixxi are kinni udumi'a wirri hite uudde; maxinetixxe sooddo kadde.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:32">Luq. 17:32</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Abirihaaminna langabaro gorsa ke'eexxi edi wodda Duuchchi Woddik Gootti edo uurreemmaxxe bakkaba mare. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Abirihaaminna Sedoomikenna Gomorake iittanni dhooqate'n hedheeka boga duuchcha addadde uudaa wodda boosii'ni tuqu tuqu hitammaxxe wiliilleshsha hexxeexxi wiliille bogakenaa'n iimi'a tuqu tuqu hitaa'naa afe. <verse eid="GEN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Konne qicinni Mageni dhooqa giddika qachchuwwa balleessee wodda Abirihaami qaabbate; tennexxee Looxi hedhemmaba hedhemmaka qachchuwwa balleessiteexxe ba'nenaa'n Looxi'i fulche.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Looxinnaa Isika Dubarra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Looxi zo'aar giddo hedha sodaatemmaxxe'e lamiinge ifike dubarrinni welti ookkone qarqara'n hexxeexxe koobuwwabaa me'eexxi wolo'o mitte giddo ofo'le. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Mitte barra Looxixxi angafa belto ifixxa shiixxoxxa dayyo «Anni no'ok cima'neen; butta duuchcha'n hedheeke mannixxe aadashsha no'onni welt dhiiphaak labballi loola no'oke'n hedhebaan. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Tennexxee anna no'oka woyinetixxa booka ha'winsennexxi isinni welt diinphe'e anna no'okixxa horte sa'issino» hite. <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Eetteneen hashsha insa'ne anna ifika woyinetixxa booka ha'winse; ookkoneechchi uduma angafa belto ifike anninni welt dhiiphphe; Looxxi kinni isenni welti diiphphenna kexxaa wodda ege'nemmabaan.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Langa baro angafa belto shiixxoxxa ifixxa dayyo, «Bereqe hashsha ani anna ankenni dhiiphennani; telcho hashsha langaxxa woyinetixxa booka ha'winse'naa ati marte isinni welt dhiiphi; konne qicinni anna no'okixxa horte sa'issanon» hite. <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Insa'ne eettenenni hashsha anna ifika booka ha'winsee'naa shiixxoxxi belto marteexxi anna ifike'n welt dhiiphphe; maa'nichcho beltonna anni ifikinn welti diiphphe. Looxxi kinni isee isinni welti diiphphe kexxaa wodda ege'nemmabaan. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Konne qicinni lamiingi Looxik dubarri ifinge anni'a siila'we. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Angafa beltonna labbaka belto ildeexxi beltiinka summa «Mo'aabi»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:37: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mo'aabi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni Mo'aab hiyya «Anke anni'a illenneken» hiyyaten</char></note> hite fulchite. Isinna telchixxe Mo'aabixxe gosa'a hundaayyetike annan. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Shiixxoxxi beltonna iittanni labbaka belto ildeexxi beltiinka summa «Beeni'aami»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:38: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Beeni'aami </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni Beeni'aami hiyya «Anxe gosake belto» hiyyaten. </char></note> hite fulchite. Isinna telchixxe Amoonixxe gosa'a hundaayyetike annaman.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Abirihaaminna Abimeelekii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Abirihaami ookko'n kee'eexxi Negeebike boga'n me'eexxi Qaadesixxe'ninna Suurixxe oddo'n ofo'le. Shiixxoxxe yanna'anna Giraarim ofo'le. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Ookko Abirihaami are ifixxa Saara «Ise anxe dayyon» hiyya'nemman. Tennexxe Giraarik moyanji Abemeleki'n manjo ergeexxi Saara iyyedangaashsha asse; <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Yaane kinni Mageni hashsha mitte oojjot Abemeleki'n dageexxi, «Tenne adhdhiteettexxe manjichchoxxe buutonni rertaaten; ise aro'o afe'eexxen» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Abemelekinna isenni welt diipha gophemmaxxee hiyyee qici, «Anke Gootta, mitte balleessa afebaaka arda birtattota? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />‹Ise anxe dayyon› hiyyeek isotebaa? Iittanni isenna, ‹Isi anke dayyon› hiteexxebaa? Ani tenne assennechchi ca'ichcha yaadinninnaa qullitte anganniten» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Mageninna Abemelekii oojjoti hiyyee qici: «Ee, tenne ca'ichcha yaadinni assite'ettexxa ege'neeneni; Tennexxeetemman ati ane'n cubbo hujabexxoshshanna isenninna dhiiphphabexxoshsha assaanak. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Ta'atenna kaddoole tennee manjichcho aro'o iseke Abirihaami'a hiissi. Isi wabeekote kaddeemmaxxee rertaboxxoshsha ati'a kadhataan. Yaane kinni isee isi'a hiissa gophphottole atinna atike kadeek duuchchi rertine muddinaaxxa ege'ni» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Langa baro gorsa Abemelek ifika ja'laabuwwa duuchcha ye'eexxi kaddeexxa yaane duuchcha insa'ne'ni haaso'ee wodda insa'nenna lumooshsha sodaante. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Abemelek Abirihaami'i ye'eexxi, «Tinni no'o'n assitettexxi yaane maachcho? Maa balleessannalete ane'ninnaa anxe mootumma'n iitta hexxeexxa lumoxxa ba'ne iyyedagetteek? Assemiyyo hassissabaaxxe yaanen ane'n assitette» <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Abemelekinna Abirihaamii'i, «Eger, atinni tennee assitettek maye'aatemma'a?» Hiyye qore.<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Abirihaaminna Abimelekii hiyyee qici, «Konne booncho'n Mageno ‹dhugaat sodaata hexxebaaxxa, mannikinna anxe are'a anee shiyaaxxa hede sodaatennexxeeten› <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Iseqqa dhugaandinni anxe godobixxe dayyo kada gophpho malee mitte annixxe oosen; udumi giddii'n ani isee aadhenne. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Mageni anee ajaje'naa anke annike mininaa'n fulee boga boga mammaremaanna wodda isee, ‹Ati ani'a affettexxa jaalala konne qicinni ani'a leellishi no'o marre gennenneke booncho duuchcha'ni isi anke dayyon hiyyi «ise'ni hiyyeennani.» › »<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Abemelek Abirihaami'a gedhebo, lalo, labbakannaa meyyaka erganjuwwa uwwe; are isixxa Saaraanna isi'a hiisse. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Abemelekinna Abirihaamii, «Kunnise ank bogi atiken; eettetteba ofo'la dandeettatton» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Saaraanna, «Kunnise dayyo atike Abirihaami'a kuma sibiljo birre uwweennen; tinninna ati busha yaane hujjeboxxoxxe qullitte manjo kaddettexxe atee uudeeke manni duuchchixxe ille'n ibbaboxxoshshaten» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Abirihaami Mageno soodate; Mageninna Abemelekii'i isixxa are, isixxa meyyaaxxa erganjuwwanna fayyiseexxi finna illaashsha asse. <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />Mageni Saara Abirihaamixxe arexxe buuto'a Abemelekiki mini hadi duuchchika gadaameessa cufeemman.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yisaaqixxa Ilensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyyemmashshanni Saara uude; uwwemmaxxa addachchiisanna ise'a muuxxe. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Saaranna si'lawiteexxi eettene Mageni hiyyemmanxe yanna'n Abirihaami'a cimo isexxe'n labbaka belto ilde.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:11">Ibr. 11:11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Abirihaaminna Saara isi'a ildemmaka belto Yisaaqi hiyye summa fulche. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Abirihaami Mageni isoo ajajemaashshan, belto ifika Yisaaqii ilemeexxe saddeettixxe barra'n jila ofo'lishe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:12">Dada. 17:12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:8">Erga. Huj. 7:8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Yisaaqi Abirihaami'a ilemaa wodda Abirihaamixxi wogga dhibbatemman. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Saaranna, «Mageni ane oso'lannoxxe asseen; tennexxee tennee laqaak duuchchi aninni oso'laan» hite. <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Isenna lebbeexxi, «Saara oose ildee unuusitaan hiyyeexxi Abirihaami'n ayyete haaso'e ege'ne? Kunse cimo giddo labba belto isi'a ile'enneni» hite.<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Beltikinna nophphe unu'na waale; Abirihaaminna Yisaaqi nu'na waalexxa barra jabaxxa jila jile.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aggaarixxannaa Isima'eelixxa Shorrensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Yaane kinni Saara Aggaar Gibtsichcho Abirihaami'a ildemmak belti oso'laa'naa affe. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Ookkoo'n Saara Abirihaamii, «Tenne garbitte isenge beltinninni welt fugussi; tenne garbittek belti Yisaaqii anke beltinni welt karra dhaalabaan» hite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:29-30">Gel. 4:29-30</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Belto ifike Isima'eelixxi tinni yaane Abirihaamii lumoshsha wixxirri assite. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Mageninna Abirihaamii hiyyee qici, «Beltichchinxeenna atixxe erganjoxxee mee yaadi. Horte atixxi ye'endaak Yisaaqi darrenaa'nite kaddeemmaxxe'e Saara atee hitaaxxa duuchcha laqi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:7">Rom. 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:18">Ibr. 11:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Atixxe erganjok beltinna atinge kaddeemmaxxe'e isoonna ardake assannon» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Abirihaami langa baro bariisa ke'e, shiixxoxxa itanna aadheexxi kollonjotike wodi'inni welti Aggaari'n dugummote'n dukiseexxi beltik welt me'itaashsha asse; isenna me'iteexxi Bersaabehixxe qiilla gammoojje'n jeekki hite. <verse eid="GEN 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Kollonjote'n hedhemak wodi'inna mudee wodda belto ifika harumaake haqichchi mitti hunda uggite. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Isenna «Belti anki ani uudaa'naa reyoqqe» hita'ni mogidi darbemeexxi mare geyamma qico bayyatte isike kallachcha'n ofolde; ookkonna hexxeexxi hiiqisse ooxxe.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Mageninna beltiinxa oodhishsha laqe. Mageniink iimik Erganjinna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mageniik Iimik Erganji</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tenne bakka'n Mageniik Iimik Erganji hitaaxxi hiyya Mageni manji isoo'o hubataashsha leelle'e haaso'eemaxxee'e Mgeniinke erganjo hiyyende'een</char></note> iimii'ni Aggaarii eyeexxi hiyyee qici, «Tee Aggaari maa kaddeete? Belti atiki irkatebaa hedhe oodhaa wodda Mageni laqedheen; tennexxe sodaattoxxe'e. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Ani iso lumoke arda assaannaxxe'e kexxe marte belto atika buttii'n aaxxe luu'medhi» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Mageninna ille isexxa banee'naa wodi'iinxa bale affe; tennexxe marteexxi kollonjoke'ni wode'e wonshite belto ifike'n ha'wisse. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Mageni kinna beltik welti hedhemman beltikinna nophpha'in dage. Isinna qiilla boga'ni ofo'le; adamatinna ege'nemeeke kade. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Isinna Faaranixxe Qiilla gammoojje'n hedha'naa ama isixxi Gibtseke boginaa'n manjichcho mitte aadhisse.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bersabehi Giddo Assendeexxa Weli'aaggo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Ookkone sane Abemeleki ifike loliinke mannike ajajallo Fikoolinni welti Abirihaamibaa mareexxi, «Assitattoxxe yaane duuchchinni Mageni atinni hedheen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:26">Dada. 26:26</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Yoona Aneenna anxa oose yookaani horte anxe duuchcha fuggoxxa assitabboxxoshsha amo Mageni edo ani'a kakati; ani addatensha anxa ati'a leellishenneshsha atinna tenne kaba keessummummati ofoldeettexxe yanna'ni ani'aanna anke bogike manni'a addatensha atixxa leellishshotta'a kakati» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Abirihaaminna isoo «Eloxxen Kakatunnun» hiyye <verse eid="GEN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Ookkoo'n Abirihaami Abemelekik erganjuwwi hunnat adhdhemmaxxe wodi'iinxe balexxe Abimelekii aallate. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abemelekinna «Tenne yaane ayyi iitta asseexxa ege'nebo'no; ani'a telchond laqa; atinna ane'n kuldeettabaan» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Abirihaami gedhebokanna lalo iyyedage Abemeleki'a uwwe; lamiingi weli aange kakante. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Abirihaaminna gedhebi giddii'n torbaane goromme foye. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Abemelekinna Abirihaamii'i, «Tennee torbaane gedhebiinxa goromme mayee footette?» Hiyye qore.<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Abrihaaminna, «Tenne torbaane wodi'iinxa bale qolta anxee dhugaa kaddo'a tenne torbaane gedhebiinxa goromme hii'i, anenaa'ni adhdhi» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Tennexxee iikki boonchi insa'ne lamiingi weli mitte afo'o kande kakanteemmaxxe bakka kaddeemmaxxe'e eettene bakkaka summi «Bersaabehi»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:31 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bersaabehi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni Bersaabehi hiyya Bersheba'i hiyyate kaddaa wodda Torbaane wodi'iinxe bale yookaani kakotike wodi'ixxe bale hiyyaten.</char></note> hiyyeme.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Insa'ne weli aangeexxi Bersaabehi'n kakanteechchi uduma Abemelek ifike looliinke mannike ajajallo Fikoolinn welti Filisixeemike bogiba'a illee iima hinge me'ine. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Abirihaaminna Bersaabehi'n «Temiir»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:33 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Temir: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyya hojja harumaake Temir hiyyemaake haqichchinaa'ni gargar hedhe haqichchon</char></note> hiyyemaaka haqichcho kaasechchi uduma ookko bari barika Duuchchi Woddike Gootti summa ye'edhe. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Abirihaaminna Filisixeemike bogi giddo keessummummati qeerraaxxa wogga ofo'le.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s1">Abirihaami Hega Uudeme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Tenne yaanuwwa uduma Mageni Abirihaamii hega uude; isoonna hiyyee qici, «Koo Abirihaam» hiyye ye'e; isinna «Hee kunnina kabanni hedhennen» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:17-19">Ibr. 11:17-19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Mageninna, «Eettaatteka atika mittelcho belto Yisaaqii aaxxe Mooriya bogiba'a me'i; ookko'o ani ate'n kulannoxxe kooba'n ani'a ciinceessite tolchi» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 3:1">2 Odo. 3:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Langa baro Abirihaami bariisanni ke'e harichcho koodhdheexxi ifika lame erganjuwwanna ifika belto Yisaaqinna welti adhdhe; ciinceessatike tolchi'aanna geltaaxxa haqqe aadheexxi Mageni iso'n kulmake boonchiba'a ke'e me'e. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Sakka baro Abirihaami tami asseexxi eettene bakka bayyii'n afe. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Abirihaam ifika erganjuwwa, «Ani anke beltinni ookko marre'e Mageno magenooffate ha'noobaa illee iima hinge danganno qico'ni harichcho abiddine kabanni hedhdhe» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Abirihaaminna ciinceesatike tolchixxa haqqe aadheexxi Yisaaqi ifike belto'n dukise; giiratanna shiifa kinni isi ifi'aanni iyyee'naa lamiingi welti me'ine. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Yisaaqinna anna ifika Abirihaamii, «Annayyoo» hiyye ye'e; Abirihaaminna, «Hee anke belto» hiyye. Yisaaqinna, «Egedhdhi! Giiratinna haqqe kunniseten; yaane kinni ciinceesatik tolchik beltanji habata hedhe?» Hiyyee isoo qore.<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Abirihaaminna «Anke belto ciinceesatike tolchika beltanjo Mageningi umo ifingenninni qixxeessan» hiyye hiisse. Ookkoneechchi uduma lamiingi welti me'ine.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Mageni kulemmaxxe bakkaba gennee wodda Abirihaami tolchimalcho ijaareexxi haqqetanna isi hana tuule giisse; belto ifika Yisaaqii usureexxi tolchi hana irkise.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:21">Ya'i. 2:21</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Abirihaaminnna belto ifika gorra'o'a anga qeerrise shiifa aadhe. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Mageniink iimik erganji kinni iimatenaa'n, «Abirihaam! Koo Abirihaam» hiyye isoo ye'e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Abirihaaminna, «Hee kabanni hedhennen» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Iimik Erganjinna Abirihaamii, «Beltoke'n fuggoxxenni atixxa anga wirri assitoxxe; atika mitte belto anee hoyyedha gophpheettaxxee Magenoke sodaattattexxa ta'a ege'neennen» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Abirihaaminna toggi hiyye uudaa wodda raaqi giddo gaafi badda'at sagaremeeka mitte gedhebi beltanjo afe. Marenna okkone beltanjo aadheexxi belto ifikixxa bakka ciinceesse tolche. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Tennenaa'ni kexxeexxa Abirihaami eettene bakkaka summa, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti qixxeessan Yaahiwwe Yiri'e» hiyye summa fulche. Telchi qico'n «Mageni ifixxe kooba iima qixxeesaan» hiyyendaani.<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Langaxxanna Mageniink iimik erganjinna Abirihaamii iimii'n ye'eexxi, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />hiyyee qici, «Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna mitte atika belto anee hoyyedha gophpheettaxxennaa tenne assitettexxe ifi'n hiyye kakattanno qici, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />Dhugaaten atee eebbisanno; horte atixxanna iimixxe urjeshshannaa wodi'i qarqarike maanchishsha bira sa'issa'issannon. Horte atixxi naaphuwwa insa'neekika qachchuwwanna dhaaldaan. <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />Hiyyichcho anka laqqettaxxee buttatik gosa gosak ardi duuchchi atixxe horte darre'n eebbisemaan.»<verse eid="GEN 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Abirihaami ifike erganjuwwiba illee iima hige'na mitteba Bersaabehi'a me'ine. Abirihaaminna Bersaabehi ofo'le.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nakoorixxa Labbaxxa Oose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Tenne yaanuwwa uduma Abirihaami'n hiyyendee kulndee qic; «Kunnise Milkanna dayyo atikee Naakoori'a oose ildeen» hiyyende kulende. <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Milka ildeexxe labbaxxi oose: angafi Uutsii hiyyemeeke, dayyi isik Buuzi, Aaraamik anni Qemu'eeli, <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Kezaat, Hazo, Fiildaas, Yedilaafinna Betu'eeliten. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Betu'eelinna Ribiqa hiyyendaaxxa belto i'le. Milka tenne saddeeta labbaxxa oose Abirihaamike dayyi'a Naakoori'a ilde. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Re'umate hiyyendaaxxi Nakoorixxi shiixxooxxi are isi'a Xebahini, Gehamini, Tehashiininna Ma'ikaani hiyyendaaxxa labbaxxa oose isi'a ilde.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s1">Saaraxxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Saaranna dhibbanna lame tommenna torbaane wogga galde. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Isenna Kenaan boga'n «Qiiriyat Arbaaqi» hiyyemaake Kebiroonike qachchi giddo lummexxe. Abirihaaminna Saaraxxe reyo'a yo'oshsha yaade oodhe.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Abirihaami ofo'lemmabaa'n, ifixxe areke renshi birii'n ke'eexxi Heexxika arda hiyyee qici, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />«Ani ha'noke bogixxe keessummanna alaga manjon; anxa are mooqqannoka booncho ane'ni gurgurre.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:9">Ibr. 11:9</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:17">Erga. Huj. 7:17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Heexxik manninna Abirihaami'n wirrasse hiyye haaso'ee qici, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />«Anke gootta laqi; Atiqqa no'o giddo Mageniinke ulfichcha ja'laaban; mooggiinxe no'oxxe bakkanaa'n eetetteba fi'lite atixxa are mooqqi; no'o giddii'n ayyetenna kadoole reyeeka moqqitaboxxoshsha ifixxa mooggiinxe bakka atee hoyyedhaak hedhebaan» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Abirihaam bogiinke Heexxiik ardi edo ke'e heeshshi hiyye; <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />insa'ne hiyyee qici, «Ha'no anxa are mooqqonna'a eetii uutinechchinni hiyyaannexxa laqqe, ani'a Zo'aarika belto Eefiroonii kadhatte. <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />Kadhatinna isi ifike fichchike kasa'ni hexxeexxa Maakifeela hiyyendaaxxa ifixxa wolo'o ane'n gurguro'aten. Tinni bakka ha'nooxxe oddo'n mooggiinxe anke qadaada kadaashsha geyaake hira'n ane'n gurgurowwaal» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Heexxiichchi Eefirooninna okkone qachchixxe hula edo hexxeemmaxxe Hiititoti welt ofo'leemman; tennexxee isi ookko hedhemmaki manni duuchchi laqaa'naa Abirihaami'n wirri asse hiyye haaso'ee qici, <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />«Anke gootta iittatebaan; hiyyeenexxa laqi! Konnee fichcha wolo'o giddo hexxeexxenninni welti adhdhi; kunnise konnee anke ardi edo ati'a uwweennen; are atixxika rensha mooqqi» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Abirihaaminna higgeenna bogiinke ardi edo heeshshi hiyyeexi, <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />duuchchiingi laqaa'naa Eefiroonii'n, «Hiyyaannexxa laqi, fichcha atenaa'n hidhdho; maganneten fichchiinka hira aa'nee'naa adhdhe, anxe areka rensha ookko moogo» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Eefirooninna Abirihaami'n hiyye hiisse haaso'ee qici, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />«Anke gootta hiyyaannexxa laqi, bogiink hiri shoole dhibba sibljo birren; tinni kinni atixxenna anxe oddo'n maachchonnabaan; marte are atixxika rensha moogi» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Abirihaaminna Eefirooni Heexxiike ardi edo haaso'emmaka bogiinka hira kaduuni hiyye, eettene yannake daddaltotike mikisanjixxe qixxe'ni shoole dhibba sibiljo birre mike uwwe. <verse eid="GEN 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Konne qicinni Maakifela hiyyendaaxxe bakka'n Maamire bira hedheek Eefroonik fichchi giddo hexxeexxe wolo'onninnaa loolake'n hexxeexxe haqquwwaninni mittenba Abirihaamike kade. <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />Qachchiinxe hula edo dagemmake Heexxiik manni duuchcha'n kunni bogi Abirihaamik kadeexxa ege'neme.<verse eid="GEN 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Abirihaami Kenaanike boga'ni Maamire bira Maakifela hiyyemmake fichcha'n hexxeexxe wolo'o giddo are ifixxa Saara'a mooqqe. Itti bakkanna Kebirooniten. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Tennexxee iikki Keexiitotik fichchi giddo hexxeexxe wolo'onni mitteba Abirihaamike mooggiinke booncho kade.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yisaaqinnaa Ribiqa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Ookkone wodda Abirihaami cime woggatanna godde. Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Abirihaamii duuchchiinxenninni eebbiseemman. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Abirihaaminna isi'a ergataammake manni'a umoke kade isixxe karra duuchchika galchallo ifika erganjo ye'eexxi, «Anga atixxa gudeedi ankixxe oddo'ni uggi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadanni anga gudeediinxe oddo'ni ugge kakata haranga jijjiirendabaaxxe kako hiyyaten. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />belto anke Yisaaqi'a konne ani hedhenneke Kenaanike bogixxa dubarte aadhissaboxxoshsha iimatannaa butta dadeeke Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Magenike summinni kakat, <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />yaane kinni ani ilemenneke bogiba'a marte anxe gosanaa'n anka belto Yisaaqii aadhissatton» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Erganjinna, «Iitti beltichcho akimagaada anxa duuka kabaa dagatee macci hiyya gophoolenaa? Belto atika ati daggettake bogibaa illee iima hiissanno?» Hiyye isoo qore.<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Abirihaaminna «Feetexxe kaddoolenna belto anka ookko'a illee iima hiissitoxxe; heqqedhi! <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Ane ilemenneke boginaa'n anke annixxe baxxenaa'n fulcheexxi ‹Konnee boga atixxe horte'a uwwannon› hiyye kakate haaso'emmak iikki iimik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni anke belti'a okkoo'n aadhaaxxa belto affattoshsha ifixxa erganna ati edo ergaan. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Akimagaada beltichcho atinni dagatee macci hiyya gophoole kinni kakachchiissiinexxi kako atee abiddabaan; yaane kinni anka belto ille iima ookko'a hiissitoxxe» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Tennexxee erganji anga gootta ifike, Abirihaamike gudeedixxe oddo'n uggeexxi tenne yaanexxee kakate.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Ookkoneechchi uduma erganjikinna ifike goottike gaaluwwanaa'n tomme aadheexxi, gootti ifiki horatemachcho duuchchanaa'ninna elolla miya fe'eexxi Naakoor hiyyemaake Mesiphexoomiyake qachchibaa me'e. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Bogi galgalo'a shiqamma wodda, melaale wode'e ikki'lito'a daggammaxxa yanna qachchi gadhi darre hexxeexxe wodi'iinxe bale qarqara gaaluwwa guluffachchiise. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Ookkoneechchi uduma isinna hiyyeexxi soodatee qici, «Ee anke goottike Abirihaamike Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Mageno! Dagennexxa yaane telcho ani'a qajeelchi; Abirihaamii anke gootti'aanna o'wi. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Ani ta'a kunnise tenne wodi'iinxe bale bira uurreennen; konne qachchik dubarrinna wode'e ikkilo'a kaba'a daga'neen; <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Yoona ‹Odoolcho butta uggite wode'e ha'wonnaa ani'a uwwi› isee hiyyanno wodda, ‹Ya ha'wi; gaaluwwa atikeenna aninni towoo› anee hitaaxxi shaggitte ise erganjo atike Yisaaqi'a fildettexxe kaddowwaal. Konne qicinni ati gootta anke Abirihaamii o'witettexxa ege'nannon» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Isenna soodachcho birebaangi Ribiqa odoolcho ba'exxe dagge; tenne beltok anni Betu'eeli hiyyemaan; isi Abirihaamik dayyi Naakoor are ifixxe Milkanaa'n i'leeken. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Tinni belto labballi ise maxxaneebaaxxenna danchumma ise'n hara qubbeexxe duuddo dubarrichchomman; isenna muumetibaa dirte, odoolchote'n wode'e wonshexxe higge. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Erganjikinna gonge iseba mareexxi, «Magannete ha'wonaa shiixxoka wode'e atixxe odoolchonaa'n ani'a uwwi» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Isenna, «Anke gootta ha'wi» hiteexxi rakke rakke odoolcho tilqiteexxi ha'wo'a uute. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Ha'wo'a isi'a wode'e uuteechchi uduma iso'o, «Ha'weexxi goddaa qici'a, wode'e atik gaaluwwi'aanna aninni ikkilannon» hite. <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Rakkeexxinna odoolcho giddii'n wode'e gongake'n fulchite; gongite marteexxi baletanaa'n wode'e ikkilda'n, goddaa qico'ni isika gaaluwwanna ha'wisse. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Erganjikinna, mittelcho ise'n bucuqi hiyyebaangi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti yaada isika qajeelchexxanna qajeelchebaaxxa afatee belto assita'nemmaxxa yaane hubate uuda'nemman.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Gaaluwwikinna ha'we ke'eechchi uduma, manjichchi jaane giraama geyaaka lame worqetika gutichcha aadheexxi mansha isexxe'ni ugge; dhibbanna tomme giraama geyaaka lame worqetika hirbooranna anga isexxe'ni uggeexxi, <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />«Ati ayyixxe belto? Anni atikike mine'ni meya gallannobi hedhoole, maganne ani'a kuli» hiyye ise qore.<verse eid="GEN 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Isenna «Ani Baatu'eelixxe belton; Baatu'eeliki anninna Naakooriten; ama isixxinna Milkaten» <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Higgeenna lebbeexxi, «No'oba mine geyaak kummubanna hicaci hedheen; iittanni hano'aanna galdinaaxxa bakka anfeennen» hite.<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Manjichchikinna kumbuyye Duuchchi Woddika Gootta sagada'n <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />hiyyee qici, «Mararte ifixxanna addatensha ifixxa gootta ankenaa'n hoyyedhebaak anenna anke goottike firba'a ora anka qajeelcheek Abirihaami anke goottik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni saademowwaal» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Beltichchotinna gongite marteexxi tenne yaane duuchcha amatike hado'n kulde. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Ribiqa Laaba hiyyemaaka dayyo affe'emman; Laabanna iikki manjichchi hedheexxe wodi'iinxe baleba'a rake mare. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Dayyo ifixxi manshate'ni uggudhdhiteexxa worqe angate'ni uggudhdhiteeka worqetika hirbooruwwa uuddeeshshanni, iittanni Ribiqa manjichchi ise'n heyyeexxa haassottaa'naa laqeeshshanni hirbange'n manjichchiinba mare; manjichchokanna wodi'iinxe bale qarqara gaaluwwi bira uure'naa afe. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Isinna manjichcho, «Ati eebbisendeettek Mageniink manji amo, kaba gadho maa uurritatto? Kunnise ani ati galdattoba, gaaluwwa atikenna galdumiinba qixxesse'en» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Tennexxe manjichchi Laabanni welti mini'a me'e; gaaluwwakenaa'ninna ba'o tikeexxi hicace ito'a uwwe; isi'aanna isinni welti hedhemmak manni'aanna lekkatika wode'e uwwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Itatinna manjichchoke shiqqe; manjichchi kinni, «Dagennexxa yaane haaso'ebo'nok itabo'no» hiyye; Laabanna «Eloxxen haasottaata» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Tennexxee manjichchi hiyyee qici, «Ani Abirihaamike erganjon; <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna anka gootta lumo qico eebbise duroonseexxi heddo gedhebo, heddo re'e, heddo lalo, gaaluwwa, harruwwa, birre, worqetanna iittanni meyya labbaka erganjuwwanna isi'a uwwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Saara, anke goottixxi are cimo ifixxi giddo labbaka belto ilde; gootti anikinna afeechcho duuchcha konne belti'a uwwe'en. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Anki goottinna anee hiyye kakachchisee qici, ‹Anka belto ani hedhenneke bogixxa Kenaanitotixxa dubarte aadhissoxxe. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Yaane kinni anke annike mini hadibaanna anke firbaa marte aadhaaxxa belto, anke belti'a iyyedagi› hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Aninna gootta anka ‹Akimagaada iitti belto anxa duuka daga gophoolena'a?› Hiyye qorenne. <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Isinna ane'n hiisse hiyye haaso'ee qici, ‹Ikki ani isi'a duuchchi wodda ajajemaannak Duuchchi Woddike Gootti ifika iimika erganjo atixxa duuka ergeexxi ora atika ati'a qajeelchaan; konnee qicinni atinna anke annike mini hadibaa'ninna anke firibaa'n marte aadhaaxxa belto anke belti'a iyyedagatton. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Yaane kinni ati anke firba martee'naa insa'ne beltichcho uwwa ginboole, tinni kakattettexxi kako atee abiddabaan› anee hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />«Aninna telcho kaba wodi'iinxe baleba geyenne wodda hiyye soodatene qici; ‹Anke goottik Abirihaami'i Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Mageno maganneten dagennexxa yaane ani'a qajeelchi. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Ani ta'a kunnise konne wodi'i qarqara uurreennen; wode'e ikki'lito'a daggaaxxa dubarichcho, «Ballo magannete ha'wona'a shixxoka wode'e atixxe odoolchonaa'n ani'a uwwi» hiyye'naa. <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />Isenna, «Hii'i, ha'wi; atike gaaluwwi'a aninni towaannon» hitaaxxi ise Duuchchi Woddike Gootti anke goottike belti'a qixxeessexxe kaddowwaal› hite.<verse eid="GEN 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />«Ani qalbe giddo soodatannexxa soodachcho birebo'nongi Ribiqa wode'iinxa odoolcho ba'exxe turufi hite. Isenna wodi'iinxe balebaa dirrite wode'e ikki'lte; aninna isee, ‹Ballo maganneten ha'wonna'a wode'e ani'a uwwi› hiyyenne.<verse eid="GEN 24:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />«Isenna rakke odoolcho tilqiteexxi, ‹Ya, ha'wi; gaaluwwa atikeenna aninni towannon› hite. Aninna ha'wenneni; gaaluwwakeenna isenni toowotte. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Aninna isee, ‹Ati ayyixxe belto?› Hiyye qorenne. Isenna ‹Aniqqa Baatu'eelixxe belton, Baatu'eeliki anninna Naakooriten; isixxi amanna Milkaten› hite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:47">«Ookkoneechchi uduma ani gutichcha mansha isexxe'ni uggenne, hirboorakanna hirre isexxe'ni uggenne. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddike Gootta heeshshi hiyye magenoofatenne; anke goottike belti'a isike dayyixxa belto iyyedagonnaa ora ani'a qajeelcheeka anke goottika Abirihaamika Duuchchi Woddika Gootta galteefatenne. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Yoona ta'a anke gootti'a o'watixxanna dhugaatixxa yaane assitina'noole ane'n kulle; kadda gophpha'noole kinni hitina'neexxa hiyye hiissitebaa higo» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Laabanna Baatu'eeli hine hiissine haasonee qici, «Tinni yaane Duuchchi Woddike Goottinaa'nite kaddemmaxxe no'o elo yo'oxxa ate'ni hiissine haasonannoxxi hexxebaan. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Kunnise Ribiqa adhdhite me'i; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti haaso'emmashshanni isee atike goottike belto'n heerunsiis» hine. <verse eid="GEN 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Abirihaamik erganjinna insa'ne hineexxa tenne laqeexxi kumbuyye Duuchchi Woddike Gootta sagade. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Ookko'n Ribiqa'a birrete sibilgininna worqeti giissemeeka seesuwwa, iittanni seemma Ribiqa aadhe uwwe; iittanni kinni isexxe ama'annaa iseke dayyi'a hiri fiixeeka badhaasa gice. <verse eid="GEN 24:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Abirihaamik erganjinna isinni hedhemmak manni inde ha'wine ookkonni galle.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:54">Langa baro gorsa Abirihaamik erganji, «Yoona anke goottibaa illee iima higannoshsha asse» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Yaane kinni Ribiqak dayyinna ama, «Beltichcho tomme barra qico no'onni hexxuun; konneechchi uduma me'itinaan» hine.<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Isinna kinni insa'ne'ni, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ora anka qajeelcheen anee tursitinoqqe; anke goottibaa illee iima higannoshsha asse» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Insa'nenna, «Beltichcho ye'ne hitaaxxa lanqo» hine. <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Tennexxee insa'ne Ribiqaa ye'neexxi, «Konne manjichchinni welti me'atee hassaatte?» Hine isee qorre.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Isenna «Eeti me'anno» hite.<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Insa'nenna ifixxa dayyo Ribiqa'a, isee ba'exxammaxxe manjichcho iittanni Abirihaamike erganjonna isinni welti hedhemmaka manna me'aashsha assine. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Insa'nenna Ribiqaa'a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">«Tee no'oxxe dayyo ilde hori hochchoke'ni qoodi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 24:60">kumiinxe kade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 24:60">horte atixxi atike naaphika qachchuwwa dhaaldowwaal» hine eebbinse.<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ribiqanna isexxi erganjuwwa me'atee qixxeefante; ifi fike gaaluwwa'n gulunfe Abirihaamike erganjixxa duuka me'ine. Konne qicinni Abirihaamik erganji Ribiqaa adhdhe me'e.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Ookkone wodda Yisaaq Negeebike boga'n hedhaammaxxee Bi'eeri Laahi Roo'i dageemman. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Galgala mitte Yisaaqi hede herga'n diidi giddi'a fuleemma; isinna tami asse uuddaa wodda gaaluwwi daga'naa afe. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Ribiqanna tami hitte uuddaa wodda Yisaaqii affe; gaalakenaa'ninna dirriteexxi, <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />«Ikki diidi giddii'n no'obaa daga'neek manji ayyete?» Hite erganjo qorte; erganjikinna, «Anke goottan» hiyye. Isenna shaasheti alba buqexxe.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Erganjikinna asseexxa yaane duuchcha Yisaaqi'n haaso'e. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yisaaqi ama ifixxi Saara hexxamake dunkaane giddi'a Ribiqaa'a adhdhe e'yeexxi aadhe. Yisaaqinna isee yo'oshsha eeyye. Yisaaqinna amatixxe re'yo uduma dayyeffate.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s1">Abirihaamixxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:32-33">1 Odo. 1:32-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Abirihaami Keexura hiyyendaaxxa wele manjichcho aadhe. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Isenna Abirihaami'a Zimmiranii, Yoqisaanii, Medaanii, Midiyaamii, Yesiboqinna Siwehii ilde. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yoqisaaninna Saabaanna Dedaani'i i'le; Dedaanixxi horte Asoorito, Lexusitonna Le'uumitoten. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Midiyaamixxi labbaxxi oose Gefeer, Efeer, Heenooki, Abida'inna Elda'aten; tinni duuchchiinxi Kexuraxxe hortemman.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Abirihaami afeexxa karra duuchcha Yisaaqi'a uwwe. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Ifixxe shiixxaramma melaallexxe labbaxxe oose'a kinni lubbo hedhemma wodda uwwa insa'ne uwweexxi belto ifike Yisaaqi birii'n bayyante he'nashsha borotike bogibaa me'inaashsha asse. <verse eid="GEN 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Abirihaami dhibbaanna torbaane tommenna onde wogga gale. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Konnee qico Abirihaami wogga godde cimeechchi uduma lummedhe; ifike edike annuwwiba'aanna reyoti bukki hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Oose ifixxi Isima'eelinna Yisaaqi Abirihaami'i Maamire bira hedheeke Hiititihcho Zo'aarika belto Eefiroonik fichcha'n Maakifeelaxxe wolo'o giddo moonge. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Kunni fichchi Abirihaami Heexxixxe oosenaa'n hidheemmakemman; Abirihaaminna ookko are ifixxe Saara bira moogeme.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Dada. 23:3-16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Abirihaami reeyechchi uduma Mageni Yisaaqi'i eebbise; ookkone wodda Yisaaqi Bi'eeri Laahayi Roo'i hiyyendaaxxe muumme bira hedhaamman.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isima'eelixxa Labbaxxa Oose</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:28-31">1 Odo. 1:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Gibtsichcho Saaraxxi erganjo, Aggaari Abirihaami'a ildemmake Isima'eelixxi horte konneechchinni butti'aa hexxeen. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Isima'eelixxi labbaaxxi oose angafakenaa'n maa'niin qico'n hexxeexxik summi: Isima'eelik angafi belti Neebayyoti, Qedaari, Adibeeli, Mebisaami, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Maasimaa'i, Duuma, Maasa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadaadi, Teemani, Ixuuri, Naafeesinna Qeedimatemman. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Tinni Isima'eelxe labbaxxe oosemman; kunni tommenna lami gosatik summi ye'emeeke he'nemmakenna ofolleemmake boonchuwwikenniten. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Isima'eeli hedhoti dhibbanna sase tommenna torbaan wogga tureexxi lummedhe; ifike edike annuwwiba'aanna reyoti bukki hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Isima'eelixxi horte hexxemmak bogi Gibtsexxe gabala bira Asoori'a me'ammake ora'ni Hawulaxxinna Suuri hiyyemaake bogixxe oddo'ni; insa'nekenna wele ifike dayyuwwi duuchchinni naaphummati sammi hine he'naamman.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobinna Eesawu'u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Yisihaaqi'i Abirihaamike beltixxi horte konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxenni: Abirihaami Yisaaqii i'le. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Yisaaqi ilemeexxe shoole tomme wogga'n Ribiqa aadhe; Ribiqa lame galaanixxe oddo'n hedhammake Sooriyichcho Baatu'eelixxe beltonna Sooriyichcho Laabaxxe dayyomman. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Yisaaqi are ifixxi Ribiqa, ila afa gophpheemmaxxee Duuchchi Woddike Goottiba'a soodate; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna soodachcho isixxa laqe; Ribiqanna siila'wite. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Anooletinna godoba isek giddo weli dhiiba'nemman; isenna, «Tinni mayee ane'ni kadde?» Hita'n Duuchchi Woddika Gootta soodatto'a me'ite.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Ribiqa'a hiyyee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">«Lame gosa atike godob giddo hexxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">lami arduwwi ati giddii'n gargar higee fulaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Mitti ardi mittekenaa'ni calla worbeeke kada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">angafikinna maa'nakee ergatemaake kadaan» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:12">Rom. 9:12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Ildaaxxi yanna geltee wodda kunnise godoba iseke'ni lakko hexxemman. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Edise fuleek belti daayyaakenna bisi isik duuchchi ordatikemman. Tennexxe iski summi «Eesawu»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Eesawu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni «Eesawu» hiyya ordatike hiyyaten</char></note> hiyyeme. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Ookkoneechchi uduma dayyi isik ileme anga ifixxenn Eesawuka tinxa abixxee fule; tennexxe summi isiki «Ya'iqoobi»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:26 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ya'iqoobi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni «Ya'iqoobi» hiyya tinxa abixxaakenna dedhisaake hiyyaten</char></note> hiyyeme; Ribiqa tenne oose ildaa wodda Yisaaqixxi wogga jaane tommemman. <verse eid="GEN 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Tinni lamiinxi oose nophphite; Eesawu adamo ege'neeke badda'ati manjo kade; Ya'iqoobi kinni dunkaanetenaa'n fulabaake ca'lisa manjomman. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Yisaaqi'ni adamme idangeek maali elaammaxxee'e Eesawu eeyyamman; Ribiqa kinni Ya'iqoobi'i eettamman.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Mitte barra Ya'iqoobi hamara gaffange'ni Eesawu adamokenaa'ni dage; isinna yo'oshsha solo'weemman. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Eesawunna Ya'iqoobi, «Lumoshsha kurbuyyeennen rakkettexxi tenne diimmooxxe woxenaa'ni ani'a uwwi» hiyye. Tennexxe summa isika «Eedoomi»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Eedoomi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni «Eedoomi» hiyya diimmoke hiyyaten</char></note> hiyyeme.<verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Ya'iqoobinna «Edise angafumma atixxa ane'n gurgur» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Eesawunna, «Kunnise reyonnaaten, anxi angafummata maa ani'a assitaaxxe?» Hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Ya'iqoobinna Eesawu'u, «Yoona iittate kaddeexxeni angafumma ate'n gurgureenen hite kakat» hiyye; tennexxe Eesawu kakateexxi ifixxa angafumma Ya'iqoobi'n gurgudhe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:16">Ibr. 12:16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ya'iqoobi hamariinka la'a waasik welti Eesawu'a uwwe; Esawunna ite ha'weechchi uduma ke'e me'e. Konne qicinni Eesawu ifixxa angafumma shollishe.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s1">Yisaaq Geerari'a Me'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Edi wodda Abirihaamike baro'n bogake'n e'yemmake solo'i gadho higgeen weli so'lo'i e'ye; tennexxee Yisaaqi Filisixeemik moyanji Abemelek hedheeba'a Giraari'a me'e. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Ookko Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Yisaaqi'n leelleexxi, «Ani ate'n kulaanneke boga'n ofo'li malee'e adadde Gibtse'a me'itoxxe. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Yannate kabanni konne boga'n hedhi; ani atinni welti hedhannon; ateenna eebbisannon; boga konne duuchcha ati'aanna atixxe horte duuchchi'a uwwonna'a anna atike Abirihaami'a aageennexxa kako muuxannon. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Horte atixxa iimixxe urjeshsha bira sa'issannon; konnee boga duuchchiinga horte atixxe uwwannon; horte atixxi darree'ni buttatik gosa gosaki ardi duuchchi eebbisemaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-18">Dada. 22:16-18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Ani tennee ati'a assaannechchi anni atik Abirihaami hiyyichcho anka laqe, ajaja, aada anxanna seera anka duuchcha heqqedhemmaxxeeten» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Tennexxee Yisaaqi Giraare ofo'le. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Ookkone boonik manni Yisaaqii «Ribiqa ati'a maa kadda?» hine lanqee wodda «Anxe dayyon» hiyye; tenneenna hiyyeechchi «Ribiqa hara danchate kaddemmaxxee ookkone bogik manni isexxe buuto'a anee shiyan» hiyyati sodaateemmaxxeeten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:13">Dada. 12:13</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Yisaaqi heddo yanna okko hedheechchi udumi'a Filisixeemi moyanji Abemelek mitte barra masikootteenaa'n gadhi uudaa wodda arenna aro'iinxa roorro Yisaaqi are ifixxe Ribiqanni roorra'naa afe. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Abemelekinna Yisaaqii ye'iseexxi, «Ise atixxe are kaddee'naana mayee ‹Ise anxe dayyon› hitette?» Hiyye isoo qore; Yisaaqinna «Isexxe buuto'a reyabo'noshsha hiyyeeten» hiyye hiisse iso'n haaso'e. <verse eid="GEN 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Abemelekinna isoo, «Tinni ati no'o'n assitettexxi yaane maachcho? No'ok ardi giddii'n mitti manji are atixxenni diiphe gateen; atinna no'oo balleessa iyyedagge gattetten» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Ookkonneechi uduma Abemelek, «Konne manjichchonna kadi are isixxa tuqaak manji shiyemaan» hiyye arda duuchcha ajaje.<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Yisaaqinna ookkone boga'n sanne roke; Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna isoo eebbisammale eettene wogga'n dhibba anga aassedhe. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Isinna hara dureessa manjo kadaa qico'n karra karrande'n lebenda'n me'ite. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Yisaaqinna heddo gedhebo heddo re'enna heddo lalo, iittanni heddo erganjuwwa afeemmaxxee Filisixeemik manni isoo gaabbe. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Tennexxee Filisixeemito anni isik Abirihaami lubbot hedhemma wodda Abirhaamik erganjuwwi qotemmaxxa wodi'iinxa baluwwa duuchcha buttina wonshine duuchchine.<verse eid="GEN 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Abemelekinna Yisaaqi'i, «No'o caala hara worbitettaxxee, no'o giddii'n ful» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Tennexxee Yisaaqi eettene bakka waaleexxi Giraarixxe Dhooqa'n okko ofo'le. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Yisaaqi anni isiki Abirihaami lubbo hedhemma wodda qotende hexxemmaxxa, anni isik reyee wodda Filisixeemito duuchchiteemmaxxa wodi'iinxa baluwwa haaroba qotendaashsha asseexxi, anni isik edi wodda fulchemmanga summa tenne baluwwa'a langaxxa fulche. <verse eid="GEN 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Yisaaqik erganjuwwi dhooqa giddo qoteexxi eloka muummetika wode'e afe. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Yaane kinni Giraarike bogixxi allalisano, «kunni wodi'i no'oken» hita'n Yisaaqixxe allalisanon lolendeen; tennexxe Yisaaqi eettene baleka wode'e «Eseeq»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Eseeq: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni «Eseeq» hiyya lolake hiyyaten</char></note> hiyye summa fulche. <verse eid="GEN 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Yisaaqik erganjuwwi langaxxa wele wodi'iinxa bale qote; tenne balexxe buuto'aanna weli loli ke'e; tennexxee Yisaaqi «Siixinna»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:21 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Siixinna: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni Sixina hiyya naaphphumate hiyyaten</char></note> hiyye tenne baleka summa fulche. <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Yisaaqinna eettene bakka waaleexxi wele bakka'n wodi'iinxa bale unsiise; eettene yanna kinni tenne balexxee ayinna loleek hedhebaan; tennexxee, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ta'a ba'laka boga no'aa uwween, no'onna horre butta wo'minannon» hiyya'n summa baletiinka Rehoboot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:22: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Rehoboot: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni dha'atenaa'ni ganteennen hiyyaoten</char></note> hiyye fulche. <verse eid="GEN 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Ookkoneechchi udma Yisaaqi Bersaabehi'a me'e. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Eetteneenni hashsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Yisaaqi'n leelleexxi, «Ani anna atike Abirihaamike Magenon; Ani atinni welti hedhenneni sodaattoxxe; Ani erganjo Anke Abirihaami'a aagennexxe kako'a hiyye'e atee eebbisannon; horte atixxanna bira sa'issanannon» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Yisaaqinna eettene bakka'n tolchimalcho giisseexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottika summa ye'edhe; dunkaanetanna okko olte; erganjuwwi isikinna ookko wodi'iinxa bale ume. <verse eid="GEN 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Abemelek Ahuzeeti hinaake ifike mari'etike manjichchinninna ifike loliinke mannike ajajallo Fikoolinni welti Yisaaqibaa Giraari'ni dage.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:22">Dada. 21:22</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Yisaaqinna, «Anee gibbine shorrtineechchi uduma ta'a anibaa mayee daggine?» Hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Insa'nenna hine hiissine haasonnee qici, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atinni welt hedheexxa ca'assine uundeennen; tennexxee no'o, ‹Atixenna no'oxxe oddo'n kakotixxe weli aaggo hexxuun› hine. Tinninna atixxenna no'oxxe oddo'n hexxaaxxe kakotixxe weli aaggonni. <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />No'o atee miinbo'noshsha yaane kinn eloxxa calla ati'a assinenneshsha nage'ik anee geegesinennesha atinna fuggoxxa no'o'n assitaboxxoshsha atixxennaa no'oxxe oddo'ni weli aaggotixxa kako assino. Atee woldonni Mageni eebbise'een» hine. <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yisaaqinna konne manni ite ha'waachcho qophpheese; insa'nenna inde ha'wine. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Langa baro gorsa ke'neexxi kakot weli aange; Yisaaqinna insa'ne me'inaashsha asse'naa insa'nenna nage'ik me'ine. <verse eid="GEN 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Eettene barra'ni Yisaaqik erganjuwwi dageexxi ummeemmaxxe balexxa iso'ni kulle; «Wode'e alfinenna» hina'n iso'n kule. <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Yisaaqinna wodi'iinxe baleka summa «Saabehi»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:33: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bersaabehi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni Bersaabehi hiyya kakotixxe bale hiyyate hiyyeme ye'eme. </char></note> hiyye summa fulche, tennenaa'ni kexxeexxa ookkone qachchik summi telchi qico'ni «Bersaabehi» hiyyeme ye'emaan.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eesawu Wele Gosaxxa Dubarte Aadhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Eesawu shoole tomme wogga geyee wodda Heexxichcho Bi'eerixxa belto Yooditi, iittanni Heexxichcho Eloonixxa belto Baasemati aadhe; lamiingi Hiititotemman. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Tinni Eesawu aadheexxi dubartexxe buutonni Yisaaqixxinna Ribiqaxxi qalbe gubaatamman.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yisaaqi Ya'iqoobii Eebbise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Yisaaqi cime ille afa gophpha'n daggee wodda ifika angafa belto Eesawu'u ye'eexxi hiyyee qici, «Anke belto» hiyye ye'e; Eesawunna «Hee kunna kabanni hedhennen» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Yisaaqinna «Ta'a ani yoona cima'n dageennen; reyo barra kulda'n daggabaan, <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Tennexxee amo atika adamika miya gabetannaa mogido adhdhi, bada'a giddonna marte adande maala ani'a itonna'a iyyedagi. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Reyebo'nongi atee eebbisonna'a ani eeyyannaxxa xe'maxxa ita giissite anee itis» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Ribiqa Yisaaqi belto ifike Eesuwu'n haaso'a'neechcho duuchcha laqqa'nemman. Tennexxee Eesawu adame iyyedago'aa adamokee badda'a me'e uduma, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Ribiqa belto ifika Ya'iqoobi'i hittee qici, «Anni atiki dayyo atika Eesawu'u <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />‹Reyebo'nongi itennexxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo atee eebbisonnaa adamo adande xe'maxxa ita qixxeessi› hiyyaa'naa laqeennen. <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Ta'a yoona anke belto! Kulaannexxa laqi atee ajajennexxa assi. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Kexxe hori giddi'a marte lame elolla re'etika buruusa ani'a iyyedagi; aninna anni atik eeyaaxxixxa ita isi'a qixxeessannon. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Isinna reyebaa edi darre atee eebbiso'a aaxxe e'yitenaa ituun» hite.<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Ya'iqoobinna ifixxa ama Ribiqa'a, «Dayyo anke Eesawuk bisi ordatiken; anki bisi kinni orda afebaake shaqqaken; <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Akimagaada anni anki anee qaqqabeexxi isoo'o sobennexxa ege'naan; iitta kaddoole eebbatixxa bado badino ifitti adhdhanno hiyyoten» Hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Amatinna isoo, «Anke belto atixxi badino ane ama atixxixxe kadduun; antinni calli ani hiyyaanneshsha martettexxi ookkone buruusuwwa ani'a iyyedagi» hite.<verse eid="GEN 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Isinna mareexxi buruusuwwa ookkone ama ifixxee iyyedage; isenna anni isiki eeyyammaxxixxa xe'maxxa ita isi'a qixxeessite. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ribiqa mine uggitemmaxxa angafa ifike beltixxa Eesawuxxa bifaaxxa seemma aaxxeexxi shiixxoke ifike belto'n Ya'iqoobi'n oddeessite. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Iittanni re'etika goga lamiinxe anga isixxe'ninaa gooba isike'n orda hexxebaaba shaqqaba oddeessite. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma eettene qixxeessitemmaxxa xe'maaka hamaranna ra'issiteeka waasa belto ifike Ya'iqoobi'n uute.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Ya'iqoobinna ifike anniba mareexxi, «Annayyo» hiyye ye'e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Isinna «Hee» hiyye ke'eexxi; «Anke belto ati ayyete?» Hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Ya'iqoobinna «Ante angafa belto atike Eesawuten; hitetteshshanni asseennen, iima kexxettexxi adame iyyedagennekenaa'n itte anee eebbisi» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Yisaaqinna belto ifika, «Anke belto! Hitta rakke affette?» Hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Ya'iqoobinna «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni atik ani'a qixxi asse» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Yisaaqinna Ya'iqoobi «Ati anke belto Eesawute kaddettexxannaa kada gophphettexxa qaqqabe uudonna'a ani biri'a shikki hiyyi» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Ya'iqoobinna anna ifike Yisaaqi biri'a shikki hiyye; annikinna isoo angati qaqqaba'n, «Haaso'i giddo Ya'iqoobite; lamiinxi anga kinni Eessawuxxe anga» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Anga isixxi dayyo isike Eesawuxxishsha ordatixxe kaddemmaxxee Yisaaqi Ya'iqoobixxa ayyumma gargar hiisse ege'naa dandeebaan; tennexxe iso'o eebbise. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Yisaaqinna, «Dhugaandinni ati aninge belto Eessawundee?» Hiyye laqe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Ya'iqoobinna, «Eeti aniqqa atinge belton» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yisaaqinna, «Anke belto yoona atee eebbisonna'a adande iyyedaggetteka shiqishi ito» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:25">Ya'iqoobinna ita anna ifikee shiqishe'naa ite, woyinetixxa bookanna isi'a iyyedage'naa ha'we. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Ookkoneechchi uduma anni isik Yisaaqi Ya'iqoobii, «Anke belto! Kaba shikki hite'e anee sunqedhi» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Ya'iqoobinna shikki hiyye isoo sunqedhe. Yisaaqinna Ya'iqoobixxe seemmaka foole ulateechchi uduma hiyyeexxi isoo eebbisee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:27">«Kunni anke beltik fooli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:27">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti isoo eebbisemmashshanni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:27">fishshaake fichchike foolishshaten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Ibr. 11:20</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Mageni iimii'n woja uwwowwaali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:28">bogi atikanna liishsho kadowwaal,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:28">midhatinna woyine ati'a muldu hite missowwaal.<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Mootummuwwa duuchcha ati'a hirende galdowwaal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">gosa gosak ardi duuchchi ati'a heeshshiqokki hiyyowwaal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Dayyuwwa atike duuchchi'a goottake kadi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">atixxe gode godobixxi oose ati'a heeshshi qokki hitowwaal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Ate badinaakir badinemowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">ate eebbisaakiir eebbisemowwaal.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:13">Dada. 12:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Yisaaqi Ya'iqoobii eebbise bireechchi uduma Ya'iqoobi anni biriin fulebaangi hirbange'n dayyi isik Eesawu adamokenaa'n dage. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Isinna iittanni xe'maxxa ita qixxeesse annakee shiqisheexxi, «Annayyo! Anee eebbissota'a amo kexxe ofolde adamenneka iti» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Anni isiki Yisaaqinna, «Ati ayyete?» Hiyye isoo qore;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:32">Isinna «Ante angafa belto atike Eesawuten» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Yisaaqinna lumo qico culphisa'n, «Woldo ani'a adame iyyedagemmak Ayyetemata? Ati daggotta'a hexxee'naa ookkonee adameechcho ite isoo eebbisennen, isinna eebbisemeeke kadaan» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Eesawunna anni isiki hiyyeexxa laqeexxa hafuura gikki'asse hiiqqise oodha'n «Annayo! Anee eebbisi» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Yisaaqinna «Dayyi atiki dageexxi anee dedhise eebba atixxa adhdheen» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Eesawunna, «Summi isik Ya'iqoobi hiyyema dhugaaten; isi anee dedhisaa'naa tinni langaxxen, ediseexxi angafumma anxa adhdhe, kunnise ta'anna eebba anxa adhdhe» hiyye; lebeexxi isoo, «Anita gatissettexxi mitte eebbanna hexxebayyotee» hiyye qore.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Dada. 25:29-34</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Yisaaqinna Eesawu'n «Kunnise isoo atike gootta asseenne; dayyuwwi isiki duuchchinna isike erganjuwwa kadaashsha asseenne; midhatinna woyinetixxi bookka iittanni wo'mitaashsh assannon; anke belto! Ati'a higge maa assanota?» Hiyye hisse haaso'e.<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Eesawunna anna ifika «Annayo! Eebba atixxi mitte callata? Annayyo aneenna eebbis» hiyya'n hiiqise oodhe.<verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Anni isik Yisaaqinna iso'n hiisse haaso'ee qici,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:39">«Kunnise galdumi atiki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">Liisho bogii'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:39">iimike wojinaa'ni bayyatee'naa hexxatton.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Atike wolaantichcho ate'e galchaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">dayyo atikeenna ergatendatton.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Ati jinnite iso'n kexxatto wodda kinni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">miiccama isikanna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">ifi iimii'ni fugussitatton» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobi Laababa'a Baaje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Ya'iqoobik anni Yaa'iqobii eebbisemmaxxee Eesawu Ya'iqoobii ijje isixxa gibeexxi godobi giddo «Egedhdhi annayyo reyo sheqe'een, ookkoneechchi uduma dayyo anka Ya'iqoobi shiyannoni» hiyye hede.<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Ribiqa anqafi ifike belti Eesawuk hiyyichchi isebaa geye; isenna shiixoka ifika belto Ya'iqoobi'i shiixxoka ifika belto ye'isseexxi, «Dayyi atiki Eesawu atee shiyo'a yanna heqqedhate'n hedee'en; <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Ta'anna anke belto, ani hiyyaannoshsha assi; kexxettexxi Kaaranike boga'n hedheeke anka dayyo Laababaa'a baaji; <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Dayyi atikixxi mufe qiidda qico'n shiixxoxxa barra ookko hekki hiyyi; <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Yaane kinni mufe isinaa'n qiiddee'naa iso'n assitettexxa dedheechchi uduma ate'n ergee'naa higge daggatton; mayee ha'noo lamiinga mitte barra'n gophanno?» Hite. <verse eid="GEN 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Ribiqanna Yisaaqii «Eesawu aadheexxe Heexxiitotixxa dubartexxe hedho anee gibise; Ya'iqoobi konne boginaa'n Keexiitotixxe dubartenaa'n aadha'neexxe kaddoole ani'a reyo woyya» hite.<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Yisaaqinna Ya'iqoobii ye'e eebbisee uduma hiyye isoo ajajee qici, «Feeteexxenna kaddoole Kenaanitotixxa dubarte aaxxoxxe, <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Ta'anni kexxe Mesipheexoomiya hedheeke atixxe amake anniba Baatu'eeliba me'i. Okko atike abbike Laabake dubarri giddii'ni mitte aadhi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Abbiinka dubarra</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okkone baro'ni Ibritotik manni abbiinka dubarra aadha hexxeexxeman. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Duuchchinxa dande'aak Mageni atee eebbisowwaal! Heddo gosa gosaxxe tuutake arda kaddato qico'n ilde hori horte atixxinna birasaxxowwaal. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Mageni Abirihaami'a uwweemaka atinna keessummummat hexxaatteka konne boga atike geegoke asse uwwo'a Abirihaamii eebbisemmashsha ateennaa atixxa horte eebbisowwaali» hiyye ajaje.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-8">Dada. 17:4-8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Yisaaqinna Ya'iqoobii me'ashhsa asse; Ya'iqoobinna Mesipheexoomiya Laababa me'e; Laaba Yisaaqikenna Eesawuxxe ama Ribiqak dayyomman; Laabaki anni Baatu'eelinna Sooriyaxxe gosake manjomman. <verse eid="GEN 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Yisaaqi Ya'iqoobii eebbiseexxi aadhaaxxa are halso'a Mesipheexoomiya isoo eerexxa Eesawu ege'ne; Yisaaqi Ya'iqoobii eebbisee wodda «Kenaanito aaxxoxxe» hiyyeexxi isoo ajajeexxanna Eesawu laqe. <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Ya'iqoobinna ifike annikannaa ifixxe amaka hiyyichcho laqeexxi Mesipheexoomiya me'eexxanna ege'ne. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Konnee qicinni Kenaanitotixxe dubarte anna ifike Yisaaqii'n hittee qico gibiseexxa Eesawu ege'ne. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Tennexxe Abirihaamik belt Isima'eeli i'leexxa Neebayyoxxa dayyo Mahileetii edo aadhemmaxxe melaalle'n lebe aadhe.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobi Beeteli'ni Oojjoteexxa Oojjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Ya'iqoobinna Bersaabehii'n ke'eexxi Kaarani'a me'e. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Mitte bakkaba geyee wodda arishsho e'yiteemmaxxee okko gale; eettene bakka'n hexxeexxe kinonaa'n mitte kinjo adhdheexxi boraafate diiphe. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Oojoti buttii'ni ke'e qacce iima geyeeke riqa'n Mageniinxi erganna okkone riqi iimi'a da'mitaa'naanna butti'a dirritaa'naa uude.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:51">Yoh. 1:51</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna ise hana uurreexxi: «Ani anna atike Abirihaamikennaa Yisaaqike Gootta Magenon. Ati konnee itti diiphpheetteka boga ati'aannaa atixxe horte'aa uwwannon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:14-15">Dada. 13:14-15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Horte atixxik laakkossi dandesisabake maanchishsha birasaxxaan; atinna dhidhimake'ni borote'n middake'ninnaa bita'ake'n ba'lattatton; buttatik ardi duuchchi atinninnaa atixxe horte darree'ni eebbiseemaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Dada. 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:18">22:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Kunnise ani atinni welt hedhennen; martetteba duuchcha atee heqqannon; konne bogibaanna atee ille iima hiissannon; ati'a uwwennexxa adde ati'a muuxannoo qico'n atee waalabo'non» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Ya'iqoobinna diiphokenaa'ni dammaqee wodda, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti dhugaandinni tenne bakka'ni hedheen; ani kinni tennee ege'neennabaan» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Isinna soda'ati «Tinni hitta sodaachchisa'neexxe bakka! Kunni Mageniinke mine malee wele bakkabaan; tinni iimi'a e'yatixxe hulan» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Ya'iqoobinna gorsan ke'eexxi boraafate galemmaka kinjo aadheexxi sooddotishsha kaaseexxi Ejeersiinxa zayite qacce isixxe'n hana dune. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Ya'iqoobinna eettene bakka «Beeti'el»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Beeti'el: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni Beeti'eeli hiyya Mageniinke mine hiyyaten</char></note> hiyye summa fulche. Edi wodda kinni ookkone qachchik summi Loozateman.<verse eid="GEN 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ya'iqoobi hiyya'n wereegee qici, «Mageni hedhoole, konne me'anneke ora'ninna anee heqqoole, itannoxxa ita ani'a uwwoole, oddo'wannoxxa oddoono ani'a uwwoole, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />anke annike miniba'anna nege'ik higonnole, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti anke Mageno kada. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Konne sooddotishsha kaseennek kinji Magenik mine kada, ani'a uutaattechchi duuchchinaa'n tommitte anga ati'a uwwannon» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobi Mesipheexoomiya Geye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Ya'iqoobinna me'ate'n ke'eexxi borotike ardika boga geye. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Ookkonna mitte diida'n wodiinxa bale afe, tenne bale qarqaranna saseba gedhebi rubbi hiyye ciiseemman, buutotinna iikki gedhebi eettene balenaa'n wode'e ha'wa'nemmaxxeeten; eettene bale'ninna tuphemeemak lumok kinjomman. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Gedhebi duuchchiingi baletiba'a bukki hiyyaa wodda allalisano kinjo baletinaa'n goggo'mishsheexxi gedhebo wode'e ha'wissa'nemman; ookkoneechchi udumanna ookkone kinjo wirri assiteexxi baletike afo'n hiissitaa'nemman.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Ya'iqoobinna allalisano, «Koo dayyuwwa ha'no habaa'nite daggineek?» Hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Insa'nenna, «Kaaranii'ni dangennen» hine hiissine haasonne.<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Isinna, «Naakoorike beltika belto Laaba egendine'esi?» Hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Insa'nenna, «Eeti isoo egenneennen» hine hiissiene haasone.<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Ya'iqoobinna, «Meya isi nage'aangee?» Hiyye insa'nee qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Insa'nenna, «Ee isi nage'aangen, isixxi belto Raaheeli ta'a hore gande dagate'n hexxeen» hine.<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Ya'iqoobinna, «Yanna hedhenni hexxeen; hori aagaaxxi yannanna gelteebaan; konne hore wode'e ha'wissine baddatibaa adhdhitine me'we» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Insa'nenna, «Gedhebi duuchchi bukki hiyyee'naa kinjo baletike afo'onaa'n goggo'minshoole malee mittelchonna assa dandenabonno; ookkoneechchi uduma gedhebo wode'e ha'winsannon» hine hiissine haasone.<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Ya'iqoobi allalisanoti welt haso'anegge'n hedhee'na Raaheeli allalisanjote kaddemmashshanni ifike annika gedhebo gande dagge. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Ya'iqoobi ifike abbika Laabaka gedhebo oofa'ni daggaa'naa Raaheeli afeexxi baletibaa me'e; baletiba mareexxi kinjo baletike afo'onaa'n goggo'mishshexxi ifike gedho ha'wisse. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ya'iqoobi Raaheelii sunqedhe; hafurakanna gikki asse oodhe. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Ya'iqoobinna iseke annike firannaa Ribiqa ildeeke belto kadeexxa Raaheeli'ni kule; isenna gongite marteexxi tennee anni ifike'n haasotte. <verse eid="GEN 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Laabanna isixxe dayyoki belti Ya'iqoobi dageexxa laqqeeshshanni qophedho'a gongee hiribbi hiyye isoo sunqedhe uduma ifike mine'n adhdhe me'e; Ya'iqoobinna kaddeexxa yaane duuchcha Laaba'n kule. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Laabanna Ya'iqoobii «Ati aninni mitte mundenna mitte maalan» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobi Liyaannaa Raaheelii Aadhe Ya'iqoobinna mitte agenjo duuchcha insiba ofo'lechchi uduma,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Laaba Ya'iqoobii'i «Fira anke kaddettexxee calli'a tola ani'a ergatemiyyo hasissabaan; rundi atik maachcho? Ane'ni kuli» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Laabanna lame dubarra afeemman; angafatik summi Liya, shiixxoxxi kinni Raaheelitemman. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Liya julullitte illeexxemman, Raaheeli kinni dhagga bifaxxe lollobittemman.<verse eid="GEN 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Ya'iqoobinna Raaheeli'i eeyyeexxi, «Shiixxoxxe atixxe dubbarrichchoxxee ati'a torbaane wogga ergatemannon» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Laabanna «Ise'e wele manji'a uwwennexxi mannii'ni ati'a isee uwwennexxa woyyan; kabban aninni hedhi» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Ya'iqoobinna Raaheelixxee torbaane wogga ergateme; isee eeyya'nemmaxxee tinni torbaane wogga iso'n heenoxxe barra kadde.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ya'iqoobi Laaba'a «Ergatemenexxi anxi yanna muuxendeeni aadhonna'a belto atixxa ani'a uwwi» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Laabanna jila jileexxi olla'iinka manna duuchchanna bukki asse itise ha'wise, <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Bogi galgalo'ee wodda kinni Laaba Raaheelixxa bakka Liya aadho'a Ya'iqoobi'a uwwe; Ya'iqoobinna isenni diiphe. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Laabanna Zillfaan hiyyendaaxxa ifixxa erganjo Liya'a belto ifixxe ergatendo'a uwwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Bogikinna soodee wodda kunnise isee Liyatemmani; tennexxee Ya'iqoobi Laaba'a, «Tinni ane'ni assitettexxi yaane maachcho? Ani ati'a ergatemeennaki Raaheelixxendemabaa? Mayee anee sobbette?» Hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Laabanna, «Angafa hexxee'naa shiixxoxxa heerunsiisa no'oxxe aadabaan. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Tennee heerumiinxa jilaxxa torba bidhdhi, ookkoneechchi udumi'a higgeenna torbaane wele wogga ani'a ergatendottole iseenna ati'a uunannon» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Ya'iqoobinna tenne yaane'n weli aage; isinna Liyaa aadhe mitte torba turee uduma Laaba belto ifixxa Raaheelii iso'n heerunssiise. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Laaba meyyaxxa ifixxa erganjo Baalaani'i isexxe erganjo kaddo'a belto ifixxe Raaheeli'a uwwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Ya'iqoobinna Raaheelii aadhe; Liya iimi darrenna isee eeyye. Ookkoneechchi uduma Raaheelixxenna hiyyeexxi wele torbaane wogga isi'a ergateme.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobixxa Oose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Liya jibbendeexxa Duuchchi Woddik Gootti uudeexxi ila ise'a uwwe; yaane kinni Raaheeli ila affeemmabaan. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Liyanna siila'wite labba belto ilde; isonna, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti rakko anxa uudemmaxxee telchinni edi'a aro'i anki ane eeyya eeyyaan» hita'ni summa isika Roobeeli hite fulchite<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:32 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Roobeeli</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hittaaxxi hiyya </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Rakko anxa uudeen </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hitaaxxa tika afe'eexxe Ibritotixxe tikanni welt weli aagake ye'injo affe'een. Isike Summixxi tika kinn</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Uuda belto </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyaten. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Higgeenna siila'wite labba belto ilde, isenna «Magen gibensha anixxa uudemmaxxee konne belto ani'a lebeen» hita'n summa isika Simoon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:33 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Simooni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyya </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Laqaake </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyate kada dandeetaan. Ibrititoke laagadinni Simon hiyya Laqeen hiyyate.</char></note> hite fulchite. <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Higgeenna siila'wite labba belto ildeexxi, «Sase labbaxxa oose isi'a ilennaxxee telchinn edi'a aro'i anki aniba shikki hiyyaan» hita'n summa isika Leewwi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:34: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Leewwi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrititotikenni Leewwi hiyya Hanqalfaan hiyyate</char></note> hite fulchite. <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Higgeenna siila'wite labbanga ilde «Ta'a yoona Duuchchi Woddika Gootta galateefatanon» hita'n summa isika Yihuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:35: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yihuda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrititotikenni Yihuda hiyya «Galata» hiyyate. </char></note> hite fulchite. Ookkoneechchi uduma ila uurrisse.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Raaheelinna Ya'iqoobi'a mitte beltonni midde ildebaaxxa affeexxi dayyo ifixxa gaabbiteexxi Ya'iqoobii «Oose ani'a uwwi; uwwa gophphottole reyaannen» hite.<verse eid="GEN 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Ya'iqoobinna Raaheeli'ni mufateexxi, «Ati anee, finna ildaboxxoshsha hoyyedheeke Mageno ate'ni labbeenne?» Hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Isenna «Kunnaa erganjo anxi Baala hexxeen. Isenna oose ani'a ilde'naa aninna ise darree'n oose alfonna'a isenni welti diiphi» hite. <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Tennexxee erganjo ifixxa Baala'a Ya'iqoobi'n heerunsiisse. Ya'iqoobinna Baalani welti diiphe. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Baalanna siila'witeexxi labba belto Ya'iqoobi'a ilde. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Raaheelinna «Mageni ani'a mureen; anxa kadhanna laqeexxi labbaka belto ani'a uwween» hita'n summa isika Daani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:6: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Daani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni Daani hiyya «Murte uwween» hiyyate</char></note> hite fulchite.<verse eid="GEN 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Raaheelixxi erganjo Baala higgeenna siila'wite; Ya'iqoobi'aanna langa belto ilde. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Raaheelinna «Dayyo anxenni jaba qico wo'laancho abixxe injifatenne» hite; tennexxee summa isika Nefitaaleemi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:8: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nefitaleemi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni «Nefitaalemi» hiyyate kadda wodda «Wo'laanchcho» hiyyate</char></note> hite fulchite.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Liyanna ifi'a ila uurrisseexxa affeexxi erganjo ifixxa Zillifaan Ya'iqoobi'n heerunsiisse. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Liyaxxi erganjo Zilifaanna Ya'iqoobi'a labbaka ilde. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Liyanna, «Kaayo ani'a eldeen» hita'ni summa isikanna Gaadi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:11: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gaadi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni Gaadi hiyya «Faleen» hiyyate</char></note> hite fulchite. <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Liyaxxi erganjo Zilifaan Ya'iqoobi'a langaka labbaka belto ilde. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Liyanna, «Lumoshsha gammadeennen techchinn elqi'a melaalle duuchcha anee tee gammadeettexxe hitaan» hite. Isika summanna Aseeri hite fulchite.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Aseeri</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyya </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gammashshote </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyate.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Dinne haammammaxxa yanna Roobel fichchi giddi'a mareexxi Inkoy<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:14: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Inkoy: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Inkoy hiyya qawuffate kadda wodda, gumma isixxa melaalle ittoole labballik diipha yortaan; labbakinna melaalleti diipha yora; iittani kinni melaalle gumma isexxa ittoole siila'witaan hiyyendaxxi adde hexxeman</char></note> hiyyemaake haqichchixxa gumma afeexxi ama ifixxe Liya'a iyyedage; Raaheelinna Liya'a «Maganneten belt atik iyyedageexxe Inkoyetenaa'n ani'a uwwi» hite.<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Liyanna, «Aro'o anka adhdha ati'a shixxexxeeta? Ta'a kinni anke beltixxa inkoye abboo adhdhitottaandee?» Hite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Raaheelinna «Atike beltixxe inkoyexxa bado Ya'iqoobi dokko hashsha atinni welti galuun» hite.<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Eettenenni galgala Ya'iqoob fichchii'n dagga wodda, Liya isoo qopheccatee gadhi'a fuldeexxi «Anke beltixxe Inkoye'n atee jijjidheennaxxee aninni galdatton» hite; tennexxe Ya'iqoobinna eettene hashsha isenni gale.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Magenikinna Liyaxxa soodachcho laqe; tennexxee Liya Ya'iqoobi'a siila'witeexxi ondika labbaka belto ilde. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Liyanna «Erganjo anxa aro'o ankee uwwennaxxee Mageni bado ani'a uwween» hita'n summa isika Yisakoori<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:18: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yisakoor: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrititotikenni Yisakori hiyya «Bado hiisseeni» hiyyate</char></note> hite fulchite. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Liyanna higgeenna siila'witeexxi jiyaka labba belto Ya'iqoobi'a ilde. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Isenna «Mageni eloxxa uwwa ani'a badhaseen. Jaane labballo isi'a ilennaxxee ta'a aro'i ank ane ulfeessaani» hita'n summa isika Zabilon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:20: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Zabilon: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrititotike laagadinni Zabilon hiyya «Ulfeessate» hiyyate</char></note> hite fulchite.<verse eid="GEN 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Ookkonneechch udumanna meyyaxxa belto ilde; summa isekanna Diina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:21: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Diina: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrititotikenni Diina hiyya «Murte uwween» hiyyate</char></note> hite fulchite.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Mageninna Raaheelii qaabbate; soodachcho isexxanna laqeexxi ila ise'a uwwe. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Isenna siila'wite labba belto ildeexxi «Mageni diqatensha anenaa'n fugusseen» hite. <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Summakanna, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ani'a wele labba belto lebuun» hita'n Yoseefi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:24 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yoosefi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyya</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Isi lebuun </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyate.</char></note> hite.<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobike Horxa Bira Sa'ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Raaheeli Yoseefi ildee uduma Ya'iqoobi Laabaa hiyyee qic: «Anxe bakkaba'a ilemennake anike bogiba'a ille iima hige me'annoshsha assi. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Insa'neexxee ati'a ergatemennaxxa anxa aruwanna anxa oose anxa adhdhe me'onna'a ani'a uwwi; hittee qico ati'a ergatemennexxa egendeetten» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Laabanna «Ati darree'n Mageninna anee eebbiseexxa leellati uudennaxxee ate'n elle alfo'onnole maganneten kabanni ofo'li; <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Runda maachcho adhdhitattoxxa ane'ni kuli; ati'a uwwannon» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Ya'iqoobinna isoo hiyyee qici, «Hitta ati'a ergatemennaxxanna hore atik anxe allalanni hittee qico horeexxa atinni egendeetten. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Ani dagebo'no ediga'ma affeettaxxi heenoxxi karra telcho lummexxe birasaxxeen; anxe faanaxxa duuka Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atee eebbise'een. Yaane kinni haanoteta ani anke minixxee hedannoki?» Hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Laabanna, «Ati'a maachcho uwwanno?» Hiyye isoo qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Ya'iqoobinna «Ati ani'a mittechchonna assitoxxe; yaane kinni ati ani'a assitotta'a laqaannexxa mitte yaane ani'a assitottole hore atika woldishshanni ati'a bobbaasa'n allalannon. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Telcho hore atik giddo maremennexxi gedhebo atik giddo taltallichcha, xillinni boddi hiyyekanna xillolla gedhebo iittanni re'etenaa'ninnaa taltallitenna xillinni boddi hiyyeka fowe'naa kunni anke runda kadaan. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Konne qicinni heger runda anka towachcho daggatto wodda adatensha anxi ege'nendaan; anke hori giddo tali talle yookaan xillinni boddi boddi hiyyebaxxi re'e affendoole yookaan xillolli gedhebiink buruus afemoole ikki mooremekishsha uudemowwaal» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Laabanna «Ishshi eloxxen hitetteshanni kadduun» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Yaane kinni eettenenni barra Laaba burre burre affeexxa yookaan tali talle re'etixxa korbeeyye duuchcha, iittanni, meyyaxxe re'e giddii'ninna tali talle yookaan xillinni boddi boddo hiyyemmaxxa duuchcha, heenenna kadi golallinne afeeka duuchcha foye; iittanni xillolla gedhebika buruusa duuchcha foyeexxi allaldo'a ifixxe labbaxxe oose'ni uwwe. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Laaba hore ga'ne sase barraka ora Ya'iqoobinaa'ni bayyate me'e; Ya'iqoobinna gateeka wele Laabaka hore allala'nemman.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Ya'iqoobinna Libine, Lewizenna Eermooni hiyyemaake haqichchuwwixxa siqqo woxeexxi shamonxa hani'n quncisee hoyya'ni golalook giddik leello'a borro borrote asse. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Tenne qunce isexxa wowwoxxa'n hoyyemmaxxa siqqo hori uudaashsha albi edo wode'e ha'wammake gongi duuchchi giddo ugge. Hori korbeeyye halseexxi wode'e ha'wo'a dagaa wodda <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />tenne siqqo edo uuda'n rarragata'neman; tennexxe borro borro talittalenna xillinni boddi boddi hiyyexxa beltanna ille. <verse eid="GEN 30:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Ya'iqoobi tenne beltanna qofiba foye; gateeka wele Laabaka hore ookkone barro barronna xillolla hori edo uurse; konne qicinni ifik hori Laabake'n makemabaashsha foye. <verse eid="GEN 30:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Munde afeek meyyak gedhebinna meyyaxxi re'e korbeeyye halsite raragatamma wodda alfaashsha Ya'iqoobixxi siqqo wodinke gongi giddo albi edo ugga'nemman. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Yaane kinni munde afebaake gedhebinna re'e edo eettene siqqo uggaammabaan. Konne qicinni munde afebaaki Laabake kade; munde afeekiir kinni Ya'iqoobike kade. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Konne qicinni Ya'iqoobi hara dureessa manjo kade; heddo gedhebonnaa re'e, heddo labbakanna meyyaka erganjuwwa, iittanni kinni hedo gaaluwwanna harre afeemman.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobi Laabanaa'n Baaje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Laabaxxi labbaxxi oose «Ya'iqoobi no'oke annixxa karra hexxeeshshanni adhdhe'en; tinni karra duuchcha no'oke annixxen» hita'ni haasottaa'naa Ya'iqoobi laqe. <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Ya'iqoobinna Laabaka jeejanna uuddaa wodda isi'a edi qico geyebaaxxa afe. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Ookkone wodda Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Ya'iqoobii'i «Atike annuwwikenna atike firuwwike bogibaa illee iima higi; ani atinni welti hedhannon» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Tennexxee Ya'iqoobi Raaheelinnaa Liya hore isika alla'lammaba dango'a ergeexxi, <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />insa'nee hiyyee qici, «Anni ha'nooki jeeji ani'a edishshate kaddebaaxxa ege'neennen; kaddoollenna anke anniki Mageni aninni hedheen. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Afennexxa hunna duuchcha anna ha'nookee ergatemenne qico ha'noonni egendine'en. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Anni ha'nooki runda anka tommele jijjiira'ni ane sobeen; kaddo malee anee miidho'a Mageni eetti isi'a uwwe waalebaan. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Isi ‹Tali tallichchi duuchchi atike runda kaduun› hiyyee wodda hori duuchchi tali tallichcha ile; higgeenna ‹Barro barro afeeki duuchchi atike runda kaduun› hiyyee wodda hori duuchchi barro barro afeeka ile. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Konne qicinniten Mageni ha'nooke annika hore isonaa'ni aadhe ani'a uwwek.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />«Hore alfatee hasammaxxee yanna'ni barro barrotixxinnaa tali tallitte re'etixxi korbeeyye meyyaxxe re'e da'mitaa'naa oojjot uudenne. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Oojjo eettene'ninni hedhee'naa Magenik iimik erganjinna ‹Koo Ya'iqoobi› hiyye ane ye'e; aninna ‹Hee kunna kabanni hedhennen› hiyyenne. <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Isenna ‹Laaba ate'n assa'neexxa duuchcha uudennaxxee hore da'mita'neexxi re'etixxi korbeeyye barro barrotixxe, tali tallittenna xillinni boddi boddi hiyyeexxe kaddeexxa hubatte uudi. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Qaabetee kinjiinxa sooddo kaassettexxi hana Zayite hariirtetteba, ookkonne werreega werreegeteba Beeti'eeli'n ate'ni leellennek Mageni anten. Ta'anna konne boganaa'n rakke fulde ilendetteke bogibaa illee iima higge me'i› » hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-22">Dada. 28:18-22</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Raaheelinna Liya hineexxi hiissine haasonnee qici, «No'oki annike mininaa'n maa alfinaaneeke qoobbo hedheta? <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Isi no'oo uuda'neeki alagiinshatebaa? No'o gurgudhdhe, gurguremaaka maallakanna ite bire'en. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Tennexxe Mageni no'oke annanaa'n aadheexxi ati'a uwweexxi karra duuchcha no'oxxenna no'oxxe oosexxen; tennexxe Mageni ate'ni kuleexxa duuchcha assi» hine.<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ya'iqoobi aruwwa ifixxannaa ifixxa oose gaaluwwake'n ofo'lisheexxi <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />Mesipheexoomiya hedhemma wodda horatemmaxxe karranna afemaaka hore duuchcha adhdheexxi anna ifike Yisaaqibaa Kenaani'a me'e. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Laabanna gedhebo ifikenaa'n orda ciro'a me'ee'naa Raaheel annike minixxe fakkuwwaxxa misile moodhdhite. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Ya'iqoobinna me'a'neexxa Sooriyichcho Laaba'n kulebaangi isoo sobe me'e.<verse eid="GEN 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Ya'iqoobinna ifiichcho kadeechcho duuchcha adhdheexxi baaje; Efiraaxisika galaana foofeexxi Gele'adi koobatike bogiba me'e.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Laaba Ya'iqoobii Hordofe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Sakkaxxe barra'n Ya'iqoobi sho'ome me'exxa Laaba'n kulende. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Laabanna fira ifika adhdhe ke'e; Ya'iqoobinna torbaane barra hordofeexxi Gele'adi hiyyemaake koobatike bogiba'n dhaqqabe. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Magenikinna hashshati Sooriyichcho Laaba oojjoti, «Ya'iqoobi'ni eloxxanna kadi elobaaxxa haasottaboxxoshsha hiqqedhi» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Ya'iqoobinna Gele'adi hiyyemaake koobatike boga'n ifixxa dunkaane olte hedhee'naa Laaba mare iso'o dhaqqabe. Laabanna ifike firuwwinni welt ookkonni ifike dunkaana'n ofo'le.<verse eid="GEN 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Laaba Ya'iqoobi'i, «Mayee anee iitta assite sobbette? Dubarra anka bagediinxe booji'oshsha oolfitetten. <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Mayee anee sho'onde baajjette? Mayeeta ane'e sobbettee? Me'a atixxa ane'n kuldeettele ookkolikinna lumoka kirarinni gammashshoti faarsa'ni atee geegeessannabaa? <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Oose anxanna akka'wa anxa sunqedhe nage'ik hiyyabo'noshsha assiteboxxon; tennee gowwummati assitten. <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Ani ha'noo miidha dande'annoxxa hunna afeennen; yaane kinni yebeno hashsha atike annik Mageni anee ‹Ya'iqoobi'ni eloxxenna kadi elobaaxxa haasottaboxxoshsa hiqqedhi› hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Ta'a ati atike annike miniba'a higatee halchiteettaxxee me'itetten; yaane kinni anike minixxe fakkuwwaxxa misile moortettechchi mayeete?» Hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Ya'iqoobinna Laaba'n hiyye hiisse haaaso'ee qici, «Dubarra atika hunnati anenaa'n gatilsitatto hiyye sodaatennaxxeeten. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Yaane kinni no'o giddi'n atixxe fakkuwwaxxa misile affattok manji isi hedhoti hedhoqqe'e; atiilcho kadeechchi mittichchinna aniba hedhoole kunnise firuwwi no'oki edo halsite adhdhi» hiyye. Ya'iqoobi tenne hiyyaa wodda Raaheeli fakkuwwatixxa misile moortemmaxxa egene'emmabaan.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Laaba Ya'iqoobixxe dunkaane'n, Liyake dunkaane'ni iittanni lamiinxe erganjuwwiinke dunkaane'n e'ye; yaane kinni mittechchonna affeba'a; Liyake dunkaanenaa'n fuleechchi uduma Raaheelike dunkaane'n e'ye. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Raaheelinna eettene fakkuwwaxxa misile aaxxe gaaliinke koori hunda shoxxeexxi hana ofoldeemman; Laabanna mitte mittende dunkaane giddo findige haseexxi mittechchonna afeba'a. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Raaheelinna anna ifika «Annayo iima ke'e uurra gophennexxe mufattoxxe; xuri ane'ni dagee'naaten» hite; tennexxee Laabanna findige'e hase; kaddo malee eettene fakkuwwatixxa misle afa dande'ebaan.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Ookkone wodda Ya'iqoobinna mufateexxi Laaba'a «Belleessa anxi maachcho? Konnee qico anee adandaatteki heene cubbo hujannaletetaa? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Ta'a ati anke miyi giddo duuchcha findigge hasseten, meyaa atike kadeeka affettek miyi hoonte? Hedheexxe kaddoole konne ankennaa atike firuwwi edo shiqishe'naa insa'ne, no'o lamixxe oddo'n murrowwaal. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Ani atinni welti lame tomme wogga hose galennen; tenne wogga duuchcha atik gedhebinna re'e rimo'a ibissebaan; hori atik giddii'n gedhebiinka buruusuwwanna ite egenebo'non; <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Biniinchi ninnifemmakenna kadoole isixxe bakka'n hiissanne malee isixxa hafe beesisummatee iyyedage ege'nebo'non; hashshanna kadi barra mooremeeke duuchchixxe bakka'ni anee hiississa'ne turteetten. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Barra holati hashsha qorri anee gube; diiphikinna ille anxe'n wileba'a. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Lame tomme wogga atike mine'ni sa'issenne qici: tommenna shoole wogga atika lame dubari'aa hiyye ergatemenne; jaane wogga hore adhdhanno hori'a ati'a ergatemenne; kaddo malee runda anka tommele jijjiirtette. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Yisaaqi anni ank magenoofatemmak Abirihaamik Mageni aninni welti hedha gopheele telcho anga duwwixxen silaati anee shorriteettan. Yaane kinni Mageni elo anxanna rakko anxa uudeexxi yebeno hashsha atee xixe» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobixxennaa Laabaxxe Oddo'n Kaddeexxa Weli Aaggo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Laabanna Ya'iqoobii'i «Tinni dubartenna anxe oosen, tinni insa'neexxi oosenna anxen; kunni horuwwinna anken; kunni uuddaattechchi duuchchi anken; yaane kinni oose anxanna kadi oose anxixxa oose gatilssatee mittelchonna assa dandebo'no. <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Tennexxee amo telcho atinna ani weli'a kako aango; kako tinninna atixxenna anxe oddo'ni dhugaate kadduun» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Ya'iqoobinna kinjo aadheexxi sooddotishsha kaase. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ya'iqoobi firuwwa fira ifika «Kino bukki asse» hiyye; insa'nenna kino bukki assine tuulleexxi tuuloti biranna ita inde. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Laabanna tenne tuulo Yigari Sahaaduuta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:47 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gala'aadi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrititotike laagadinni Galaad hiyya dhugaa kulatixxe tuulo hiyyate hiyye summa fulche.</char></note> hiyye ye'e. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Laabanna, «Tinni tuulo atixxenna anxe oddo'n dhugaaten» hiyye. Tennexxeetemma summi tenne tuulok Gali'aadi hiyyemeemmachchi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:48 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Galaad</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibirayixike'n Dhuga kulatixxe tuulo yokaan Sooddo hiyyoten.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Laabanna «Gargar hinganno wodda ateenna anee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti heqquun» hiyyati eettene bakka Mitsiphpha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:49: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mitsiphpha: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrititotike laagadinni Mitsiphpha hiyya heqqatixxe bakka hiyyate hiyye summa fulche. </char></note> hiyyende. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Laabanna lebeexxi, «Oose anxa miiccottole yookaan insa'ne'ni wele melaalle lebbe aaxxottole ayyinna no'onni welti hedhebaan; atixxenna anxe oddo'ni Mageni dhugaate kadeexxa deetoxxe» <verse eid="GEN 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Laabanna Ya'iqoobi hiyyee qici, «Atixxenna anxe oddo'n kunnise tinni kinjiinxi tuulo; kunnise kaasennexxi sooddo. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Ani atee miidhonnaa tenne kinotixxa tuulo sa'abe'noshsha, atinna anee miitottaa tenne kinotixxa tuulonna tenne sooddo saxxaboxxoshsha, tinni kinotixxi tuulonnaa sooddo dhugaaten. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Abirihaamik Magen, Naakoorik Mageni insa'neeke annik Mageni no'o'n murowwaal» hiyye. Ookkoneechchi uduma Ya'iqoobinna anni ifike Yisaaqi magenoofatemmake Magenike summinni kakate. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Ya'iqoobinna ookkone koobatike boga'n tolcha tolche<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:54: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Tolcha Tolche: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kunni tolchi ciincatike tolchanaa'ni gargari hedheeke kadaa wodda wele ciincesine'e wele indaake tolcha hiyyate</char></note> firuwwa ifika duuchchanna ye'eexxi itise; insa'nenna inde ke'neechchi uduma eettene hashsha ookkonni galle. <verse eid="GEN 31:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Langaxxa barra gorsa Laaba dubarra ifikannaa insa'neexxa oose sunqedhe eebbise; ookkoneechchi uduma boga ifikiba'a illee iima hige me'e.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoob Eesawu'u Araarsedho'a Qixxeefate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Ya'iqoobinna me'ande'n hedhee'naa Mageniinxi erganna isinni afende. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Ya'iqoobinna erganna uudee wodda «Tinni Mageniinxe kaanben» hiyye. Tennexxe eettene bakkaka summa Mehanaayim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:2: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mehanayim: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrititotike laagadinni Mahanayim hiyya lami duuli bukki hiyyaaba hiyyate</char></note> hiyye fulche.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ya'iqoobi Eedoomike bogi giddo Seeyir hiyyendaaxxe bakka'n hedhammake dayyo ifike Eesawubaa erganjuwwa edi'a ergeexxi hiyye insa'nee ajajee qici, <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />«Eesawu anke gootta'n erganji atik Ya'iqoobi hiyya'ne hitinaa qici, ‹Baqate me'ennexxi Laababa hedhenani ta'i qico'ninna ookkon hedhennan; <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Ani ta'a heddo lalo, harre, gedhebokanna re'e iittanni labbakannaa meyyaka erganjuwwa afeennen; ta'a ani tennee erga atiba ergeenechchi atenaa'n elle alfannon hiyye hedeeten› hiyye ereggeen hitine kulle.»<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Erganjuwwikinna Ya'iqoobibaa ille iima higeexxi, «Dayyo atike Eesawuba mareennen isi ta'a atinni afemo'a dagate'n hedheen; shoole dhibba manninna welti hedheen» hine. <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Ya'iqoobinna lumoshsha sodaate wixxirri hiyyeexxi welt hedhemmaka mannana lameba qoode; gedhebo ifika re'e ifixxa, lalo fikinna gaaluwwa ifikanna lameba foye. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Ya'iqoobinna iitta asseechchi «Eesawu dage mitte kuta biroole gatteexxi kuta fuldaan» hiyye hedeeten.<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ya'iqoobi hiyyeexxi soodaatee qici, «Ee anka anna Abirihaamike Mageno Yisaaqike Mageno anee ‹Ilendetteke bogibaanna atike firuwwibaa illee iima higi; aninna ati'a eloxxa yaane assannon› hiteettake koo Duuchchi Woddike Gootta, <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Ani atik erganji ta'i qico'n ani'a assitettexxe ba'lunte'aanna addatensha'a geyeennekebaan; Yordaanoosi foofenna wodda anga abixxennaxxa siqqichcho malee mittechchonna afeennabaan; ta'a kinni kunnise lame kutake horiinkenna manjike kadeennen. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Dageexxi anenna kadi tenne amuwwa annoolendinni mitteba no'o biraan hiyye sodaatennaxxee dayyo anke Eesawuxxe anganaa'n anee anjirtotta'a kadhataanen. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Atinna ‹Dhugaanda ati'a eloxxa assannon; horte atixxanna laakko'emabaake abbaayatike maanchishsha bira sa'issannon hiteettan.› »<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Eettene hashsha Ya'iqoobi ookkonni gale; afeechchi duuchinaa'n dayyo ifike Eesawu'a uwwaaxxa uwwa konnechchinni butta hexxeexxa melle: <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />lame dhibba meyyaxxa re'e, lame tomme re'etixxa korbeeyye, lame dhibba gedhebbanna lame tomme gedhebiinxa korbeeyye, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />sase tomme unuunsaaka gaaluwwa beltannandinni, shoole tomme saayyannaa tomme jiboota, lame tomme meyyaxxa harrennaa tomme labbaxxa harre. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Konne horenna kuta kuta'n qoodeexxi, mitte mittenda kuta ga'ne me'aashsha ifike erganjuwwa'n uwwe; insa'nenna, «Ha'no ani'a edissine me'e; horekanna kuta kutanni weli birii'ni bayyissine ganne» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Edo aaneka erganjonna hiyye ajajee qici, «Dayyi ank Eesawu atinni afemeexxi ‹Ati ayyike? Haba'a martaate? Kunni gande me'itaattek hori duuchchi ayyike?› Hiyye atee qoroole, <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />atinna hitatto qici, ‹Kunni hori atike erganjike Ya'iqoobiken; isinna konnee hore anke gootta Eesawu'a ergeexxe uwwan; isinna no'oo udumii'n dagate'n hedheen› hiyyi.» <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Iittanna langaka sakkakkanna hore kuta kuta'n gana'neeka wele manna duuchchanna hiyyeexxi ajajee qici, «Ha'nonna Eesawunni afendinaa wodda tenneenni iso'n kuldiinaan. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Giddii'ninni ‹Erganji atik Ya'iqoobi no'oo udumii'n dagate'n hedheen› hitine kulle» hiyye. Isinna iitta hiyyeechchi, «Esawu aninni afemeebaa edi darre tinni anxi araarematixxe uwwa edise isoo geltaa wodda akimagaada godoba tilqeexxi gammashshot anee adhdhaan» hiyye hedemmaxxetemman. <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Tennexxee Ya'iqoobi araariinxa uwwa isi'a edise ergeechchi, isi kinni eettene hashsha ookko kaanbe giddo gale.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobi Magenik Qaphphuleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Eettenee hashsha Ya'iqoobi ke'eexxi ifixxa lamiinxa aruwwa ittanni, lamiinxa ifixxa meyyaxxa erganjuwwannaa ifixxa tommenna mitte labbaxxa oose aadheexxi Yaaboqi hiyyemaaka galana foofe. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Insa'nee galaana fooseechchi uduma afeechcho duuchchanna foosse. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Ya'iqoobi kinni qofinni gate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:24">Mitti manjinna bogi soodaa qico'n isinni qaphulema'n gale. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Iikki manjichchinna Ya'iqoobi'i injifata'nebaaxxa uudeexxi gudeedda isika tuqe; Ya'iqoobinna isinni qaphphulenshatenaa'n kexxeexxa tafi ifik mikitakenaa'n fo'o hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Ookkoneechchi uduma manjichchikinna Ya'iqoobi «Yoona bogi soodo'aaten, me'onnaa anee wocci assi» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:3-4">Hos. 12:3-4</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 32:26">Ya'iqoobinna, «Anee eebbisseboxxok atee wocci assabo'no» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Manjichchikinna, «Summi atiki ayyete?» Hiyye iso'o qore.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 32:27">Isinna, «Ya'iqoobite» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Ookkoneechchi uudm manjichchikinna, «Mageninna manjik qaphphulende injifattettaxxee ta'anni edi'a summi atik Isira'eeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:28 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Isira'eeli</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyya </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Magenik welti qappulemeen </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyate.</char></note> malee, Ya'iqoobi hiyyemabaan» isoo hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:10">Dada. 35:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Ya'iqoobinna, «Maganneten summa atika ane'n kuli» hiyye isoo qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Manjichchikinna, «Summa anka qortaatechchi mayeete?» Hiyyeexxi isoo ookkonni eebbise.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 13:7-18">Hay. 13:7-18</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Ya'iqoobinna, «Ani Mageno albi anki edo uudennexxi midde hedho anxi gatteen» hiyya'ni eettene bakkaka summa Phiini'eel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:30 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Phiini'eeli</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyya </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mageniinke alba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyate.</char></note> Hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Ya'iqoobinna Phini'eeli'i sa'eshshanni arishsho fulde; isinna ifike tafixxe buutonaa'n kexxeexxa hokkola'nemman. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Tinninna Isira'eelito telchi qico'n tafiinke mikitika maala itta'nebaaxxe buuto kaddaa wodda, isenna Manjichchi Ya'iqoobike tafika mikit tuqemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobi Eesawunni Afeme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Ya'iqoobinna tami asse uudaa wodda Eesawu shoole dhibba manna adhdhe dagaa'naa afe. Tennexxee Ya'iqoobi oose Liya darre'n, Raaheel darre'ninna lame meyyaxxe erganjuwwa darre'n qoqqoode. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Ookkoneechchi uduma lamiinxa erganjuwwa insa'neexxe oosenni welti edo aanche; ookkoo'n Liya'a isexxe oosen welt itti aanche; Raaheelinna Yooseefi kinni duuchchiingenaa'n udu'minaashsha asse. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Ya'iqoob insa'ne duuchchigenaa'n edi'a sa'e me'e; dayyo ifike Eesawuba geyaa qico'n torbaanele butti'a heeshshi hiyye; <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Eesawu kinni Ya'iqoobiba geyo'a gonge mareexxi iso'n hiribbi hiyye; gooba isike'ninna marxeme iso'o suunqedhe'na'a lamiing oo'ne. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Eesawu melaalletanna oose tami asse uudeexxi, «Kunni atinni welti hedheek manni ati'a maa kadaakeera?» Hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Ya'iqoobinna, «Tinni Mageni elle ifixxenni ane'e atike erganji'a uwweexxe oosen» hiyye isoo laqe. <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Eettene yanna meyyaxxi erganjuwwa ifixxe oosenninni dangeexxi butti'a heeshshine. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Ookkoneechchi udumi'a Liya oose ifixxenninni daggeexxi butti'a heeshshi hine; udumii'ni Raaheelinna Yooseefi dangeexxi insa'nenna heeshshi hine.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Eesawunna, «Ganemaa'naa uudennek kunni kuta kutak hori duuchchi maachcho?» Hiyye isoo qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Ya'iqoobinna «Anke gootta! Atenaa'n elle alfonaaten» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Eesawu kinni «Anke dayyoo! Ani geyaachcho afeennen; ati ifi'a affetteechchi atinge kaduun» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Ya'iqoobinna «Waawwo'o! Iittatebaan; ate'ni elle alfoonnole tenne ati'a uwwaannexxa uwwa adhdhi; eloxxenni anee uuddaattaxxee atika alba ani'a uushsho Mageniinka alba uudennexxe qixxen. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Mageni elle ifixxenni ani'a uwwe'naa hasisaachcho duuchcha afeennaxxe maganneten ati'a iyyedagennexxa uwwa anenaa'n adhdhi» hiyye. Ya'iqoobinna Eesawu'u yo'oshsha uttisemmaxxee Eesawunna uwwa ettenee adhdhe.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Eesawunna «Kexxaata me'ino; ani ati edo me'annon» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Ya'iqoobi kinni isoo hiyyee qici, «Anke goota! Egendetteshshanna tinni oose dalqoten; iittanni kinni beltanna ifixxa ununsa'neeke gedhebi'aanna unusa'neeke lali'a ani'a xexxe'ata hasissaan; konnee hore manji mitte barra mudde ganoole duuchching hori mudaan. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Tennexxee anke gootta ati edi'a saxxe me'i; ani oosetixxenna horiinxe me'axxe qixxe'ni laana dage atee gootta anka Seeyir dhaqqabannon» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Eesawunna «Eegataa anke manji giddii'n heenooka atinni welti gatiso» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Ya'iqoobinna «Mayee tenne assitattota? Atee anke goottanaa'n elle alfa ani'a gelte'en» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Tennexxee Eesawu eettene barra Seeyiri'a ille iima hige. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Ya'iqoobi kinni Sukooti'a me'e; ookko ifi'a mine, horekeenna fooqo olte; Tennexxee eettene bakkaki summi Sukoot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:17: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sukoot: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrititotike laagadinn Sukoot hiyya mine hiyyate. </char></note> hiyyeme.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Ya'iqoobinna Mesipheexomiyii'n illee iima hige dagee wodda Kenaanike bogi giddo hedheeke Seekem hiyyemaake qachcha'n nage'inginni geye; ookko qachchi albi edi darrenna dunkaan olte. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Eettene dunkaane olteexxa bakka Hamoorixxe oosenaa'n dhibba sibljo birren hire; Hemoorinna Seekemike annamman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:32">Iya. 24:32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:5">Yoh. 4:5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Ookkonna Ya'iqoobi tolchimalcho giisseexxi tolchimalchokanna Eeli Eloohe Isira'eel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:20 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Eli Elohe Isira'eel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyya </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Isira'eelika Mageno </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookaan </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Isireelike Magen Lumoken hiyyate.</char></note> hiyye summa fulche.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobixxa Belto Diinanna Sekeemi'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Mitte barra Liya Ya'iqoobi'a ildeexxi Diinate hiyyendaaxxi belto ookkone bogika dubarra uudo'a gadhi'a fulde. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Ookkone boga galchaammake Hiitichchiink Hamoorik belt Seekemi Diina afeexxi adhdhe, welt diipheexxi battoosse. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Qalbe isixxanna Diina'a Ya'iqoobixxe belto'a booji'ende; isinna isee yo'oshsha eeyye; xe'maka haaso'anna ise'n haaso'e. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Seekeminna anna ifika Hamoori'i, «Tenne belto ani'a kadhati» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Ya'iqoobinna belto ifixxi Diina welti dhiiphe battosseexxanna laqe; eettene yanna labbaxxi oose isixxi hore bobbaasse allalate'n hexxemman; Ya'iqoobinna oose ifixxa daggaa qico'n tenne yaane sammi hiyye ture. <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Seekemik anni Hamoori Ya'iqoobiba kadha mare. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Ya'iqoobixxi Labbaxxi oosenna kaddeexxe yaane laqqeeshshanni hore allaldammabaa'n rakke dagge; Sekeemi Ya'iqoobixxa belto hunnat abide welt diiphiyyot Isira'eelito salphissemmaxxee lumoshshanna yaande mufante; tinninna assemiyyo hasissabaaxxe yaane assendemmaxxeten. <verse eid="GEN 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Hamoor kinni, «Belt ank Seekemik godobi belto ha'noxxe'n hedheen; maganneten aadho'a isee isi'a uwwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Weli'a balloommo; dubarra ha'nooka no'o'a uwwe, ha'nonna no'oka dubarra aadhdhe. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />No'oba hedha dandeettinaan; bogi no'ok ha'nooke bogani; isi giddo galle, giddo dadda'le karratanna giddo horatte» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Seekeminna Diinaka annanna dayyuwwa iseka, «Ani calli ha'no'ni elle alfoonole, hitinaaxxa duuchchanna assannon. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Ha'no calli beltichcho ani'a uwwe malee hassinee qicika xilooshanna hassinee qicixxa uwwa ane'e uwwi hiyye.» <verse eid="GEN 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Seekemi dayyo insa'nexxa Diina'n hunnat welt diiphemmaxxee Ya'iqoobixxi labbaxxi oose iso'ninna isika anna Hamoori'n diiniinka haaso'a <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />ineexxi haasoonee qici, «Dayyo no'oxxa jila ofo'lebaake manji'a uunabe'non; tinni yaane no'o'a salphinneken. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Kaddoolenna welti aanganok mitti ori hedheen; kunninna labbak ha'nooka manjo duuchcha jila ofo'lshine no'o'o fakkataten. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Ookkoneechchi uduma no'oka dubarra ha'no'a uunannon; no'onna ha'nooxxa dubarte aa'nannon; mitte ardanna kande mitteba he'nannon. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Yaane kinni jila ofo'la gibbina'noole ofo'laabo'non dayyo no'oxxa adhdhine me'inannon» hine.<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Kunni Ya'iqoobixxi labbaxxi oose shiqishsheek yaadi Hamoori'aanna belto isike Seekemi'a eloke labe leelle. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Anna ifike minni hadinaa'n yo'oshsha ulfeessemmeke kunni dargaggeessi Ya'iqoobixxa belto yo'oshsha eeyyeemmaxxee insa'ne hineexxa hirbange'n asse.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Tennexxe Hamoorinna belt isik Seekemi ifike qachchixxe hulaba marreexxi tenne yaane ookkone ifike qachchike manna'n <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />hinee qeci, «Kunni manni nage'iinke mannan; no'oke bogi giddo he'na'n dada'linuun; kunnise bogi insa'neenna no'onna geyaaken; no'o dubarte insa'neexxa aa'nannon; insa'nenna no'oxxa dubarte aa'naan. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Yaane kinni kunni manni no'onni mitte arda kade hedho'a hasa'neek no'ok labbak manji duuchchi insa'nekishsha jila ofo'loole callan. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Iitta assinenneleta insa'neeki hori karra insa'neexxi duuchcha no'oxxe kaddammabata? Tennexxee insa'nenni hinaaxxen weli'aango; insa'nenna no'onni welti he'nuun» hine. <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Qachchiinxe hula gadhii'n bukki hiyyeemmak duuchchi Hamoorkenna belto isike Seekemike yaada'n weli aangee'naa qachchi giddo hedheek labballi duuchchi jila ofo'le.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Sakkaxxe barra'n manni reefixxe mada'n hedhee'naa Ya'iqoobixxe labbaxxe oosenaa'n Diinake godobik dayyuwwi Simooninnaa Leewwi ifi ifika wolaantichcha adhineexxi dedhange'n qachchi giddi'a e'yineexxi labbalo duuchchinga shinne. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Hamoorinna belt isika Seekeminna wolaantichchik shinne ke'neexxi godobixxa dayyo ifixxa Diinaanna Seekemike minenaa'ni fulchine aa'ne me'ine. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Ya'iqoobixxi labbaxxi oosenna shiyememake mannike rensha hana mammarendaa'na dayyo insa'nexxa battosinemmaka qachcha duuchcha saame. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Gedhebo insa'neeka, re'e insa'neexxa, lalokannaa harre insa'neexxa iittanni kinni wele qachchi giddonna gadho hexxeexxa karra insa'neexxa duuchcha adhdhite. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Karra insa'neexxa duuchcha adhdhiteexxi melaalle insa'neexxanna oose insa'nexxa duuchcha boojiteexxi, mine mine'ninni hedheechcho duuchcha adhdhite me'ite.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Ya'iqoobi Simooninnaa Leewwi, «Ha'no konne boga'ni hexxeexxe Kenaanito'ninna Feeriizitote'n anee boshitineexxi rakko ane'n iyyedaggineen; no'o laakkossik heenoke mannan; insa'ne mitteba bukki hinee anee lolleele ani anke mini hadi duuchchinni ba'annon» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Insa'ne kinni, «Mitte yabaabulto dubarte'n assendammashsha dayyo assedho'ateta?» Iso'ni hine.<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobi Beeteli'a Illee Iima Hige</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Mageni Ya'iqoobii «Kexxettexxi alalle Beeti'eeli'a me'i; okkonna ofo'li; dayyo atike Eesawunaa'n baajje me'itetta wodda ate'n leellemmake Mageni'a okko tolchimalcho ijaari» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:11-17">Dada. 28:11-17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Tennexxee Ya'iqoobi isika mini hadonna isinni welti hedhemmaka manna duuchcha, «Ha'no konne afineeka alaga magenuwwa fugusse; ca'ichake kadde; seemma ha'noxxanna jijjiidhe. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Ke'we alalle Beeti'eeli'a me'ino; ookkonna rakko anxi baro hiissichcho ani'a uwweekee, mare geyennebannaa aninni welti hedhemmake Mageni'a tolchimalcho ijaarannon» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Tennexxee insa'ne anfe'emmaka alaga magenuwwa manshatika gutichchuwwa Ya'iqoobi'n uune; Ya'iqoobinna konnechchuwwa Seekemi bira hedheeke qilxi hunda moogge.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Isa'nenna ookkone booncho waale me'i'ne; Mageninna qarqara ookkone'n hedhemmake qachchuwwa duuchcha'n soda'annaa alaayyo insa'ne'ni ibisemmaxxee Ya'iqoobinna oose isixxi ookone booncho waale me'ine. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Ya'iqoobinna isinni hedhemmake manninni Looza hiyyemeebaa dage; Looza tinni Kenaanike bogi giddo Beeti'eeli hiyyendeexxe bakkan. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Ya'iqoobinna ookko tolchimalcho giisseexxi eettene bakkaka summa Eeli Beeti'eel hiyye fulche. Ya'iqoobi iitta hiyyeechchi dayyo ifikenaa'ni baaje me'aamma wodda Mageni iso'ni ifi ifiseek eettene bakka'n kaddemmaxxeeten. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Eetten yanna Ribiqaxxi erganjo Diboora rerte; Beeti'eeli aadi darre hedheeke qilxi hundanna moogende; Tennexxee okkone qilxika summa Elon Bakut hiyyeme.<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Ya'iqoobinna Mesipheexomiyii'n ille iima hige uduma Mageni langaxxa iso'ni ifi leellisheexxi isoo eebbise. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Mageninna isoo, «Ta'i qico'n summi atik Ya'iqoobitemman, edi'a kinni Isira'eeli hiyyendatto malee Ya'iqoobi hiyyende ye'endaboxxon» hiyye. Tennexxee Mageni Ya'iqoobii, «Isira'eel» hiyye ye'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">32:28</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Higgeenna Mageni Ya'iqoobii hiyyee qici, «Ani duuchchiinxa dande'annoke Magenon; hortee bira sa'i; atinna heddo ardike anna kadi; moyanjuwwikinna atike gudeedinaa'n ilemaan. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Ani Abirihaami'aanna Yisaaqi'a uwwenneka boga ati'a uwwanno, atiba udumanna konne boga atixxe horte'a uwwannon.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-8">17:4-8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Mageninna isinni haaso'emmaxxee bakkabaa'n iimi'a me'e. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Ya'iqoobinna eettene Mageni isinni haaso'emmaxxe bakka'n sooddo kaase; ha'watika tolcha ise hana dune; zayitetanna ise'n dune. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Ya'iqoobinna Mageni isinni haaso'emmaxxa bakka Beeti'eel hiyye summa fulche.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-19">28:18-19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raaheelixxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Beeti'eelinaa'ninna ke'ne me'ine; Efiraata genno'a heenob gatee'naa Raaheeli ciniinfatte; ciniittote'ninna lumoshsha rakkatte. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Ciniintotinna lumoshsha wixxirri hitee wodda hobbassammaxxi manjichcho, «Ilda'etek kunninna labbaken, meeco'o sodaattoxxe» hite. <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Ise kinni reyote'e wixiratta'ninni ifike beltika summa Beni'ooni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Beni'oon </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyya </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wixxixxi hiyyennek belton </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyate.</char></note> Hite. Beltiinki anni kinni Biiniyaam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Biinyam</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyya </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Middike anke belton </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyate. </char></note> Hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Raaheelinna rerte; Efiraataa me'ammake oriba Beetelihemi moogende. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Ya'iqoobinna Raaheelike hirreessi hana duufe'a giisse; telchi qico'ninna Raaheelike hirreessik beesis okkone duufe'an. <verse eid="GEN 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Isira'eelinna me'a'ninna dageexxi dunkaane ifixxa Gader hiyyendaaxxe kinjinxe xellebo widi darre olte.<verse eid="GEN 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobixxa Labbaxxa Oose</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 2:1-2">1 Odo. 2:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Isira'eel ookkone boga'n hedha'neenge'n Roobel anxe garbitte are Baalanni welt diiphe; Ya'iqoobinna tenne yaane laqe. Isirea'eelinni tenne laqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:4">Dada. 49:4</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Ya'iqoobi tommenna lame labbaxxa oose afe'emman:<verse eid="GEN 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Liyaxxi oose:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 35:23">Ya'iqoobik anga belti Roobeli, Simooni, Leewwi, Yihuda, Yisakoorinnaa Zabiloniten.<verse eid="GEN 35:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Raaheelixxi labbaxxi oose: Yooseefinna Biiniyaami.<verse eid="GEN 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Raaheelixxa erganjo Baalaxxi labbaxxi oose:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 35:25">Daaninnaa Nefitaaleemi.<verse eid="GEN 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Liyaxxa erganjo Zilifaanexxi labbaxxi oose:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 35:26">Gaadinna Aseeri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 35:26">Tinni Ya'iqoobi Mesipheexoomiya hedhemma wodda i'leexxe oosemman.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisaaqixxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Ya'iqoobi Kebirooni bira Maamire hinaaba hedhaamake anna ifike Yisaaqiba mare; iikki boonchinna Abirihaaminnaa Yisihaaqi he'nammaban.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:18">Dada. 13:18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Yisaaqinna dhibbanna saddeeta tomme wogga ture. <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />Yisaaqinna cime woggatanna godde lummedheexxii ifike edike ardiba'a bukkiyye. Oose ifixxi Eesawunna Ya'iqoobi isoo mooge.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s1">Eesawuxxa Horte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:34-37">1 Odo. 1:34-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Eedoomi hiyyemeeke Eesawuxxe hortexxi jirte konneechchinni butti'a hexxeexxen. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Eesawunna Kanaanitotixxa dubarte aadhe; insa'nenna Hiititichcho Eloonixxa belto Aada'a, Eewichcho Seboonike belti Aana i'leexxe Ahilibamaam,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:34">Dada. 26:34</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />Iittanni Neebayyoxxa dayyo, Isima'eelixxa belto Baasemaatitemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:9">Dada. 28:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Aada Eesawu'a Elifaazii ilde; Baaseemmatinna Raagu'eelii ilde. <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Iittanni Ahilibamaami Ye'uusii, Tsilamiinnaa Qore ilde. Tinni Eesawu Kenaanike boga'ni i'leexxe oosemman.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Eesawunna aruwwa ifixxa, labbaxxanna meyyaxxa oose ifixxa, mini hado ifika duuchcha, iittanni gedhebo re'e lalokanna wele hore duuchcha, Kenaanike boga'n horatemmaxxa karra duuchcha adhdheexxi dayyo ifike Ya'iqoobinaa'n bayyate me'e. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Isi tenne asseechchi isinna Ya'iqoobi heddo hore anfeemmaxxee he'nemmak bogi insa'ne lami'a cu'matemmaxxeten; lamiingi heddo hore anfe'emmaxxee mitteba hedha dandennebaan. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Tennexxee Eedoomi hiyyemeek Eesawu Seeyirike bogixxe kooba'n ofo'le.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Seeyirike boga'n koobate'n hedha'nemmake Eedoomitotike hundaayyetika annixxi, Eesawuxxi horte konneechchinni butti'a hexxeexxen. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Eesawu ifixxe are Aadanaa'ni Elifaazi'i, are ifixxe Baasemmatinaa'ni Re'uuli'i i'le.<verse eid="GEN 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Elifaazi i'leexxi labbaxxi oose: Teemaani, Oomaar, Sifoo, Ga'itaaminnaa Qeneezitemman. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Eesawuk belt Elifaazi Timina'i hiyyendaaxxe garbitte are afe'emman; isenna Amaaleqii isi'a ilde; Yoona tinni Eesawuxxa are Aadake beltixxe oose.<verse eid="GEN 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Raagu'eelixxi labbaxxi oose: Naahooti, Zaaraha, Saamaanna Miizaahitemman; tinni labbaxxi oose Eesawuxxa are Baasemmaatixxe akka'uwwamman.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Aana'a Seboonixxi belto Ahilibamaami, Eesawuxxi are ildeexxi labbaxxi oose: Ye'uusi, Ilaamanna Qoretemman.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Eesawuka angafa belto, Elifaazixxi hayyoole labbaxxi oose: hayyichcha Teemaani, hayyichcha Oomaar, hayyichcha Sifoo, hayyichcha Qeneezi, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />hayyichcha Qore, hayyichcha Ge'itaaminnaa hayyichcha Amaaleqiten. Insa'ene Eedoomike boga'n Elifaazi darreke hayyichchuwwannaa Aadaxxe labbaxxe akka'uwwaman.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Eesawuka belto Raagu'eelixxe labbaxxi oose: hayyichcha Naahooti, hayyichcha Zaara, hayyichcha Saamaana, hayyichcha Miizaahitemman; insa'ne Eedoomike boga'n Raagu'eel darreke hayyichchuwwanna Eesawuxxa are, Baasemmatixxe labbaxxe akka'uwwamman.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Eesawuxxa are Ahilibamaamixxi oose: hayyichcha Ye'uusi, hayyichcha Ilaamanna, hayyichcha Qoreten. Kunni Eesawuxxa are, Aanaxxa belto Ahilibamaam darreke hayyichchuwwamman. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Kunni duuchchi Eedoomi hiyyemeeke Eesawuxxe oosennaa hayyichchuwwamman.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Se'iirixxa Horte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:38-42">1 Odo. 1:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Ookkone boga'n hedha'nemmake Hoorichcho Seeyirixxi labbaxxi oose: Looxan, Shobaal, Tsiboon, Aana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />Diishooni, Etseerinna Diishaani. Eedoomike boga'n hedha'nemmake Hoorichcho Seeyirixxe oosennaa hayyichchuwwi konneeratemman.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Looxxaanixxi labbaxxi oose: Hoorinna Heemaamiten; Looxaanixxi dayyonna Timina'itemman.<verse eid="GEN 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Shobaalixxi labbaxxe oose: Alwaan, Manahaat, Ebaal, Sifonna, Oonotemman.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Tsiiba'inixxi labbaxxi oose: Aayaana Aanatemman. Ana kunni anniinxa harre allala'n qiilla gammoojje giddo xabaliinxa muummuwwa afeemmake manjon.<verse eid="GEN 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Aanaxxi oose: Diishooninna Ahilibamaam hiyyendaxxe beltomman.<verse eid="GEN 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Disoonixxi labbaxxe oose: Hemidaan, Eeshibaan, Yitiraaninna Keraaniten.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Etseerixxi labbaxxi oose: Bilhaan, Za'iwaaninna Aqaaniten.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Diishaanixxi labbaxxe oose: Uutsinnaa Aaraanite.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Hoorik sooresuwwi: hayyichcha Looxaan, hayyichcha Shobaale, Tsibi'oon, hayyichcha Aana <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />hayyichcha Diishooni, Etseerinna Diishaanite. Kunni Seeyirike baga'n ififike gosatike minishsha Hooritotike hayyichchuwwamman.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edoomika Moyanjuwwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:43-54">1 Odo. 1:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Isira'eeli'n moyanji moyeeba ediga'ma Eedoomika boga moye'emmak moyanjuwwi konneechchinni butti'a hedheekeeran.<verse eid="GEN 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Beetsoorik belti Beela'i Eedoomi'n moyeemman. Isike qachchik summinna Dinihaaba hiyyema'nemman.<verse eid="GEN 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Beela'i reyee wodda Bootsirake bogik Zaarahik belt Iyyobaab bakka isixxe'n moye.<verse eid="GEN 36:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Iyyobaab reyee wodda Teemaanike bogik Husaami bakka isixxe'n moye.<verse eid="GEN 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Husaaminna reyee wodda Midiyaamika manna Mo'aabike boga'n injifateemmak Bedaadik belt Hadaadi bakka isixxe'n moye. Qachchi isiki summinna Aawit hiyyeme.<verse eid="GEN 36:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadaadi reyee wodda Mesirqaawwike bogik Seemila bakka isixxe'n moye.<verse eid="GEN 36:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Seemilanna reyee wodda, galaani qarqara'n Rehobooti hiyyemaake bogik Sa'ool bakka isixxe'n moye.<verse eid="GEN 36:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Sa'oolinna reyee wodda Akibooriki belti Ba'aal Hanaan bakka isixxe'n moye.<verse eid="GEN 36:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Akiboork belt Ba'aal Hanaan reyee wodda Hadaar bakka isixxe'n moye. Isike qachchik summinna Fa'uu hiyyeme. Are isixxinna Mehexabi'eeli hiyyendaa wodd, anni isek Mezaahaab amatinna Mexireedi hiyyendaan.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Eesawu darrek hayyichchuwwi summi ififike gosa gosatike minishshannaa ififike bogi boguwwishsha konneechchinni butti'a hedheeken: Hayyichcha Timinaa'i, hayyichcha Aliwwa, hayyichcha Yeteeti, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />hayyichcha Oholiibama, hayyichcha Ela, hayyichcha Finoon, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />hayyichcha Qeneezi, hayyichcha Temaan, hayyichcha Mibisaar, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />hayyichcha Megidi'eelinnaa hayyichcha Iraamite. Kunni Eedoomike bogi giddo hedhe hedhemmake boonchike summinni ye'ema'nemmake Edoo'ike hayyichchuwwaman; Eesawu kuninna Edoomitotike hundaayetike annamman.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s1">Yooseefixxa Oojje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Ya'iqoobi anni ifik keessummati hedha'nemmake kenaanike boga'n ofo'le. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Ya'iqoobixxe hortexxi jirte konneechchinni butti'a hexxeexxen. Yooseefi tommenna torbaane woggake dargaggeessa kadeemma wodda isixxi langaxxa amuwwa Baalanna Zilifaan ildeemmake ifike dayyuwwinni anniinka gedhebonna re'e allalaamman. Kunni dayyuwwi ifik asseexxe yaanexxa elobaaxxa oddonna annake'n iyyedage.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Ya'iqoobii Yooseefi cimo giddo i'lemmaxxee wele labbaxxi oose ifixxi irra eeyya'nemman. Tennexxee bifa bifake shimalinni seesendeexxa qeerraaxxa seemma isi'a gobe. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Dayyuwwi isik anni insa'neek insa'ne erra isoo eeyya'neexxa uudeexxi Yoosefii jibbine; iso'n eloka afo'o midde haasonnebaan.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Yooseefinna oojjo oojjote; ojjotanna dayyuwwa ifike'n haaso'ee wodda insa'nee edi erra isoo jibbin. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Isinna dayyuwwa ifike'n «Oojjotennexxa oojjo haaso'aannen caqasse: <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />No'o duuchchiingi fichchi giddo ladde usudhdhate'ni he'nee'naa dedhange'n anxi ladde kexxe toggi hite uurrite; ha'nooxxi ladduwwa anxe laddeke qarqara'n qoqqobbeexxi anxe ladde'a sagadde» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Dayyuwwikinna iso'ni «Ati no'o'ni moototta'a heddaatesi? Dhugaandinni ati no'o moote galchitottaande!» Hine. Oojjotemmaxxe oojjoxxenna haaso'eemmake haaso'ixxe edi erra isoo jibbine. <verse eid="GEN 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Higgeenna Yoosef wele oojjo oojjote ifike dayyuwwa'n, «Ani higgeenna wele oojjo oojjotenne; kunnise arishsho, agenjikinnaa tommenna mitte urjuwwa ani'a kunbulli hitaa'naa» hiyye haaso'e.<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Tennenni oojjo anna ifike'ninna dayyuwwa ifike'n haaso'ee wodda anni, «Tinni atixxi oojjo maa oojjoxxe oojjo? Dhugaandinni ani, ama atixxinnaa dayyuwwi atik dangennexxi ati'a kunbulli hinonna'aate?» Hiyya'ni iso'o xixe. <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Dayyuwwi Yooseefik Yooseefii yo'oshsha hinaafe; yaane kinni anni tenne yaane godobange'ni abixxe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Erga. Huj. 7:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yooseefik Dayyuwwi Yooseefii Gurgure</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Yooseefik dayyuwwinnaa ifike anniinka gedhebonna re'e allalo'a Seekemi'a me'e. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Isira'eelinna Yooseefii «Egendetteshshanni dayyuwwi atik hore Seekemike loola'n allala'neexxa egenedeetten; amo insa'neba atee ergo» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Yooseefinna iso'ni «Kadduun marannon» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Ya'iqoobinna «Martettexxi atike dayyuwwinna hori nage'a hedheexxa uuddettexxi odo aaxxe dagi» hiyye. Koonne qicinni Isira'eeli Yooseefii Kebiroonixxe dhooqanaa'n erge. Yooseefinna Seekemi geye.<verse eid="GEN 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />Ookkonna diidi giddo elqe kayya jeekki hiyyaa'naa manjichchi mitti isoo afeexxi, «Maachcho hassaatte?» Hiyye qore.<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Yooseefinna «Dayyuwwa anke hasaannen; gedhebo re'e haba allalla'neexxa ballo ane'n kuli» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Manjichchikinna isoo, «Insa'ne kabaa'n me'ine'een; ‹Dootaniba me'inannon› hinaa'naa laqeennan» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:17">Tennexxee Yooseefi dayyuwwa ifika hordofe mare'e Doota'inike loola'n insa'nee afe.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Dayyuwwikinna Yoosefi'i bayyanni afeexxi insa'neeba mare geyebaangi shinno'a mari'ante. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Insa'nenna weli'aani weli «Oojjaalli ikki dage» <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Amme iso'o shinne tenne baluwwanaa'n mittete'n hunno, ookkoneechchi uduma «Elobaak biniinchi isoo iteen hinannon. Oojjo isixxinna maa kaddaaxxa uundannon.»<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Roobelinna tenne laqeexxi insa'neexxe anganaa'n isoo gatiso'a «Amme isoo shiya waallo» <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />«Munde dundinoqqe'e; tenne gammoojje'n hexxeexxe bale giddo iso'o darbe malee anga ha'noxxa iso'n hobbi hitinoqqe'e» Roobelinna iitta hiyyeechchi iso'o anga insa'neexxenaa'n gatiseexxi anna isikiba'a ille iima hiisso'aten <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Yooseefinna dayyuwwa ifikiba'a mare geyee wodda oddo'weemmaxxa bifa bifake shimalinni seesendeemmaxxa qeeraaxxa seemma isonaa'n fulchine. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Yooseefinna aa'ne iyyemareexxi bale giddi'a darbine; balletinna wode'e affeemmabaaxxemman.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Ookkoneechchi udumaa ita indo'a ofolle; tami assine uunda wodda Gele'adi'n dagga'neexxa Isima'eeltotixxa daddalto anfe; Isima'eelixxi daddaltonna gaaluwwa ifike'n fishshaxxa shitto, qurunfuuduwwa, belesaanenna karbe gaaluwwake'ni feenexxi Gibtse'aa me'itammaxxemman.<verse eid="GEN 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Yihudanna dayyuwwa ifika hiyyee qici, «Dayyo no'oka shiyyatinna reyee qico sho'ati no'o maa la'o alfinanno? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Tenne mannii'n amme isoo Isima'eelitotixxe daddalto'n gurgudhdhino malee anga no'oxxa abboo iso'n hobbi hinonnoqqe'e; isiqqa no'oxxe goden, no'oke maalan» hiyye. Dayyuwwikinna isike yaado'n weli'aage. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Midiyaamitotixxi daddalto insa'ne biri'a shiqqe daggee wodda; Yooseefik dayyuwwi Yooseefii bale giddii'n fulcheexxi Isima'elitote'n lame tomme birretike sibljo'n gurgurte. Insa'nenna Yooseefii Gibtse'a adhdhine me'ine.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Roobelinna baletibaa illee iima higeexxi Yoosefi ookko hedhebaaxxa uudeexxi yaadoti seemma ifixxa daree haaqqi asse. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Dayyuwwa ifikiba'anna illee iima higeexxi, «Beltichiqqa ookko hedhebaa! Ani habaata me'anno?» Hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Ookkoneechchi uduma labba recco dulleexxi Yooseefixxa qeerraaxxa seemma mundete'n gangalchine <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Eettene bifa bifake shimalinni seesendemmaxxa seemma ifike annibaa iyyemarreexxi, «Tenne ibbee'naa anfennen; tinni atike beltixxe qeerraaxxe seemma kaddeexxanna kaddebaaxxa hubatte uudi» hine.<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Isinna seemma ege'neexxi, «Tinni anke beltixxe seemman, belto anka biniinchake iteedheen; dhugaanden, Yooseefi kukkutemeedhen» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Ya'iqoobinna yaaddoti seemma ifixxa dare hidhake'ninna yaaddotixxa seemmanna usudhdheexxi belto ifike heddo barra oodhe. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Labbaxxinna meyyaxxi isixxi oose duuchcha isoo dayyeessito'a dagge; kaddo malee isi dayya'a gophemmaxxee, «Oodhaa'ninni belto ankiba'a bale giddo e'yanno» hiyya'n belto ifike oodhe.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Eettene yanna'n Midiyaamitotixxe daddalto Yooseefii Gibtse boga'n Feri'oonike ja'laaba heqqaluwwiinke ajajallo, Pheexxifaara'n gurgurte.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s1">Yihudaannaa Ti'imaari'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Yanna eettenee Yihuda dayyuwwa ifikenaa'ni gargar higeexxi Adolomichcho Hiira hiyyemaake manjichchinni hedho'a adadde me'e. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Ookkonna Yihuda Kenaanichcho Seewaanixxa belto afe; iseenna aadheexxi welt diiphe. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Isenna siila'witeexxi labba belto ilde; Yihudanna beltiinka summa «Eeri» hiyye fulche. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Higgeenna siila'wite labba belto ilde; summaknna «Awunaan» hite fulchite. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Higgeenna labbeexxi labba belto ilde; summa isikanna Seeloomi hite fulchite; isenna iso'o ildaa wodda Yihuda Koozibi hiyyemaake booncho'n hedhemman.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Yihuda angafa ifike belto Eeri'a Ti'imaar hiyyendaaxxa belto aadhise. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Yihudak angaf belti Eeri kinn Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo fuggichchakemman; tennexxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti iso'o shiye. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Yihudanna Awunaanii'i, «Herelchummati atike dayyixxa galchitee summi isik ba'abaashsha sanne sa'issi» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Awunaani kinni ilemaak finni isik summinni ye'emabaaxxa ege'nemmaxxee dayyiinxe arenni diipheexxa yanna duuchcha finnake kaddammaxxa sanne butta duna'n dayyinke summinni finni ilemabaashsha asse. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Tinni asseexxi yaane Duuchchi Woddik Gootti edo fuggoxxe kaddeemmaxxee'e Duuchch Woddik Gootti isoo shiye. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yihuda ifike beltixxa are Ti'imaari, «Belt ank Seela aadha geyaa qico'ni atike anniba marte hiyyeetummati ofo'li» hiyye. Isinna tenne hiyyeechchi Seeloominna dayyuwwa isikishshanni reyaan hiyye sodaatemmaxxeeten. Tennexxe Ti'imaar me'iteexxi ifike annike mi'ne'n ofolde.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Qeerraaxxe yanna Yihudaxxi are, Shu'axxi belto, rerte. Yihuda yaaddo dayyefatteechchi uduma gedhebo isika orda cira'nemmake manniba'a Adolomichcho Hiiranni welti Temina'a allale me'e. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Mannikinna Ti'imaari'a, «Kunnise atike aro'ik anni ifike gedhebixxa orda cira'neeka manniba'a Temini'a me'a'neen» hiyyende kulnde. <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />Ti'imaarinna hiyyeetummatixxa seemma fulchexxeexxi ayyumma isexxi ege'nendabaashsha alba ifika boondeti buqqexxeexxi Timini'a me'ammake ori qarqara hedheeke Enaayim hiyyemaake qachchixxe hula'n ofolde; tenneenna assiteechchi Seeloomi nophphe aadha geye'naan isee aadhaabaashsha hoyyemeexxa egendemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Alba ifika boondeti buqexxee'naa Yihuda isee uudaa wodda yababulto manjichcho iso'n fakkaatte. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Belto ifikixxe are kaddeexxa ege'na gopheemmaxxee'e ise hexxebaa oriinbaa shikki hiyyeexxi, «Ballo magane atinni diiphoo?» Hiyye. Isenna «Atinni diiphonnole maa ani'a uutatto?» Hite qorte.<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Isinna «Hori anki giddii'n mitte re'eti buruusa ati'a ergannon» hiyye. Isenna, «Re'etika buruusa ergittatto qico'n abidishsha maachcho ani'a uutatto» hite qorte.<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Isinna, «Maa abidishsha atiaa uwwanno?» Hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Isenna, «Tenne atixxa maxxansixxa qube ise usurnginni, iittanni tenne abixiteettexxa siqqichcho ani'a uwwi» hite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Tennexxee qorteechcho duuchcha ise'a uwweexxi isenni diiphe; isenna siila'wite. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Ookkoneechchi uduma buqexxemmaxxa boonde hoyyeexxeexxi hiyyeetummatixxa seemmanna haaroba oddo'wite.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Yihudanna abidilshakee uwwemmachchuwwa manjichchotenaa'n aadhdho'a re'etika buruusa jaalo ifike Adolomichcho Hiira'ni erge; Hiiranna erganjo gophe. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Manjichchikinna «Eenaamike qachchixxe hula'n oriin qarqara hexxemmaxxi itti yabaabulto manjichcho haba hexxe?» Hiyye manna qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Mannikinna, «Konne loola'n hara yabaabulto manjo hexxemmabaan» hine.<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Tennexxee manjichchi Yihudabaa illee iima higeexxi, «Ise gopheeneni ookkone olla'ik manninna ‹Konne loola'n Yabaabulto manjo hara hexxemmabaan› hiyye» ane'ni kule.<verse eid="GEN 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yihudanna, «Ise abidilsemalcho ookkonee adhdhiteeshshanni gatilsituun; iitta kada gophpheele oso'lemannan. Kaddo malee ani konne recco ise'a ergeennan; atinna hasse isee affebexxon» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Sakkake agenji uduma, «Atike beltixxi are yababuldee'en; tennenaa'n kexxeexxeninna siila'wite'een» hiyyende Yihuda'n kulende.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Yihudanna, «Ise'e gadhi'a fulche giirate'n gubenduun» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Iseenna abidendeexxi gadhi'a fuldee wodda, «Aniqqa siila'wennek konne miyike anni'aaten; tenne maxxansixxa qube ise usurendemmachchonna tinni siqichcho ayyixxe kaddeexxa egendoottole uudi» hita'n ifike aro'iinke anna'n ergite.<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yihudanna, «Ookkonee mi'ya ege'neexxi ank belti Seeloome isee galchaashsha assa gophennaxxee ise ani erra dhugaatixxen» hiyye. Ookkoneechchi uduma isenni langaxxa diiphebaan.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Ildaaxxi barra geltee wodda kunnise ise godobi giddo lakko hexxemman. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Ildaammaa woddanna mitti anga gadhi'a fulche; hobbaassammaxxinna «Kunn edise fuleen hita'n» anga isixxe'n diimmoka shimala usurte. <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Yaane kinni anga ifixxa hiissedhee wodda dayyi isik luffi hiiyye fule; hobbaassammaxxi manjichchonna, «Hitta luffi hite fuldette?» Hite; tennexxe summa isika Faaresi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:29 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Faaresi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyya </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ibrititotike laagadinni luffi hiyye fulate </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyaten.</char></note> hiyyeme. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Ookkoneechchi uduma anga isixxe'ni diimmok shimala usurreemmak isiki dayyi ileme; summi isikinna Zaarahi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:30 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Zaara</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hitaaxxi hiyya Ibrititotike laagadinni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diimmoxxe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookaan </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Boro haachchabbamma woddike ifa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyatishaten.</char></note> hiyyeme.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s1">Yooseefiinna Phiixifaaraxxa Are</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Eettenne Yanna Yooseefi Gibtse'a adhdhemeemman; Feri'oonike ja'laabuwwinaa'n heqqanjuwwiink ajajalli Gibtse bogik manji Pheexxifaara ookko isoo iyyemarte'emmaxxee Isima'elitotenaa'n Yooseefi'i hidhdhe. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Yooseefinni hedhemman; yaane duuchchinna isi'a qajeelde; isinna iso'o galchaamake Gibtseke manjike mine'n hedha'nemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Erga. Huj. 7:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti isinni hedheexxannaa asseexxi duuchchanna isi'a qajeldeexxa uude wodda, <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Yooseefinna iso'ni elle alfe; isike shiqike erganjonna kade; Phiixifaaranna mine ifike'ni isoo baallonse; karra duuchchanna anga isixxe'ni waale. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Isi Yooseefii ifike mine'n baalonseexxe yannanaa'n Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Yooseefixxe hiyyeexxi okko Gibtsichchiinka mine eebbise; Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi eebba mene gadho, Phiixifaara afeechcho duuchcha'n kadde. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Tennexxee Phiixifaara afeechcho duuchcha'n Yooseefii baalonse; itaaxxe yaane gadhi darre duuchchinxa yaane Yooseefixxe anga'n waaleemman.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yooseefinna dhagga danchummandinni biifa'nemmakemman. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yooseefike goottixxi are Yooseefi'ni ille uggiteexxi isoo, «Amo aninni diiphi» hite. <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Isi kinni gibeexxi gootta ifikixxe are'n hiyyee qici, «Ank gootti mine ifike'n hedheechcho kunni konnechcho hiyye mittelcho ege'nebaan; afeechcho duuchchanna anxe anga'n uwwe'een. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Mine konne'n anenaa'n sa'aak ayyinna hedheba'an; isi ane'n uwwebaachchi ate'e mitte callan, tinninna isixxe are kaddettexxeeten; tenne fuggoxxa yaane assiyyoti hitta Magen edo cubbo hujanno?» Hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Isenna tenne yaane barra barra'ninni Yooseefi'n haasota'nemman; Yooseefi kinni isenni diiphaaxxa waalni ise bira hedha eeyyebaani.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Barratixxa barra Yooseefi hujetee mini'a e'ye; mini giddo ergatammake erganjuwwinaa'ninna ayyinna mine hedhemmabaa. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Isenna seemma isixxa abideexxi, «Aninni diiphi» hite; isi kinni seemma ifixxa anga isixxe'n wocci asseexxi minii'n baaje fule. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Isenna seemma ifixxa anga isexxe'n wocci assee baaje fuleexxa uuddeexxinna, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />ise'a ergatammaka erganjuwwa mini'a yexxeexxi insa'ne'n hitee qici, «Uuddineen adana kunni Ibirichchi dage'echchi no'oo gacifato'ate; isinna aninni diipho'a kaba'i qico'n dage; yaane kinni ani raare xinisiisenne. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Ani raare xinisiisennexxa laqexxinna seemma ifixxa ani bira hune baaje minii'n fule» hite.<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Yooseefik gootti mini'a dagaa qico'ni seemma isixxa ifi biranni uggite. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Isinna dagaa wodda kaddeemmaxxa yaane iso'n hite kuldee qici, «Ati iyyedaggettak Ibirichchi garbichchi ane'n gacifato'a hedhennebaa dage. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Aninna manni dhaqqabaashsha raare xinnisiisannale seemma ifixxa ane'ni hune baaje gadhi'a fule» hite.<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Yooseefik goottinna are ifixxi tenne isik garbichchi isee asseexxa yaane iso'n haasottee'naa laqee wodda yo'oshsha aare, <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Yooseefik goottinna Yooseefii aadheexxi moyanji manna usuramake mine'ni iyyemare usure.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:20">Yaane kinni Yooseefi okko usurrii mine'n hedhemma wodda, <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti isinni welti hedhemman; ba'lunte ifixxanna isi'a birasisse; usuriinke minike ajajallo'ninna elle alfaashsha asse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Erga. Huj. 7:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Tennexxee usurriinke minik ajajalli Yooseefi'i usurememmake manni duuchchike ajajallo asse; usuriinke mini giddo hujendaaxxe huje duuchchanna isoo uudaake kade. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Yooseefinni hedheemmaxxee'e asseexxa duuchcha isi'a qajeelcha'nemmaxxee usurriinke minik ajajalli Yooseefii uudda'nemmaxxe yaane duuchchixxe mitte yaadonna afe'emmabaan.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s1">Ha'wa Shiqishaammakeranna Itatike Minikara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Tinni yaane kaddeechchi uduma, Gibtsik moyanji'a ha'wa shiqishaammakinnaa isixxe itake minik manjichchi goota ifika Gibtseka moyanjo mufachchiseexxa yaane assine. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Feri'ooninna ifike laminiinge ja'laabuwwa'ni ha'wo shiqishaammake mannike sooresa'ninna itati minike ajajallo'ni yo'oshsha mufate. <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />Tennexxee Yooseefi usureme hedhemmake usuriinke mine'ni heqqaammak mannik ajajallike mine'ni insa'ne usuremmaashsha asse. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Usurriinke miniki ajajallinna konne lame manna Yooseefi'n uwwe; Yooseefinna insa'ne'a ergatema'nemman.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:4">Insa'nenna usurriinke mine'n e'yineexxi heenoxxa barra turre.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Lamiingi usurreemmak manni, moyanjokee ha'wa shiqishaammakinna ita ra'isaammake mannik ajajalli mitte hashsha'n ifi ifixxa oojjo oojjonte; insa'ne lamiingixxe oojjo ifi ifinxe tika affeemmaxxen.<verse eid="GEN 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Langa baro gorsa Yooseefi insa'neeba maraa wodda lamiingi yaandaa'naa afe; <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Isinna ifike goottike usuriinke min'ne isinni welti hedhemmaka Feri'oonika ja'laabuwwa, «Mayeeta telcho ha'no albi giddo yaaddineeshsha hexxineek?» Hiyye insa'nee qore.<verse eid="GEN 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Insa'nenna «No'o lamiingi oojjo oojjontenneni» yaane kinni «Oojjo no'oxxa tikaaka gonpheennen» hineexxi hiisine iso'n haasonne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Yooseefinna, «Oojjo tikatixxa dande'a uwwaak Magenoken. Tennexxee ha'noo mitti mittiniigi oojjotineexxa oojje ane'n kulle» insa'nee hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Ha'wa shiqishammake mannik ajajalli hiyya'n oojjo ifixxa Yooseefi'n kulee qici, «Ani oojjoti ifi edo mitte woyinetika haqichcho afenne. <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />Kunne woyinetik haqichchi sase dame afe'emman; isinna ikki woddi kichcho fulche daraare, isixxe rodduwwaxxi gummanna raxxe. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Feri'ooni buuda anga abixxeenaa; woyinetixxa gumma qoce'e eettene buuda'ni miicennexxi buuda moyanjoke'n anga isixxe'n uwwenne» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Yooseefinna iso'n hiyyee qici, «Yoona oojjotixxi tika: sase dame, sase barran. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Sase barra giddo Feri'ooni atee usurrakeena'n tikaan; edixxe atixxe hujebaanna atee hiissaan; edi wodda ha'wa isi'a shiqishsha'n ergatendatta woddishsha Feri'oonixxa buuda anga isixxe'n uutatton. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Yaane kinni duuchchiinxi ati'a eldaa wodda anee qaabbattettexxi ani'a ba'lati; anxa yaanenna Feri'ooni'n kuldettexxi konne usurriinke minenaa'n fulannoshsha assi. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Ani Ibiritotike boganaa'n kaba dageennechchi eeyyatite kaddebaak hunnatiten; ta'anna kaba anee konne usurri'a geessisseexxa mitte balleessanna hujebo'non» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Ita ra'isendammake minik ajajallinna ha'wa shiqishammakixxi oojjoxxi tika eloxxe kaddeexxa afeexxi, ifixxa oojjonna Yooseefi'n hiyye kulee qici, «Aninna oojjo oojjoteennan; oojjoti sase ginbe golalooka buddeena umoke'n dulkeennan; <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Iimi darreke ginbi giddo Feri'ooni'a ra'isendeexxe gargar hexxeexxe ita hexxemman; yaane kinni ci'a ookkone anke umo'n hedhemmake ginbinaa'n ita itta'nemman» hiyye kule.<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yooseefinna hiyyeexxi haaso'ee qici, «Oojjotixxi tika: sasi ginbi sase barran, <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />sase barra giddo Feri'ooni usurri minii'n atee fulcheexxi haqichchoke'n atee fannisaan; allaattetinna maala atika ittaan» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Sakkaxxi barra Feri'oonixxe ilenshake ayyaanamman; isinna ifika ja'laabuwwa duuchcha itise ha'wisse. Eettene barra'n ha'wa shiqishammake mannika ajajallonna ita ra'issammake mannika ajajallo usurriinke minii'n ifike ja'laabuwwi edo shinqaashsha asse. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Ha'wa shiqishammake mannika ajajalli edixxe huje isixxe'n isoo hiise; isinna edishshanna buuda anga Feri'oonixxe'n uwwate'n ke'e. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Ita ra'issammake mannika ajajallo kinni Yooseefi insa'nee tikemashshanni isoo fanisse.<verse eid="GEN 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Yaane kinni ha'wa shiqisheemmake mannik ajajalli Yooseefi'i dedhee malee'e qaabbatebaan.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s1">Feri'oonixxa Oojjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Lame wogga uduma Feri'ooni oojjo oojjote: oojjoti isi Abbaayike galaan qarqara uurreemman. <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />Dhagga ela'neek fuddalammi torbaani lali wodi'i giddii'n fuleexxi wodi'in qarqara hexxeexa anso dheda'nemman. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Higgeenna weli dhagga eeyyisa'nebaak huqqate miqe calli gatte'eek torbaani lali wodi'i giddii'n fuleexxi edise fulemmake lali bira wodi'in qarqara uurre. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Kunni dhagga eeyyisaabak huqqate miqe calli gatteemmak lali okkone dhagga ela'neeka furdallamma lalo liqiinse. Ookkoneechchi uduma Fari'oon diiphokenaa'n dammaqe. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Fari'ooninna higgeen diipheexxi wele oojjo oojjote: oojjoti mitti midhatik agadi ela'neeka unkuruure'eka torbaane deeggichcho ibisaa'naa afe. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Ookkoneechchi uduma sibirooteexxanna borotixxi diidallo gande'naa shewwewwiteexxa wele torbaane deeggichcho ibise. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Iikki Sibiro'eek torbaani deeggichchi elaammakannaa bokkeeka ookkonee torbaane deeggichcho liqiinse; Feri'ooninna diiphokenaa'n dammaqeen, adana oojjotemman. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Feri'ooninna bogi soodaa wodda yaadik raanke; Tennexxee Gibtseke bogi giddo oojjo tikaakeerannaa beekkole duuchcha ye'iseexxi oojjotemmaxxa oojjo insa'ne'n kule; kaddo malee eettene oojjo isi'a dande'eexxi tikeek hedhebaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:2">Dan. 2:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Ookkone wodda ha'wa shiqishammake mannik ajajalli Feri'ooni'i hiyyee qici, «Moyanjoo! Edo hujennexxa balleessa ta'a kassi hiyyenneni. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Tinninna, ati mitte yanna ane'ninna atike itatike mannike ajajallo'n mufattettexxi usuremeeka manna heqqammaka mannika ajajallike mine'n no'o usursiisseettan. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />No'o lamiingi mitte hashsha'n ifi fixxa oojjo oojjontenne; no'o lamiingixxi oojjo ifi ifinxe tika afeemmaxxen. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Ookkone wodda usurriinke minike heqqanjuwwike ajajallik erganji mitti Ibirichchi dargaggeessi no'onni welt usuremeemman; no'o ifi ifi'a oojjontennexxa oojjo iso'n kullenne wodda isinna no'oxxe oojjuwwaxxa tika no'o'ni kule; no'o lamiingixxe oojjo oojjoshshanni tika no'o'a uwwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Yaane duuchcha isi no'o'a oojjo tikemmashshanni kadde; anee edixxe anxe hujebaa higenne; ita shiqishammake mannik ajajalinna fanniseme» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Tennexxe Feri'ooni'a Yooseefii usurriinke minenaa'n dagaashsha ajaje; hirba ookkone'ni Yooseefii usurri minenaa'n aa'ne dange; umo ifikanna haaxxeexxi seemma jijjiidhdheechchi uduma Feri'oon edo dage. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Feri'ooninna Yooseefi'n, «Ani oojjo oojjotennen; isee ani'a tika dande'aaka mitte manjonna gophenne; ati kinni oojjo ate'n kulendoole ise tika dandeettattoxxa laqeennen» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />«Yooseefinna Feri'ooni'n ani oojjo tikatixxa ege'na afebo'non; yaane kinni Mageni Feri'ooni hasaaxxa tika uwwaan» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Feri'ooninna «Oojjot ani Abbaayike galaani qarqara uurreennan; <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />Dhagga ela'neekinna furdallammi torbaani lali wodi'i giddii'n fuleexxi anso dheedaa'naa afenne. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Ookkonneer uduma huqqatee miqe ce'e hite gattaa qico'ni haphphateek weli torbaani lali wodi'i giddii'ni fule; konne lalishsha hedheeka elobaak lalo Gibtseke boga duuchcha'n haranga uude ege'nebe'non. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Kunni dhagga ela'nebaaki huqqate miqe calli gatte'ek lali edise fulemmaka torbaane furdallamma lalo liqiinse. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Iikki lali okkone lalo liqinseechchi udumanna dhagga edi woddishshanni eeyyisa'nemmabaake, liqinse'exxanna ege'nisha'nemmabaan; ookkoneechchi uduma aninna diiphokenaa'n dammaqenne. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Iittanni oojjoti mitti midhatik agadi torbaane ela'neekannaa sibeeka deeggichcho ibisee'naa afenne. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Ookkoneechchi uduma borotixxi diidallo gande'naa sibiro'eexxi shewwewwe'eka wele torbaane deeggichcho ibise. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Torbaani shewwewweemak deeggichchuwwi torbbaane ela'nemmaka deeggichchuwwa liqiinse; tennee oojjo tikammake manna'n kulenne, yaane kinni mittikinna isee ani'a dande'e tikeek hedhebaan.»<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Yooseefinna Feri'ooni'i hiyyee qici, «Lamiinxi atixxi oojjo weli labbaxxennaa mitteten. Mageni edi'a asso'a hedheexxa yaane ediseenni ate'n kule'en. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Torbaani elollammi lali, torbaane woggan; torbaan elollammi deeggichchuwwinna torbaane woggan; lamiinxi oojjo weli labbaxxenna mitteten. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Konneer uduma fuleek huqqate miqe calla gatte'emakiirinna eeyyisa'nemmabaak torbaani lali torbaane woggan; iitanni borotixxi diidallo ganda'nemmakinna shewweweemmak torbaani deeggichchuwwinna torbaane woggan: tinni torbaane solo'iinxe woggan. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Edisennexxi ate'ni kulenneshshanni Mageni edi'a asso'a hedheexxa yaane edisen ate'n leellishe'een. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Gibtseke boga'n hara bira sa'eek goddi kadaaxxi torbaane wogga daggaan. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Ookkoneechchi uduma kinni torbaane solo'iinxi wogga daggaan; Gibtseke boga'n hedhemmak goddinna dedhemaan; solo'ikinna boga miidhaan. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Eettenne goddiinxe wogguwwa uduma dagaak solo'i hara ha'ureeke kaddeemmaxxee'e okkone boga'n kadeemmak goddi qaabbatemmabaan. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Oojjo lamele oojjota atixxi, tenne yaane Mageni mureexxe kaddeemmaxxee Mageni shiqoxxe yanna'n ise'e muuxaan.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />«Tennexxe yoona qalbeefachchonna beekkuma afeeka manjo hassettexxi konne Gibtseke boga'n isoo baalonsi. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Iittanni eettene torbaane goddiinxe wogga'n aaggaaxxi midha, ondixxenaa'n mitte anga bukki assaaka manna baalonsi. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Insa'nenna dagga'neexxe goddiinxe woggaxxa midha duuchchinaa'n bukki assinnowwaal dinnetanna Feri'oonixxe alcha hundanna aasinowwaal; itate kaddaashshanna qachcha qachcha'ni heqqinowwaal. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Tinni bukki assenda'neexxi midha Gibtseke boga'ni edi'a daggaaxxe torbaane solo'iinxe wogga'a ukatake kaddaan; konne qicininna bogi solo'ik ba'abaan.»<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Kunni herregi Feri'ooninna isik ja'laabuwwa'n eloke labe leelle. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Feri'ooninna «Mageniink Hafuur iso'ni galeeka Yoosefi caalaaka manjo hara alfinabo'non» Hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Feri'ooninna Yooseefii'i hiyyee qici, «Tinni duuchcha ate'ni ifiseek Magenoken; atishsha hedheek beekinna qalbeefachcho afeeki manji hedhebaan. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Ati anke mootomatike mine'ni umoke kaddatton; anki ardi duuchchinna ati hitattoxxe'n galaan; ani atenaa'n sa'annok anxe moote callinniten.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:10">Erga. Huj. 7:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 41:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoosefi Gibtseke Boga'n Baallome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Feri'ooni Yooseefii, «Gibtseka boga duuchcha'ni ate baallonsenne» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Feri'ooninna ifike baallomika beesisa affeexxa qube qubichcho ifikenaa'n fulcheexxi Yooseefike qubichcho'n ugge; iittanni layinotike shimalixxa seemmanna iso'n oddeesse; gooba isike'ninna worqetika haachchaba oddeesse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:29">Dan. 5:29</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Ifixxe langaxxe fadhadiinxe gaare'ni ofo'lishe; mannikinna isi edo, «Kumbullisse» hiyya'n lallaba'nemman; konnee qicinni Gibtseke boga duuchcha'ni isoo baallonse. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Feri'ooninna Yooseefi'i, «Ani Feri'ooniten, atike ajaji belo Gibtseke boga duuchcha'n ayyinna mittechcho assa dande'abaan» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Feri'ooni Yooseefii'i «Tsafinat Pa'inah»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:45: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Tsafinat Pe'inah: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gibtsike laagadinni Tsafinat Pa'inah hiyya magen haaso'ee'naa isi hedhaan hiyyaten.</char></note> hiyye summa isi'a fulche. Iittanni Heliyootuke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">laakkossa 50 giddo hedheeka mitteba abideexxi Holiyopoolii'i leellishaan.</char></note> qachchike qeesichchixxa, Pheexxifaaraxxa belto Asinati hinaaxxa isi'a aadhise. Yooseefinna Gibtseke bogi giddo duuchcha mareme.<verse eid="GEN 41:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Yooseefi Gibtseka moyanjo Feri'ooni'a ergatema safee wodda wogga isixxi sase tommemman; Yooseefinna Feri'oon edii'n fuleexxi Gibtseke bogi giddo duuchcha mareme <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Torbaaniinxe goddiinxe wogga'n buttin hara bira saxxeexxa midha uwwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Yooseefi tenne torbaane goddiinxe wogga giddo Gibtseke boga'n afendeexxa midha bukki asseexxi qachcha qachcha'n tuule; mitte mittenge qachcha'n tuulendeemmaxxi midha okkone qachchike loola'n wiisendeexxemman. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Yooseefinna abbaayatike maanchishsha hara bira saxxeexxa midha tuule; midha hara bira saxxeexxe kaddemmaxxee ise borreessa uurrisaa qico'ni ise mika dandeessisse'emmabaan.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Torbaane solo'iinxi wogga daggeba edi darre Heliyootu hiyyemaake qachchike qeesichchixxi, Pheexxifaaraxxi belto Asinati'i Yooseefi'a lame labbaxxa oose ilde. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Yooseefiinna, «Mageni rakko anxanna hado anka dedhannoshsha asseen» hiyya'n ifika angafa belto summaa Minaase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:51: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Minaase: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrititotike laagadinni Minaase hiyya dedhannoshsha asse'een hiyyaten</char></note> hiyye fulche. <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Iittanni, «Rakkateennange boga'ni Mageni anee gummatike asse» hiyya'ni ifike langake beltika summa Efireemi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:52: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Eefireemi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyya Ibritotike laagadinni </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Caala gummatike </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hitaaxxa tika afe'eeke hiyyichchinn welti fakkataake ye'injo afeedheen.</char></note> hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Gibtseke bogixxi torbaane goddiinxi wogga saxxeenaa, <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />Yooseefi edi wodda haaso'emmashshanni torbaane woggaki solo'i safe. Weli duuchchiingi boguwwi solo'wee wodda Gibtseke boga duuchcha'n kinni midha hexxemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:11">Erga. Huj. 7:11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Solo'ikinna Gibtseke boga'n ba'lata'n me'ee wodda ardi «Indannochcho no'o'a uwwi!» Hiyya'n Feri'ooni'n cance. Feri'ooninna Gibtseka arda duuchcha «Yooseefiba martineexxi isi hiyyaaxxa asse» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:5">Yoh. 2:5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Solo'i Gibtseke boga duuchcha'n geyeemmaxxenna jabaateemmaxxee'e Yooseefi gootaruwwa baneexxi midha Gibtseke manna'n gurgurendaashsha asse. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Solo'i butta duuchcha'n jabaatemmaxxee'e bogi duuchchik manni Yooseefiinaa'n midha hidhdhatee Gibtse'a dage.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s1">Yooseefik Dayyuwwi Gibtse'a Me'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Ya'iqoobi Gibtse midha hexxeexxa laqeexxi ifixxa labbaxxa oose hiyyee qici, «Mayee weli weli uuddina? <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Gibtse boga'ni midha hexxeexxa laqeennen; hedhoti he'nannoshshannaa reyotenaa'n gantannoshsha Gibtse aade martine midha no'o'a hirre» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:12">Erga. Huj. 7:12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yooseefik tomminiingi dayyuwwi midha hiro'a aade Gibtse mare. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Yaane kinni miitaaxxi yaane iso'n geltaa'n hiyyati sodaatemmaxxee Ya'iqoobi Yooseefinni welti mitte amake godobinaa'ni i'lrrka dayyo ifika Biiniyaamii wele isike dayyuwwinni welt Gibtse'a ergebaan. <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Kenaanike boga'n solo'i hedhemmaxxee midha hiratee Gibtse'a me'a'neeke manni giddo Isira'eelixxi labbaxxi oosenna hexxemman.<verse eid="GEN 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Ookkone wodda Yooseefi ookkene bogike galchallomman; bogi boginaa'ni dagaammake manni'a midha gurguraammaki isotemman; Yooseefik dayyuwwinna isiba genneexxi isi'a kumbulise. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Yooseefinna dayyuwwa ifika uudeeshshanni ege'ne; yaane kinni insa'nee ege'nebaake ifi asseexxi mufeti, «Ha'no habaa'n daggineeke manna?» Hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Insa'nenna «Midha hidhdhinonnaa Kanaanii'ni dangeennen» hine.<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Yooseefi dayyuwwa ifika ege'nolenna insa'ne iso'o egenneemmabaan. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Yooseefinna ifike dayyuwwixxee oojjotemmaxxa oojjo kassi hiyyeexxi, «Ha'no colibaleeyyeeten; hunna no'oke bogixxi gooffeeba uudatte dagineke mannan.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:5-10">Dada. 37:5-10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Isa'nenna isoo hinee qici, «No'oke gootta no'o colibaleeyyetebaan; no'o atik erganjuwwan kaba midha hidhdhinonnaa dangennen. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />No'o duuchchiingi mitte annixxe oosen; no'o atike erganjuwwi dhugaatike manna malee colibaleeyyetebaan» hine.<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Yooseefinna insa'ne'ni hiisexxi, «Waawwo! Ha'no daggineechchi hunna no'oke bogixxi gooffeeba uudateeten» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Insa'ne kinni hiissineexxi, «No'o atik erganjuwwi kenaanike boga'n hedha'neeke mitti manjichchi ileexxe tommenna lame dayyuwwan; maa'nichchi dayyi no'ok anniinba hedheen; mitti no'oki dayyi kinni hedhebaan» hine.<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Yooseefinna insa'nee, «Ha'no'n haaso'enneshshanni ha'no colibaleeyyeten; <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Maa'nichcho ha'nook dayyi kaba daga gopheexenni Feri'oon ani'a reyo ha'no kabaa'ni ittanna mishiki hitinabaan; yoonna ayyumma ha'nooxxi ege'nedaak tennenniten. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Ha'no giddii'n mitte ergitine'naa okkone ha'nooka dayyo aadheexxi iyyedagowwaal; haasotinemmak haaso'e kokeessemma qico ha'no gattineek usurriinke mine'ni turtinaan; haasottineshsha kada gophphoole kinni Feri'ooni ani'a reyo; ha'no duuchching colbaleeyyeten» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma insa'nee sase barra usuriinke mine'n turse.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Sakkaxxa barra Yooseefii insa'nee hiyyee qici, «Ani Mageno sodaatanaxxe lubbo gattino'a assinaaxxi yaane: <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Ha'no dhugaatike manna kaddinoole ha'noo giddii'n mitti ha'nook dayyi kaba usurriinke mine'n turaan; ha'no weli gattineek solo'wemake ha'noke hadi'a midha aaxxine iyyemarre. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Ha'nooka maa'nichcho dayyo kinni iyyedaga hasissaan; konne qicinni haasotinemmak haaso'i dhugaatike kadeexxa kokeesemaan; ha'nonna reyotenaa'n gattinaan» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:20">Insa'nenna konnee yaado assino'a adhdhine. <verse eid="GEN 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Insa'nenna weli'aanni weli «Dayyo no'oka balleessinennaxxe balleessaxxe tinni abara no'o'ni gelteen; okkone wodda isi wixxirri hiyyeexxi lubbotee no'oo kadhatee wodda laqa ginbeneennan; tennexxeten kunni abar no'o'n geyeechchi» hine.<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Roobelinna, «Konne belto'n fuggoxxa assitinoqqe'e hiyyennabaa? Ha'no kinni ani hiyyennexxa laqa gibbine; kunnise ta'a lubbo isixxi no'onaa'n hasenda'neen» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:21-22">37:21-22</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Yooseefi insa'nenni haaso'emmak weli tikaa'naate kaddeemmaxxee insa'neeka afo'o Yooseefi ege'neexxa egenneemmabaan. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Yooseefinna insa'nenaa'ni gamake'n higeexxi oodhe; ookkoneechchi uduma insa'neeba'a ille iima higeexxi higgeenna insa'nenni haaso'e; Simooninna oddo insa'neexxenaa'n aadheexxi insa'ne edo usure.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Yooseefinna qalqallo insa'neexxe'n midha wonshinaashsha, mitte mittingika birretika sibljo anni anninixxe qalqallo'n hiissineexxi ugginaashshannaa orakeenna gala'a insa'ne'aa uunaashsha Yooseefi ajaje. Tinni insa'ne'a assendeechchi uduma, <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />ifi ifixxa midha ifi ifixxe harre'n fe'e'neexxi okko'n ke'ne me'ine.<verse eid="GEN 42:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Ora galeeba insa'ne giddii'n mitti harre ifixxe midhanaa'n uwwo'a qalqallo ifixxa tikaa wodda qalqallotike afo'o'n ifika biretika sbljo afe. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Isinna dayyuwwa ifike'n «Ang birretik siblji ani'a hige'e, kunna'a anxe qalqallo giddo» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:28">Insa'ne duuchchiing alanne culphinse weli uunda'n weli'aani weli, «Isi Magen no'o'n asseexxi tinni yaane maachcho?» Hine.<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Kenaanike boga'n hedheek ifike anniba Ya'iqoobiba genneechchi uduma; insa'ne'n gelteexxa duuchcha hinee iso'ni kullee qici, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />«Ookkone bogik gootti boga dooyinaanneshsha no'oo asse uudiyyot mufet no'o'n haaso'e. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />No'o kinni iso'n hinenee qici, ‹No'o dhugaatike manna malee colibaleeyyetebaan. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />No'o tommenna lame dayyuwwa mitte annixxe ooseen; mitti no'oki dayyi hedhebaan; maa'nichchi no'ok dayyi anna no'okiba Kenaan hedhe› hinenne.<verse eid="GEN 42:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />«Ookkoneechchi uduma manjichchikinna ‹Dhugaatike manna kaddineexxa egennonnaa ha'no giddii'n mitti kaba aniba gatee'naa weli gattineek solo'weeke ha'nooke hadi'a midha aaxxine me'e. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Yaane kinni dayyo ha'nooka maa'nichcho aniba iyyedagge; ookkone wodda colibaleeyyete kaddineebaaxxa ege'nannon; dayyo ha'nookanna ha'no'a ille iima hiissannon; ha'nonna konne bogi giddo dadda'litinaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookaan eetineeshsha marema dandeetinaan</char></note>› » hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Midhatanna ififixxe qalqallo giddii'n fulchinaa wodda mitti mittingi ififixxe qalqallo giddo guduunfemeeka birretika sibljo anfe; insa'nenna anni insa'neek konne guduunfemeeka maallaqa afee wodda lumoshsha sodaante. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Anni insa'neek Ya'iqoobinna insa'nee, «Anee finni belo gatissineelaqi; Yooseefii hedheba'a; Simooniinna hedhebaan; ta'anna kinni Biiniyaamiinna adhdhitine me'itino'aaten. Isi maa yaane tinni duuchchi ane'n dagge!» Hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Roobelinna anna ifika, «Biniyaamii atiba illee iima hiisse iyyedaga gophonoole anxa lamiinxa labbaxxa oose shiyi; isixxa yaane ane'n waali; aninninni insoo atiba ille iima hiisse iyyedagannon» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Ya'iqoobinna «Haranga belti anki ha'nonni ookko adadde me'abaan; dayyi isik godobik reyedheen gateek iso callan. Isoo adhdhitine me'itinaa'naa orake'n mitte yaane iso'ni geltoole ane'e cimo giddo yaaddoti reyannoshsha assitinaan» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s1">Yooseefik Dayyuwwixxa, Langaxa Gibtse'a Me'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Solo'i Kanaanike boga'n jabaateeshshanni hedhemman. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Gibtsee'n iyyedangemmaxxa midha indee'naa muddee wodda anni insa'neeki, «Amme higgine martineexxi midha shixxonxa no'a hirre» insa'nee hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Yihuda kinni iso'n «Iikki Manjichchi ‹Ha'nooka dayyo iyyedaga gophphinoole ani edo shiqqinoqqe'e› hiyye no'o jaba qico xexxe'achchise'een; <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Dayyi no'ok no'oni aade maro'a ergitaattole marennexxi midha ati'a hirrannon. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Iso erga gophphatole kinni ikki manjichchi ‹Dayyo ha'nooka iyyedaga gophphinoole ani edo shiqqinoqqe'e› hiyyemmaxxee no'onna okko aade marrabo'no» hine.<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Isira'eelinna, « ‹Wele dayyonna anfe'eennen› hitinee ookkone manjichcho'n kulati tenne rakko duuchcha ane'n mayee iyyedagine?» Hiyye insa'nee qore.<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Insa'nenna, «Majichchi ikki, ‹Anni ha'nook lubbo hedhenni hedhee? Wele dayyonna afine'ee?› Hiyya'ni no'oo qoreeke qortumika hiissichcho isi'a uunenne malee ‹Dayyo ha'nooka aaxxine kaba'a iyyedagge› hiyyaaxxa hitta egennannata?» Hine.<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Yihudanna anna ifika Isira'eelii hiyyee qici, «Beltichchi aninni me'o'a ergi, no'onna ranke ke'ne me'ino; tinni kaddoole ati, no'onna oose no'oxxi rennabe'non, gantanno. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Konne beltixxee annoomma ani umi anikinni adhdhanon; isixxe ane calla laqemannon; nege'iki qullo hedhe'naa isoo ille iima hiisse iyyedagennexxi ate'n uwwa gophphonnole baro anike duuchcha'n ati edo aallatemo. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Konnee qico, hekki hiyya gonphennele silaati lamele genne hingeenna woddamman.»<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma anni insa'neek Ya'iqoobi insa'nee, «Yoona yaane itatike kaddoole assitinaa qici: buttin no'ok fulcheexxe elolla yaane duuchchanaa'n shiixxooxxa belsaani, shiixxoka malebo, heenoonxa fishshaxxa qurunfuduwwa, karbe temirennaa lewuze qalqallo ha'nooxxe'n uggitineexxi uwwatishsha ookkne manjichchi'a iyyemarre. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Ha'noxxe qalqallo giddo wirri hiyye higemmaka ookkone birretika sibljo hiissa hasissammaxxe birretika sibljo lame anga assitine aaxxine me'e. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Dayyo ha'nokanna aaxxine okkone manjichchiba kexxine ille iima higge. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Wele ha'nooka dayyonnaa Biiniyaamii aaxxine daggino'aa duuchchiinxa dande'aak Mageni ifixxe marartenni ookkone manjichchik godoba ha'no'aa shaqishowwaal! Akimagaada oose anxa gophonnolenna maassaanne gophe'e gatunnun» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Insa'enna eettene uwwanna lame anga okkone birretika sibljonna Biiniyaamii adhdhineexxi aade Gibtse me'ine; Yooseefi edonna shinqe. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Yooseefinna Biiniyaami insa'nenni welti hedheexxa afeexxi okkone ifike minika ajajallo, «Konnee manna mine aniba iyyemari; telcho barra dhiyaana aninni welti indammaxxee dulde qophpheessi» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Manjichchikinna Yooseefi iso'n kulemmashshanni manna Yooseefike mine'n iyyemare. <verse eid="GEN 43:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Insa'nenna Yooseefike miniba dangee wodda, «No'o kabaa dangennechchi, edii miila kaba dange hinganno wodda ifixxe qalqallo no'oxxi giddo higeeke birretike sibljixxe buuto'aaten; yoona no'oo manjichchi rakkisa; harre no'oxxanna no'onaa'n adhdheexxi no'oo garbake assedha» hina'n sodaante.<verse eid="GEN 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Insa'nenna Yooseefike minike ajajalliba marreexxi baxxe isike minixxe'n iso'n hinee qici, <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />«No'oke gootta sire midha hidhdhinonnaa kaba dangeennan. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Yaane kinni ille iima hingennexxi galleneba ififixxa qalqallo tilqinanno wodda no'o mitti mittingixxe qalqallo giddo afo'oke'ni hedhe hedheeshshanni no'ok birretik sblji guduunfemee hedhenaa anfennen. Ta'a kunnise ookko birretika sbljo ille iima hiissinee aa'ne iyyedangeennen. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Ta'anna midha hidhdhinonna'a wele birretika sibljo iyyedaqineennen; edi wodda no'oo mitti mittingika birretka sibljo qalqallo no'o mitti mittingixxi giddo wirri asseexxi uggeek ayyete kadeexxa egennebo'non» hine.<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Isike minik ajajallinna, «Nage'i ha'no'a kadowwaal; sodaatinoqqe'e; ha'nookinnaa anna ha'nookik Mageni okkone maallaqa ha'noo mitte mittingixxe qalqallo giddo ha'no'a ugge'een; ha'nook birretik siblji eddonni ane'n geyedheen» hiyye. Ookkoneechchi uduma Simoonii gadho insa'neeba iyyedage.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Minik ajajallinna ookkonee manna Yooseefike mine'n iyyemare; wodeekanna insa'ne'a uwwee'naa lekka anshe'ne; harre insa'nexxenna oka'a uwwe. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Barra saafo'a Yooseefinni welt dhiyaana okko inda'neexxa lanqemmaxxee Yooseefi dagaa qico'n isi'a uunaaxxa uwwa qixxeessine.<verse eid="GEN 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Yooseefinna mini'a e'yee wodda iyyedangemmaxxa uwwa isi'a uune, butti'aanna heeshshineexxi isoo ulfeessine. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Yooseefinna insa'nee nage'a aadheechchi uduma, «Ikki ane'n kuldinemmak geerchi, anni ha'nook nage'aangee? Lubbo hedhenni hedhee?» Hiyye insa'ne qore.<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Insa'nenna, «Anni no'ok atik erganji, nage'angen lubbondinni hedheen» hineexxi hiissine haasonne; iso'o ulfeessatee butti'a heeshshi hine.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Yooseefi tama asse uudaa wodda godobika dayyo Biiniyaamii afe ke'eexxi, «Ane'n kuldinemmak ikki ha'nook maa'ni dayyi konnetee?» Hiyye insa'nee qore; Biiniyaaminna «Anke belto Mageni atee eebbiso!» Hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Yooseefinna dayyo ifika uudee wodda ha'nurat isoo mararemmaxxee rake insa'ne edii'ni me'eexxi ifixxe kuta giddo e'ye oodhe.<verse eid="GEN 43:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Alba anshedheechchi uduma fule dage; ifinna jabeesseexxi «ita shiqquun» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 43:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Yooseefi'a qofinni shiqinshe; dayyuwwa isekenna qofinni shiqinshe; iittanni Gibtsek manni Ibiritotike manninni welt ita diqachchiissammaxxee isinni welt itammake Gibtsek manni'a qofinni shiqinshe. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Yooseefik dayyuwwi ifixxe ilemiinxe wogaxxe aanteshshanni angafakenaa'n maa'ni qico'n Yooseefi edo ofo'leemman; insa'nenna saadinoti weli weli uunde. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Yooseefi'a shiqqeexxe itanaa'n aadhenda'n insa'nee mitte mittengee uwwendaa wodda Biiniyaamik qoobbi weliinkenaa'n onde anga caale'emman; insa'nenna konne qicinni Yooseefinni welti inde; dheebo fullaa qico'ninna ha'wine.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s1">Birretike Sibljixxi Buuda Qalqallo Giddo Afende</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yooseefi ifike minika ajajallo hiyyee ajajee qici, «Mitte mittingee konne mannixxi qalqallo aaxxaa qico midha itti wonshi; mitte mittingika birretika sibljonna qalqallo anni anniniinxi giddo ofooke'n uggir. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Birretike sibljixxa anxa buudanna maa'nichchi beltixxe qalqallo giddo midha hidhdho'a iyyedaqqemmake birretike sibljinni welt ugge» hiyye. Isinna Yooseefi hiyyemmashshanni asse.<verse eid="GEN 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Gorsa boro haachchabbaa wodda dayyuwwi insa'neexxe harrenninni me'inaashsha assemme. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Qachchi giddii'n lumo qico bayyante me'inebaangi Yooseefi ifike minika ajajallo hiyyee qici, «Konne manna kexxe hordoffe, dhaqqabbettexxi, ‹Eloxxixxa bado mayee elobaaxxa hiissitine?› <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Kunni gootti anki isenaa'ni ha'wa'neexxe, sho'ondeexxa yaanenna isenni ege'na'neexxe buudabaata? Tinni assitineexxi yaane hara fuggoxxen» insa'ne'n hite kuli.<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Isike minik ajajallinna insa'nee dhaqqaabeexxi hiyyendemmaxxa hexxeeshshanni insa'nenni haaso'e. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Insa'neenna iso'ni hinee qici, «No'oke goottaa! Iitta hexxeexxa yaane ati maaye haasottaatte? Tenne hiyyendeexxa yaane assa no'o atike erganjuwwanaa'ni ise bayyatto'o. <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Konneechchi edo qalqalluwwa no'oxxi giddo afo'oke'n hedhee'naa anfenneka birretika sibljo Kenaanike boginaa'n midde ati'a hiissinee iyyedangenen; ta'ata no'o birretika sibljo yookaan worqe atike goottike minenaa'n mayeeta moorranno? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />No'oo atike erganjuwwi giddii'n kunni miyi mitteke'ninna afemoole ikki manji shiyemmowwaal; no'o gantenekinna atee anke goottike garba kandannon» hine. <verse eid="GEN 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Isinna, «Eloxxe, hitineeshshanni kadduun; yaane kinni tinni buuda afendeeki manji anke garba kadaan; weli gattineek tenne balleessanaa'n qullo fuldinaan» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Tennexxee mitti mittingi manji rake qalqallo ififixxa dirriseexxi afo'o tike. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yooseefik erganji angafakenaa'n maa'nii qico'n duuchchiingixxa qalqallo giddo buuda findige hase; buudatinna Biiniyaamixxe qalqallo giddo afende. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Eettene yanna'n Yooseefik dayyuwwi yaaddoti seemma ifi ifixxa daddare; ifi fixxa qalqallonna ifi ifixe harre'n fe'ee'neexxi qachchiinba ille iima hinge.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Yihudanna dayyuwwi isik Yooseefibaa hinge dangaa wodda Yooseefi okko minenni hedhemman; insa'nenna isi edo wabbi hine. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Yooseefinna insa'nee, «Mayee iitta hexxeexxa yaane assitine? Anishsha hedheek manji buqo yaane afaaxxa ege'na afaaxxa egendineebaa?» Hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Yihudanna, «Atee anke gootta'n maa hine haasonnannota? Tenne balleesannaa'ni ifi qulloonsatee haasonnannok haaso'i hoonte habadheta? Mageni no'oo atike erganjuwwixxa balleessa farri asse'een; yoona buuda itti afendeeke manjo calla kadebaangi no'o duuchchiingi atee anke goottike garbuwwan» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Yooseefinna, «Tinne haranga assannoxxe yaanebaan; garba anke kadaak buuda anxi itti afeendeeke manjo callanni; weli gatineek ha'no ha'nook anniba nage'ik me'e» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Yihudanna Yooseefibaa shikki hiyyeexxi, «Anke gootta mitte yaane calla haaso'onna laqi; ati Feri'oonishshanni ulfichcha manjo kaddeettexxe maganneten anee garbichcho atike'ni mufattoxxe'e. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Anke gootta ati, ‹Anna yookaan wele dayyo affinee?› Hite no'o atika erganjuwwa qorteettan. <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />No'onna ‹Eeti, cimeeke anna anfeennen; isinna cimo giddo i'leeka mitte maa'na belto afe'een; konne beltik godobi dayyinna reyedheen; amatee gate'eke iso mitte callan; annikinna isoo yo'oshsha eeyyaan› hineennan. <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Ookkoneechchi uduma atinna erganjuwwa atika no'oo, ‹Isoo uudonnaa aniba'a iyyedagge› hitette. <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />No'onna ‹Belti anna waale daga dande'abaan; waale dagoole kinni anni isiki reya reyaan› hinee gootta no'oke ate'ni kulleenan. <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Ati kinni no'oo atika erganjuwwa, ‹Ha'nook dayyi maa'ni ha'nonni daga gopheexxe kaddoole ani edo shiqqinoqqe'e› hitette.<verse eid="GEN 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />«No'onna atika garba, anke anniba'a ille iima hingennexxa yanna ati gootti ank hitettexxa iso'n kullen. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Ookkoneechchi uduma anni no'ok, ‹Illee iima higgineexxi heenooxxa midha no'aa hirre› hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />No'onna, ‹Mara dandenabe'no; mara dandennannok dayyi no'ok maa'ni, no'onni welt me'a'nole callan; maa'ni no'oki dayyi no'onni welt me'a gophpha'noole okkone manjichchi edo shiqa dandeennabe'non› hinenne.<verse eid="GEN 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />«Anni ank garbichchi atik no'o'n hiyyee qici, ‹Are anxi lame labbaxxa oose ani'a ildeexxa egendine'en. <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Konne laminaa'n mitti anenaa'n fuleeshsha gatee'naa, «Biniinchi isoo ite'een» hiyyenneni; telchi qico'ninna iso'o afebe'non. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Ta'a kinni konne belto anenaa'n aaxxine me'itinee'naa mitte miitaxxi yaane iso'n geltoole, anee cimo giddo yaaddoti reyannoshsha assitinaan› hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />«Ta'anna anna anka atike garbichchibaa illee iima higanno wodda, beltichchi no'onni welt hedha gophpha'noole isoo lubbo ifixxishsha eeyyaammaxxee reyaan. <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />No'onna, anna no'oka cimo giddo yaaddoti reyaashsha assinenneshshaten. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Atik garbichchi aninna anke anna'n, ‹Belto atika illee iima hiisse ati'a iyyedaga gophphonnole baro anke duuchcha'n ati edo aallatema'n hedhunnuni› hiyye beltiinka annooma adhdhenen.<verse eid="GEN 44:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />«Tennexxe ta'a ani atik garbichchi beltiinxa bado garba atike kade kaba gato; belti kinni dayyuwwa ifikenni welti illee iima higowwaal. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Hitta konne belto waale anke anniba ille iima hige me'annota? Anke anna'n geltaxxa rakko abboo uudonnoqqe'e» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s1">Yooseefi Ayyumma Ifixxa Dayyuwwa Ifike'n Ca'asse Kule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Yooseefinna isi bira hedhemmake manni duuchchi edo ossa gopheexxi, «Kaba hedheeka manna duuchcha ani edii'n gadhi'aa fulche» hiyye ajaje. Tennexxe Yooseefi ayyumma ifixxa dayyuwwa ifike'n ca'a asse kulee wodda mittikinna Gibtsek manji isinni welt hedhemmabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:13">Erga. Huj. 7:13</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Yooseefinna hafuura gikki asse oodha'naa Gibtsek manninna laqe; tenne yaanexxi odonna Feri'oonik mini hadi laqe.<verse eid="GEN 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Yooseefinna dayyuwwa ifike'n «Ani Yooseefiten; anni ank lubbo hedhenni hedhee?» hiyye insa'ne qore. Dayyuwwi isik kinni isoo sodaate culphiseemmaxxee'e iso'ni hiissichcho uwwa dande'ebaan.<verse eid="GEN 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Yooseefinna dayyuwwa ifika, «Amme ani biri'a shikki hiyye» hiyye. Insa'nenna isibaa shikki hine wodda isi hiyyee qici, «Ani Gibtseke manna'ni gurgudhitineemmake ha'nooke dayyo Yooseefiten! <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Ta'atenna kaddoole anee gurgurtineemmaxxee'e yaadinoqqe'e, bojogendinoqqe'e; Mageni hedho anjiro'a ha'no'a edisexxi kaba anee ergee'en. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Bogake'n solo'i e'yeexxenni ta'a lame wogga kade'en; ookkoneechchi uduma wiilsinabaaxinnaa midha haa'mine bukki assinabaaxxi onde wogga edi'a hexxeen. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Yaane kinni Mageni buttate'n hafe ha'noxxi gattaashshannaa hedho ha'nooxxi baxxabaashsha lumoxxe anjirenni ha'noo anjiro'a anee ediseexxi kaba ergeen.<verse eid="GEN 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />«Tennexxee anee kaba'a ergeek Magenoke malee ha'notebaan; isi anee Feri'ooni'a anniinsha, mini hadi duuchchike gootta, iittanni Gibtseke bogi duuchchike galchalloke asse. <verse eid="GEN 45:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />Ta'a tennee rakkine anna ankibaa illee iima higgineexxi iso'ni, ‹belti atik Yooseefi hiyye'eeni hitinaa qici: Mageni anee Gibtseka boga duuchchika gootta asse'en; tennexxee turtebexxongi anba dag. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Oose atixxa, atixxe oosexxa oose, gedhebo, re'e, lalokanna hortettechcho duuchcha adhdhitettexxi loola anke'n Geesemi hexxatton. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Ookkonna, edi'a daga'neexxi onde solo'iinxi wogga hexxemmaxxee hassissaaxxa ani ha'no'a uwwannon; iitta kada gophphoole kinni ate'n, atek mini hado'ninna ati horattettechcho duuchcha'n rakko geltaan.›<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />«Ha'nooke albi edo hedhe ha'noonni haaso'aanneki ante Yooseefite kadeennexxa ha'noonna kadi godobika anka dayyo Biiniyaamii'i uudina'neen. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Gibtseke boga'ni afeenneka ulfinna duuchchanna uuddineexxa yaane duuchcha anna anke'n kulle; anna ankanna rakkine kabaa iyyedagge.»<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma isi dayyo ifike Biiniyaamike gooba'ni marxeme'e oodhe; Biinyaaminna oodha'n Yooseefi'i hanqalfe. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Isi mitte mittinga ifika dayyuwwanna sunqedha'n oodhe; ookkoneechchi uduma dayyuwwikinna isinni welti haaso'a safe.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Yooseefike dayyuwwixxi daga Feri'oonike mootummatike mine'n laqendee wodda Feri'ooninna isik ja'labuwwi duuchchi gammade. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Feri'ooninna Yoosefi'n, «Atik dayyuwwa'n hitato qici, ‹Harre ha'nooxxa fe'exxine Kenaanike bogibaa illee iima higge. <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />Anna ha'nokanna mini hado ha'nooka aniba iyyedagge; aninna ookkone shamoke Gibtseke bogana'ni ha'no'a uwwannon; ha'nonna ookkone shamoke bogina'ni geltaaxxa karra alfitine gammadina'ni hexxinaan.›<verse eid="GEN 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />«Iittanni insa'ne hite ajajjatto qici, ‹Ha'noxxe aruwwanni ha'nooxxe oose'a Gibtseke boginaa'n fadhadiinxa gaare adhitneexxi, anna ha'nokanna aaxxine dagge. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Gibtseke bogik elo elochchi duuchchi ha'noochcho kadeemmaxxee'e afine'eeke miyixxee mittilchonna yaandoqqe'e.› »<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Isira'eelixxi labbaxxi oosenna hiyyendemmashshanni assite; Yooseefinna insa'ne'a Feri'ooni ajajemmashshanni fadhadiinxa gaarenna gala'a orakee uwwe. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Insa'ne mitti mittengee lame lame haarooxxa jijjiidhdhinaaxxa seemma uwwe; Biiniyaami'a kinni onde haarooxxa jijjiidhdhaaxxa seemmanna sase dhibba birreti sibljo uwwe. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Anna ifikeenna Gibtse bogichcho elo elochcho tomme harre'n, iittanni oriinxe gala'a annakee midha, xaltakkanna wele sagale tomme meyyaxxe harre'n fe'ise erge. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Ookkoneechchi uduma dayyuwwa ifikanna me'inaashsha asseexxi, «Orake'n lolendinoqqe» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Insa'nenna Gibtseke boganaa'n fulleexxi anna insa'neeke Ya'iqoobiba Kanaan dange. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Insa'nenna annake'n «Yooseefi lubbo hedheen; Gibtseke bogi duuchchike galchallo kade'een» hine. Ya'iqoobinna alayye qexerri hiyye; hineexxanna addate'emmabaa. <verse eid="GEN 45:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Yaane kinni Yooseefi insa'ne'n kuleexxa duuchcha iso'n kullee woddanna Yooseefi isoo Gibtse'a iyyemarro'a ergemmaxxa fadhadiinxa gaarruwwa uudee wodda anna insa'nekiki Ya'iqoobik irre haarro'me. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eel, «Belti ank Yooseefi lubbondinni hedheen shene'e; reyebe'nongi mare ille anxenninni isoo uudo» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobi Gibtse'a Me'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Ya'iqoobinna afeechcho duuchcha adhdhe ke'e; Bersaabehi geyee wodda anna ifike Yisaaqike Mageni'a tolcha tolche.<verse eid="GEN 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Mageninna hashsha waleellati Isira'eeli'n leelleexxi, «Ya'iqoobi! Ya'iqoobi» hiyye ye'e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">Isinna, «Hee! Kunna'a kabanni hedhennen» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Mageninna iso'oo hiyyee qici, «Ani atike annike Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Magenoni; ati Gibtse'a me'a sodaattoxxe'e; ani atee ookko lumoke arda assannon. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Ani Gibtse'a atinni welti me'annon; ookko'ninna illee iima hiisse atee iyyedagannon; Yooseefinna ati bira hedhe haqaqaa'naa rertatton» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ya'iqoobi Bersaabehinaa'n ke'e; Isira'eelixxi labbaxxi oosenna anna ifika Ya'iqoobii ifixxa oosenna ifixxa aruwwa Feri'oon anna insa'neeke Ya'iqoobi'a ergemmaxxe fadhadiinxe gaarruwwa'n ofo'linshe. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Anfemmaka horenna Kenaanike boga'n horantemmaxxa karra adhdhineexxi Ya'iqoobinna horte isixxi duuchcha Gibtse'a me'ine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Erga. Huj. 7:15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />Ya'iqoob Gibtse'a me'eek ifixxa labbaxxa oosennaa tenne oosexxa labbaxxa oose, ifixxe meyyaxxa oosenna tenne oosexxa meyyaxxa oose adhdhe me'e; tinninna horte ifixxa duuchcha hiyyoten.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Gibtse'a me'iteexxi Isira'eelixxe oosek summi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 46:8">Ya'iqoobik angafi belti Roobeel.<verse eid="GEN 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Roobelixxi labbaxxi oose: Heenooki, Feluuso, Hatsirooninna Kermiten.<verse eid="GEN 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Simoonixxi labbaxxi oose: Yimu'eel, Yaamiin Oohaad, Yaakiin, Tsohaarinna Kenaanichcho ildeek Sa'uuliten.<verse eid="GEN 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Leewwixxa labbaxxi oose: Gershoon, Qe'aatinna Meraariten.<verse eid="GEN 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Yihudaxxi labbaxxi oose: Eeri, Onaane, Seela, Faareesinna Zaarahiten. Yaane kinni Eerinna Onaane Kenaaanike bogi giddo renne. Faaresixxi labbaxxi oose Hedironna Hamulitemman.<verse eid="GEN 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Yisakoorixxi labbaxxi oose: Toola, Faawa, Yoobinna Shiimirooniten.<verse eid="GEN 46:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Zabilonixxi labbaxxi oose: Sereddi, Elooninna Yahili'eeliten.<verse eid="GEN 46:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Tinni labbaxxi oosenna Diina hiyyendaxxa belto Ya'iqoobi Mesiphexoomiya hedhemma wodda Liya isi'a ildeexxe oosen. Duuchchinxe isixxe labbaxxenna meyyaxxe oosek laakkossi sase tommenna sasekemman.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Gaadixxi labbaxxi oose: Tsifoon, Haagi, Shuni, Eetsiboon, Eeri, Arodinna Ari'eelitemman.<verse eid="GEN 46:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Aseerixxi labbaxxi oose: Yiimina, Yesuwwa, Yesuwwinna Beri'aaten. Dayyo insa'nexxinna Seraahiten.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 46:17">Berii'aaxxi labbaxxi oose: Hebeerinna Melkii'eeliten.<verse eid="GEN 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Tinni tommenna jaane oose Laaba belto ifixxe Liya'a uwwemmaxxi Zilifaan Ya'iqoobi'a ildeexxe oosen.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Ya'iqoobi are ifixxe Raaheelinaa'n Yooseefinna Biiniyaami'i i'le.<verse eid="GEN 46:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Yooseefi Gibtseke bogi giddo Minaasenna Efireemi i'le; isinna insa'nee Heliyootu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">46:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Holiyopoliisii'i leellishaan.</char></note> hiyyemmake qachchika qeesichcho Pheexxifaaraxxa belto Asinaatinaa'n i'leexxen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:50-52">41:50-52</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Biiniyaamixxi labbaxxi oose: Beela'i, Bekeer, Ashibeel, Geera, Na'imaan, Eehi, Rooshi, Muufeemi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 46:21">Huufiimiinna Arditen.<verse eid="GEN 46:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Tinni tommenna shoole oose Ya'iqoobi Raaheelinaa'n i'leexxe oosennaa oosetixxe oosen.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Daanik beltinna Hushimiten.<verse eid="GEN 46:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Nefitaaleemixxi labbaxxi oose: Yahitsi'eel, Guni, Yetseerinna, Shileemiten.<verse eid="GEN 46:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Tinni torbaane oose duuchchiinxi, Laaba belto ifixxe Raaheeli'a uwwemmaxxi, Baala Ya'iqoobi'a ildeexxen.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Ya'iqoobinni welt Gibtse'a me'eek isike gudeedanaa'n fuleek manni, isixxe oosexxe aruwwa gahi darre, jaane tommenna jaaneten. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Yooseefi Gibtse boga'n i'leexxe lame oosenni mitteba Gibtse'a me'eeke Ya'iqoobike mini hadik laakkossi torbaane tommemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Erga. Huj. 7:14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 46:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Isinna Gesemi me'atee akeette adhdho'a Yihuda'a ediseexxi Yooseebaa erge; insa'nenna Geesemi genne. <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yooseefinna ifixxe fadhadiinxe gaare'n gulfeexxi anna ifika Isira'eeli'i qophedho'a Geesemi me'e; Yooseefi anna ifikiba geyeeshshanni gooba isike'n marxemeexxi qeeraaxxa yanna oodhe.<verse eid="GEN 46:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Isira'eelinna Yooseefii, «Lubbondinni hexxee'naa ille anxenni uudennechchinni yoona reyonnolenna shene'ee!»<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yooseefi ifika dayyuwwanna ifike annika mini hado hiyyee qici: «Ani Feri'ooniba ale marennexxi iso'n hiyye haaso'a noqici: ‹Kenaaan hedhemmak dayyuwwi ankinna anke annik mini hadi aniba dange'een. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Insa'nenna hore alla'laa mannan; insa'ne dangee wodda hore gedhebo ifika re'e ifixxa lalo ifika, iittanna wele anfeechcho duuchcha iyyedaqqine'een.› <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Feri'ooninna ha'noo ye'iseexxi, ‹Huje ha'nooxxi maachcho?› Hiyye ha'noo qoraan, <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />ha'nonna, ‹No'o atik erganjuwwi huje no'oxxi no'oke annuwwishshanni oosummandenaa'n hore horachchoten› hiyye. Gibtsek manni hore horataaka manna diqataammaxxee'e, Geesemi hexxino'a eetti'i ha'no'a uwwaan.»<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Yooseefinna mareexxi Feri'ooni'n hiyyee qici, «Ank anninna anke dayyuwwi, ifika gedhebonna ifixxa re'e, iittanni anfeechcho duuchcha iyyedaqqineexxi Kenaanike boginaa'n dangeexxi Geesemi he'neen» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Ifike dayyuwwi giddii'ninna onde fileexxi insa'nee Feri'oon edo shiqishe.<verse eid="GEN 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Feri'ooninna Yooseefika dayyuwwa, «Huje ha'nooxxi maachcho?» Hiyye insa'nee qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Insa'nenna Feri'ooni'n, «No'o atik erganjuwwi no'oke annuwwishshanni horeke horantannoke mannani» hine hiissine haasonne. <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Higgeenni insa'nee Feri'ooni'n «Kenaanike boga'n solo'i hara bira sa'ee'naa gedhebo no'okeenna re'e no'oxxee badda'a gophendeemmaxxee'e yannatee kaba he'nonnaa dangeennen; tennexxee ta'a no'o atik erganjuwwi Geesemi he'nanooshsha atee kadhantaannee» hine.<verse eid="GEN 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Feri'ooninna Yooseefii hiyyee qici, «Anni atikinna dayyuwwi atik atiba dagedheen, <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Gibtsek bogi duuchchi atixxe anga'n hedheen; atika annannaa atika dayyuwwa konne bogi giddo eloke booncho'n he'naashsha assi; Geesemi he'nowwaal; insa'ne giddii'n gargar hexxeexxa ege'na afeeka egendottole anke hori'a umo allalsano assite hariir.»<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yooseefi anna ifika Ya'iqoobi'i Feri'oonba iyyemarre; Ya'iqoobinna Feri'ooni'i eebbise. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Feri'ooninna Ya'iqoobii, «Wogga atixxi me'ete?» Hiyye isoo qore.<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Ya'iqoobinna Feri'ooni'i hiyyee qici: «Ani bogakenaa'n boga mammarema'n turennexxi dhibbanna sase tomme woggan; tinninna annuwwi no'ok bogakenaa'ni boga mammarema'ni turreexxe wogguwwanni qixxoottaabaaxxennaa rakko callixxen» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ya'iqoobi Feri'oon eebbiseexxi Feri'oon edii'n fule mee.<verse eid="GEN 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Yooseefinna anna ifikanna dayyuwwa ifika Gibtseke boga'n he'naashsha asse; Feri'ooni ajajemmashshanni Gibtse bogika eloka booncho, Ramse giddo insa'ne'a qadaachche uwwe. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Yooseefinna anna ifikee dayyuwwa ifikeenna ifike annike mini hadi duuchchi'a insa'nexxe ooseke laakkossixxe qixxe'n midha insa'ne'a uwwendaashsha asse.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solo'iinxa Yanna Yooseefixxa Galcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Butta duuchcha'n midha hedha gophphemmaxxee solo'i jabaata'n mee; tennenaa'n kexxeexxa Gibtsekinna Kenaanik ardi solo'ik lumoshsha miidhemeemman. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Yooseefi Gibtsek arda'ninna Kenaanike arda'n midha gurgurndemmaka maallaqa duuchcha bukki asseexxi Feri'oonike maallaqiinke mine'n aasse.<verse eid="GEN 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Gibtsekinna Kenaanik arduwwik maallaqi mudee wodda Gibtseki ardi duuchchi Yooseefiba dageexxi, «Midha no'aa uwwi maallaqa bidhine'ennen; ati uuda'naa mayeeta rennanno?» Hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yooseefinna, «Hore ha'nooka iyyedagge; maallaqi ha'nook mudeechchinni ha'nooke horixxa bado midha ha'no'a uwwannon» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Insa'nenna hore ifika Yooseefiba iyyedange; isinna insa'neeke fadhadixxa, insa'neeke gedhebixxa, insa'neexxe re'exxa, insa'neke lalixxannaa insa'neexxe harrexxa bado midha insa'ne'a uwwe; isinna eettene wogga duuchcha insa'neeke horixxa bado midha insa'ne'a uwwe.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Itti wogga muddeechchi uduma langaxxe wogga'n ardi Yooseefibaa dageexxi iso'n hiyyee qici, «No'o atee gootta no'oka sho'nannolchi mittilchinna hedhebaan; maallaqi no'oki mudeedheen; hore no'okanna ati'anni uunenneni; atee gootta no'okee boga no'okannaa umo no'oke kadoole malee mittechchi hedheba'a. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />No'ota ati ille atixxe'n uuddaa'na'a mayee mundannota? Bogi no'okita mayee ba'a? No'oonna fichcha no'oka adhdhitettexxi midha no'o'a uwwi; no'o Feri'oon garba kandunnun; fichchi no'okinna isike kaduun; no'o renabe'noshsha bogi no'okinna urmake kadabaashsha sanne no'a uwwi» hine.<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Tennexxee Yooseefii Gibtseka boga duuchcha Feri'ooni'a hire; solo'iinxe jabaatanaa'n kexxeexxa Gibtsek manni duuchchiingi ifi fika boga gurgure; kogi duuchchinna Feri'oonike kade. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Yooseefinna Gibtseke boga'n gabalatenaa'n gabalati qico'n hedheeka arda duuchcha Feri'oonike garba asse. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Yooseefi hirebaangi gateek qeesooletike boga callamman; tennexxi buutonna qeese gatabelo murendeexxa ita Feri'ooninaa'n alfitaammaxxeeten, Feri'ooninna eettene murendeexxi ita gatabelo insa'ne'a uwwammaxxeeten; tennexxee insa'ne boga ifi fika gurgudhdhineemmabaan.<verse eid="GEN 47:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Yooseefinna ardake'n hiyyee qici, «Ani telcho ha'nonna boga ha'nooka Feri'ooni'a hireennaxxee tenne sanne adhdhitineexxi boga ha'nooke'n facaalse. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Iitti midhanna aaggaaxxe yanna'n, onde anganaa'n mitte anga Feri'ooni'a uutinaan; gatteexxe onde angaxxa shoole anga kinni fichchiinxe sanne'a, ha'no'a, oose ha'noxxeenna ha'nooke mini hadi duuchchi'a itate assedhdhe» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Insa'nenna, «No'oke gootta, ati no'o anjirteetten; atee gootta no'oke'n elle alfinennechchinni Feri'oonike garba kandannon» hine. <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Konne qicinni Yooseefii eettene aaggaaxxe midhaxxe onde anganaa'n mitte anga Feri'ooni'a uwwendaashsha ajajaaka bogiinka seera ugge; kunni seeri telchi qico'n hujamate'n hedheen. Ookkonee wodda Feri'oonixxe anga'n sa'ebaak gateek bogi qeesetike callamman. <verse eid="GEN 47:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Isira'eelik ardinna Gibtse bogi giddo Geesemi hiyyemaake booncho'n hedhe'nemman; ookko insa'ne lumoxxa karra horante; horre; laakkossi insa'nekinna hara bira sa'e.<verse eid="GEN 47:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Ya'iqoobinna Gibtse tommenna torbaane wogga ofo'le; wogga isixinna dhibbanna shoole tommenna torbaane woggamman. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Isira'eelinna reyaaxxi barra shiqqee wodda belto ifika Yooseefii ye'iseexxi iso'n hiyyee qici, «An ate'n elle alfo'onnole anga atixxa anke guudeedixxe oddo'n uggitettexxi atixxa jalalanna adatema atixxa ani'a leellishati Gibtse bogi giddo ane mooggaboxxoshsha anee addachchiisi. <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Aninna anke annuwwishsha lumedhanno wodda Gibtseke boginaa'ni fulchiteettexxi insa'neeke mooggi bira anee moogi» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Yooseefinna, «Eloxxen hitetteshshanni assannon» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:6">50:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Ya'iqoobinna, «Tenne assitattoxxa ani'a kakat» hiyye. Yooseefinna isi'aa kakate; Isira'eelinna taqeti hana hedheexxi heeshshi hiyye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookaan </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Isira'eeli taqeti hana hedheexxi sagade</char></note> hiyya'ni Duuchchi Woddika Gootta galateefate.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s1">Eefireemiinna Minaasee'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Tinni yaanuwwa kaddeechchi uduma, anniinxi elagonphe Yooseefi'n kulendee wodda, Yooseefi lamiinxa ifixxa oose Minaasennaa Efireemii'i adhdhe me'e. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Ya'iqoobi'n, belti isik Yooseefi dageexxa iso'n kulendee wodda Ya'iqoobinna ifi jabeesseexxi taqeti hana ofo'le.<verse eid="GEN 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Ya'iqoobinna Yooseefi'i hiyyee qici, «Duuchchiinxa dande'aaki Mageni Kenaani boga'n Looza hiyyendaaxxe bakka'n ane'n leelle eebbiseexxi, <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />anee hiyyee qici, ‹Hortattoshsha atee assannon; laakkossa atikanna bira sa'issannon; heddo arduwwixxe assannon; konne boganna atibaa uduma daggaaxxe atixxe horte'a duuchchi woddi'a qadaada asse inssa'ne'a uwwannon› hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:13-14">28:13-14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />«Ani kaba dagebe'no edi darre Gibtse i'litettexxi atixxi lame oose ta'anni edi'a insa'ne anxe ooseshsha uudendaan; ani'a Efireeminnaa Minaase oose anxe Roobelishshanna Simoonishshaten. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Insa'ne udumii'n i'litattoxxi oose kinni attinxe; yaane kinni insa'ne qadaada alfinaak dayyuwwa ifike Eefireemikenninnaa Minaaseke summinniten. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Aninna Mesipheexoomii'n higa'n Efiraataa geyona'a shiixxoobi gataa wodda ama atixxi Raaheeli Kenaan boga'n rerte'naa yaadennen. Aninna Eefiraata'a me'ammake ori qarqara ise moogenne» hiyye. (Eefiraata tinni telcho Beetelihemi hiyyemaake boonchon.)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:16-19">35:16-19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Isira'eelinna Yooseefixxa oose afeexxi «Kunni ayyeera?» Hiyye isoo qore.<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yooseefinna anna ifike'n «Tinni Magen kaba ani'a uwweexxe oosen» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Isira'eelinna, «Eebbisonnaa ani biri'a insa'nee shikki assi» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Ookkone wodda Isira'eeli cimotenaa'n kexxeexxa ille isixxi gophpheemmaxxee adda afeemmabaan; tennexxee Yooseefi oose ifixxa anniiba shikki asse; anni isikinna insa'nee sunqedhe hanqalfe. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Ya'iqoobinna Yooseefii, «Ani atee langaxxa uudanno hiyye hedeennabaan; Mageni kinni atixxa oosenna anee uudiseen» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Yooseefinna oose ifixxa anniinke gulubonaa'n hoyyeexxi butti'a heeshi hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Yooseefi lamiinxa oose ifixxa aadheexxi Efireemii'i ifike middi darre'n Isira'eelinaa'n bita'i darre'n, Minaasee kinni ifike bita'i darre'n Isira'elinaa'n middi darre'n sa'isse uurrise. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Yaane kinn Isira'eeli ifixxa middixxa anga maa'nichcho belto Efireemike umi hana ugge; bita'ixxa anga ifixxa middixxe anga'ni qaxxamurseexxi angafa belto Minaaseke umi hana ugge.<verse eid="GEN 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Ookkenneechchi uduma Yoosefi'i hiyyeexxi eebbisee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">«Annuwwi anki Abirihaaminna Yisaaqi ora isike'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">hordonfeemmak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">Ani'aanna telchi qico'ni baro anke duuchcha'ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">allalisanjo anke kade hedho anxa duuchcha heqqeek Mageni,<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />Miidhensha duuchchinaa'ninni anee wodeek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">iimik erganji isi tennee oose eebbisowwaali.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Insa'nenna summa anekenni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">anke annuwwike Abirihaamikenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">Yisaaqike summinni ye'emmowwaali!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Buttate'ninna lumo qico horre birasa'nowwaal!»<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Yooseefinna ifike annixxa middixxa anga Efireemike umo'n uggee'naa uudeexxi yaade; tennexxee ifike annixxa middixxa anga Eefireemike umonaa'n hoyyeexxi Minaaseke umi hana uggo'a anniinxa anga abide. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Yooseefinna anna ifika, «Annayyo iittatebaani; angafi konnete kademmaxxee anga atixxa middixxa isike umo'ni uggi» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Anni isik kinni, «Ege'neennen; anke belto ege'neennen; isinnaqqa ardake kadaan; lumokenna kadaan; kaddo malee isiki maa'nichchi dayyi isonaa'n sa'eeke kadaan, horte isixxinna gosa gosake arduwwa kaddaan» hiyyeexxi gibe. <verse eid="GEN 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Isinna eettenee barra insa'nee eebbisee wodda hiyyee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:20">«Atike summinni Isira'eelik ardi iitta hiyye eebbisaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:20">‹Mageni ha'noo Efireemishshannaa Minaaseshsha assaan› hiyya'n eebbisaan» hiyye eebbise.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 48:20">Konne qicinni Ya'iqoobi'i Minaasenaa'n Eefireemi edo sa'isse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:21">Ibr. 11:21</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eeli Yooseefii, «Anni reyannoxxi yanna shiqqe'eni; yaane kinni Mageni ha'nonni welt hedhaan; ha'nooke annuwwike bogibaa ha'noo ille iima hiissaan. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Ani anke wolaantichchinninna anke mogidiinni Amooritotenaa'n adheenneka atike dayyuwwike qoobbinaa'n mitte anga sa'isse ati'a uwwennen.»<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobi Labbaxxa Oose Ifixxa Eebbise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Ookoneechchi uduma Ya'iqoobi ifixxa labbaxxa oose duuchcha ye'eexxi: «Udumii uduma mayi kadaaxxa ha'no'ni kulonna'a bukki hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />«Tee Ya'iqoobixxe oose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">bukki hitineexxi caqasse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">anni ha'nook Isira'eeli hiyya'neexxa caqasse.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />«Koo Roobeel, ati anke angafa belton,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">uduuda ankennaa ka'umumma anxike beesisan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:3">Ati ulfinnik caaldatton,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">hunnatinna saxxatton.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Ati wodiinsha daaqqattaxxee'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">angafumma ati'a kaddoqqe'e;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">Anna atikixxe taqe hana saxxetten,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">itille anxanna battoossitetten.<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />«Simooninnaa Leewwi godobi dayyuwwan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:5">wolaantichuwwi insa'nek xaqarotike miyani.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Insa'ne aareti ke'neexxi manna shinneemmaxxee'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">eeneeshsha jiboota mogolchineemmaxxee'e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">Mari'e insa'neexxe'ni ani e'yabe'non.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">Ya'a insa'neeke'ni ani afemabe'non.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Hara bubbeexxi aare insa'neexxi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">mararte affeebaaxxi jinne insa'neexxi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Badindeexxe kaddowwaal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Ya'iqoobi giddo insa'nee xexxeerannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">Isira'eel giddonna insa'nee xeellage bittinneessannon.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />«Koo Yihuda! Dayyuwwi atik atee saadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">anga atixxinna atike naaphika gooba huute abiddaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">atike annixxe oosenna ati edonna sagaddaan.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Koo neenqinke beltanjo Yihudaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">adamokenaa'n higgetteke anke beltoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">isi neenqiinsha gaadaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">Buttanna wexxi hiyyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">aateta mare iso'o dammassaak?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 24:9">Lak. 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:5">Wal. 5:5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Mootummatixxi bokko Yihudake minenaa'n fuladdabaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">galchatixxi siqqichchonna isike gudeedinaa'n;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">galchalloke kadeek dagaa qico</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">arduwwi duuchchi isi'a ajajemaan.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Harichcho ifika woyinetike hiddichcho'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">harretika beltanjonna weyinetike daalo'n usuraan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">Seemma ifixxa woyinetixxe bookanni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">fugataaka ejjanna woyinetike bulbulinni borcaan.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Ille isixxi woyinetixxe booka caala diimmateek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:12">isso isixxi adoti iimi darre golaalooxxe kaddaan.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />«Zabiloni, abbayyati qarqara hedhaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">qarqari isikinna lumolla hoboluwwa hafuura adhdhitaaxxe bakka kaddaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">hedhaake bogixxi gabala Siidoona qico'n geltaan.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />«Yisakoori fe'isiki diiphammake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:14">jabake miccike harrichchishshaten.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Yaane kinni hafuura adhdhaaxxi bakka eldoole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">hedhaaki bogi gammachchiisaake kadoole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">dugummo ba'otee giisedhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">garbiinshanna hunnatixxa huje hujaan.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />«Daani wele Isira'eelike gosatike minuwwinaa'n mittiinsha kadeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:16">ifike arda'ni muraan.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Daani ori qarqarik bofan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">weldeennatixxe buuten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">fadhado gulufeek udumi'a ibaashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">fadhadiinxa faana iddaan.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />«Mageno!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:18">Anjira atixxa heqqedhannon.<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />«Gaadi shitti miidhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:19">isi kinni faana insa'nexxa qore maree halo hiissaan.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />«Aseeri fichchi isiki misee'naa duroomaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:20">moyanjuwwakeenna kaddaaxxa ita shiqishaan.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />«Nefitaaleemi leexa wocca assendeexxe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:21">elolla beltanna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:21: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Elolla beltanna: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eloka haaso'a haaso'ate hiyyatenna kaddaan</char></note> ildammaxxe buddanneshshaten.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />«Yooseefii guma callike haqichchon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">wodi'iin qarqara kaasendeexxe woyinen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">dame isexxinna dalla'ake'ni daaldaan.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Naaphi isoo gabeti lolaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:23">jaba qicinninna isoo iddeen.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Yaane kinni jabake Ya'iqoobike Magenixxe hunnanni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">Allalisanjoke kadeek Isira'eelixxe rassan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">gabe isixxi udumi'a higgabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">hirre isixxinna jabaatteeshshanni hexxaan.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Atee gargaaraake atike annike Mageninni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">atee eebbisaake duuchchiinxa assa dande'aak Mageni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">ale iimi'ni afemaake gargaarsinni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">Buttii'ni dhi'motenaa'n afendaaxxe eebban</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">heddo oosenninna heddo horinni atee eebbisaaan.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Olmii'ni telchi qico'n hexxaaxxe koobuwwanaa'ninna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">duuchchiin wodda hexxaaxxe tulluwwanaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">afendaaxxe eloxxe yaane erra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">Atike annixxe eebba saxxaan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">Tinni eebba duuchcha Yooseefixxe kaddowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">Dayyuwwa ifikee umoke kadeek Yooseefi eebba tenne badhaadhowwaal.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />«Biiniyaami bultitaammaxxe yayyen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">adameechchonna gorsa itaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">booji'emalcho hashsha qoodemaan.»<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Yoona kunni tommenna lame Isira'eelike gosati minuwwan; anni insa'neeki insa'nee eebbisee wodda mitte mittengee kadaaka eebbatika haaso'a haaso'eek konne qicinniteman.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ya'iqoobixxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ya'iqoobi labbaxxa ifixxa oose hiyyeexxi ajajee qici: «Kunnise ani anke manniba'a me'anoxxi yanna gelte'een; tennexxee Hiititichcho Eefirooni fichcha'n hexxeexxe wolo'o giddo annuwwi anki bira anee moogge. <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />Tinni wolo'onna Kenaanike boga'n Maamiree'n boroti darre'n Maakifeela hiyyemaaba hexxeexxen; Abirihaaminna tinni wolo'o hexxeeka fichcha mooggiinxe booncho he'neek Hiititichcho Efiirooniten. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Abirihaaminna are isixxi Saara ookko moogemme'een; Yisaaqiinna Ribiqaa ookko moogemmeen; aninna Liya'a moogeneki ookkonden. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Fichchakanna wolo'o lamiingechcho mitteba hirreeki Heexxike mannanaa'niten» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Ya'iqoobinna konne haaso'a oose ifixxe'n haaso'e muuxeeshshanna hige ma'nate'n irkatemmamba lummedheexxi fike manniba'anna me'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Erga. Huj. 7:15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Yooseefinna anniinke renshi hana wabbi hiyyeexxi isoo sunqedha'n oodhe. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yooseefi anna isike Isira'eelik rensha foole ganabaashsha ci'leeyyete kadeek isik erganjuwwi qorsa itti issaashsha ajaje. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Ci'leeyyetinna rensha qorsik bassatee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">50:3 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Rensha bassa</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gibisteke mannixe aada'ni renshi aja ganebaangi turaashsha assateeten</char></note> shoole tomme barra adhdhite. Gibtsek manninna torbaane tomme barra duuchcha isi'a oodhe.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Oodhishshatixxi yanna saxxeechchi uduma Yooseefi Feri'oonika akeekisanjuwwa hiyyee qici: «Ha'nonaa'n elle alfaannole, moyanjoke'n ani'a <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />‹Anni anki reyo shiqee wodda Kenaanike boga'n ifi'a qixxesedheke hirreessa'n iso'o moogonna'a anee kakachchiise'en; tennexxee okko mare anna anka mooge higoo? Hiyye laqe'een› hitine iso'n kulle.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:29-31">47:29-31</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Feri'ooninna tenne laqeexxi, «Kakattettashshanni marte anna atika moogi» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Yooseefinna anna ifika moogo'a me'e; Feri'oonik ja'laabuwwi duuchchi moyati minik baallooma lumokik manni, iittanni Gibtseke bogik lumoke baalloomik manni Yooseefixxa duuka me'e. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Iittanni Yooseefik mini haduwwi, dayyuwwi isikinna weli anni isikik mini haduwwi duuchchi Yooseefinni welti me'e. Geesemi gateemmakiir insa'neexxe shiixxaramma oose, insa'neeke gedhebo, re'enna insa'neke lalo callamman. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Iittanni fadhadiinxa gaarruwanna fadhado gulufeemak manni isinni welti me'e; isinni welti me'eek mannik haagan lumo qico birasa'ekemman.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Insa'nenna Yordaanoosi wido Axaadi hiyyendaaxxe aldumeba gennee wodda humbaashshine hiiqqinse oo'ne; Yooseefinna ookko torbaane barra annakee gadde. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Ookko hedheek Kenaanik manni Axaadixxe aldume'n oo'neexxa oodhishsha uudeexxi, «Tinni Gibtsek manni'a laalafachchotixxe oodhishshan» hiyye. Tennexxee Yordaanoosi wido hedheeke boonchika summa Abeeli Mitsirayiim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">50:11: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Abeeli Mitsirayiim: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iitta hiyya Ibrititotike laagadinni Gibtseke mannixe oodhishsha hiyyaten</char></note> hiyyeme.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Ya'iqoobixxi labbaxxi oosenna insa'neek anni insa'nee ajajemmashsha assite. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Rensha isika Kenaanike boga'n iyyemarreexxi Maamiree'n boroti darre'n hedheeke Maakifeela hiyyendaaxxe bakka'ni hexxeexxe wolo'o'ni iso'o moonge; wolo'o tinninna Abirihaami Hiititichcho Eefirooninaa'n hireeke fichchi giddo hexxeexxen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:16">Erga. Huj. 7:16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Yooseefinna anna ifika moogechchi uduma dayyuwwa ifkenninna isinni isike annike mooggi'a isinni welti me'emmake manni duuchchinni welti Gibtse'a ille iima hige.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yooseefi Dayyuwwa Ifike'n Halo Fula'nebaaxxa Kokeesse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Yooseefiki dayyuwwi anni insa'neek reyee uduma weli'aanni weli, «Balleessinennexxe balleessanaa'n kexxeexxa Yooseefi godoba uggudheexxi halo no'o'n fulo'a maa kandanno?» Hine. <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Tennexxee insa'nee Yooseefibaa erga hineexxi erginee qici, «Anni atik reyeebaa edidarre hiyye ajajemma qici, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />Yoosefi'n hitinaa qici, ‹Dayyuwwi atiki ate'ni hujeexxa cubbonna balleesseexxa balleessa insa'ne'a gattowwaali hiyyi hiyyedheen› hitine iso'ni kulle. Ta'anna no'oo atike annike Mageniinke erganjuwwixxa cubbo no'aa gattowwaal hiyyi.» Erga insa'neexxi iso'n geltee wodda oodhe.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Ookkoneechchi uduma dayyuwwi isik dage'e isi edo butta wabbi hiyyeexxi, «No'o atike garban» hiyye.<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Yooseefi kinni insa'ne'n hiyyee qici, «Mee sodaatte! Sodaattinoqqe'e; ani Magenokebaan; <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />ha'no anee miidhatee'e heddinee assitineemman; Mageni kinni telcho uudina'nee qicishsha heddi mannixxa hedho anjironna'a eloxxee asse. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Ta'atenna kaddoole mee sodaatte; ha'no'aanna ha'nooxxe oose'a hasissaaxxa duuchcha ha'no'a assannon» hiyya'n kokeesseexxi eloke haaso'inni insa'nee haassosse.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yooseefixxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Yooseefi ifike annike mini haduwwinni welti Gibtse ture; dhibbanna tomme wogga offo'le. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Efireemixxe oosexxa oose sase ila qico uude; Minaaseka belto Makiirixxi oosenna ifixxishsha assedhe.<verse eid="GEN 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yooseefi dayyuwwa ifike'n «Yoona reyannoxxi yanna shiqqe'een; Mageni kinni gargaarsa ifikenni ha'noo uudeexxi konne boginaa'n ha'noo fulchaan; Abirihaami'a, Yisaaqi'aannaa Ya'iqoobi'a uwwo'a kakoti addachchiisemmake boga'n ha'noo aassaan» hiyye. <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Yoosefinna Isira'eelika manna, «Magen gargaarsa ifikenni ha'noo uudan; ookkone wodda miqe anxa konne boganaa'n aaxxine fulle» hiyya'n insa'nee kakachchiise.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:19">Fula. 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Iya. 24:32</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:32">Ibr. 11:32</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Yooseefinna ilemeexxe dhibbanna tomme wogga'ni lummedhe; rennishshi isikinna foole ganabaashsha ookkone bogixxe aadashsha qorsik bassineechchi uduma Gibtse boga'n saaxxine giddo uggine.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>